rd wallet and a soft wallet?\"],\"+jKIPo\":[\"Trezor Safe 5 features\"],\"+kXFUc\":[\"Is owning my own crypto too technical or complicated?\"],\"+mNwru\":[\"About us\"],\"+mVMeK\":[\"Refer a Friend and Get $20 - Secure Crypto with Trezor\"],\"+oB9C0\":[\"There are no such plans because we love cryptocurrencies, but even if we had to close down, there would be nothing to worry about. Trezor is compatible with other BIP32, BIP39, and BIP44 compatible wallets. In emergencies (although not recommended), it is possible to use the seed to recover your funds using a hot wallet. If Trezor did go out of business, neither your crypto nor your private and public keys would disappear.\"],\"+q7pHR\":[[\"averageDeliveryDays\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[[\"averageDeliveryDays\"],\" business day\"],\"other\":[[\"averageDeliveryDays\"],\" business days\"]}]],\"+qROBc\":[\"Other Bundles\"],\"+rZmr2\":[\"Delivery address\"],\"+roSdv\":[\"New Launch Alerts\"],\"+sP3ne\":[\"The payment for your order has already been processed. Please check your email for confirmation or contact support if you need further assistance.\"],\"+uc+Qw\":[\"Approve only the transactions you trust\"],\"+vHy0x\":[\"Supported on\"],\"/+FAZW\":[\"Official Trezor Amazon stores: This stock is supplied by us directly and kept separate so devices are not mixed with other goods:\"],\"/+jAoR\":[\"\u003c0\u003e\u003c1\u003eSecure Element chip\u003c/1\u003e\u003c/0\u003e (EAL6+ certified) provides tamper-resistant protection.\"],\"/1Kt+w\":[\"Protect against bumps with The Glove, add on-the-go flare with a lanyard, always stay connected with the right cable.\"],\"/4VfP7\":[\"\u003c0\u003e\",[\"giftName\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e as a free gift\"],\"/4aXfy\":[\"Your message\"],\"/4gGIX\":[\"Copy to clipboard\"],\"/5q8aT\":[\"Click to reveal\"],\"/7VCSa\":[\"Learn | Trezor Knowledge Base\"],\"/9cJXj\":[\"How does Trezor Expert help?\"],\"/Bcmsa\":[\"Where can I buy a Trezor Keep Metal Multi-share Backup?\"],\"/Du9aw\":[\"Hide \",[\"headline\"],\" card details\"],\"/G0MyN\":[\"Easily move your \u003c0/\u003e from any wallet or exchange to your Trezor hardware wallet.\"],\"/HeNyq\":[\"How do I use a third-party wallet app with Trezor?\"],\"/IX/7x\":[\"Other\"],\"/J+yc1\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Safe 7\u003c/0\u003e → Full compatibility on iOS and Android.\"],\"/KJUoD\":[\"Special edition for storing Bitcoin only.\u003c0\u003eExplore\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"/Nk5iH\":[\"We’ve encountered server issues and are working on a fix.\u003c0/\u003eWe’ll get our site back online soon.\"],\"/OTJKe\":[\"It is possible to pay using Bitcoin, Bitcoin Lightning, Ethereum or Litecoin.\"],\"/OZ3vz\":[\"toggle only coins view\"],\"/OwtoT\":[\"Only\"],\"/Pa7SJ\":[\"Gorilla® Glass 3 display\"],\"/R6qAT\":[\"Carl, Czech Republic\"],\"/SDGzH\":[\"Continue in browser\"],\"/UgagF\":[\"Make your wallet backup permanent\"],\"/XN91V\":[\"Communities\"],\"/cNvOB\":[\"Explore all Black Friday deals on the store page\"],\"/fDdUj\":[\"Use the security of your Trezor hardware wallet to safely manage your \u003c0/\u003e.\"],\"/gHbNF\":[\"Connect to your own full node to achieve total self-sovereignty.\"],\"/h90iY\":[\"More resellers\"],\"/jfb2i\":[\"Label your wallets, accounts and transactions natively in Trezor Suite.\"],\"/kXc2W\":[\"Supports 1000s\u003c0/\u003eof coins \u0026 tokens\"],\"/oM6nM\":[\"Contact Trezor\"],\"/qe9yT\":[\"Keeping coins online is like playing with fire. Online exchanges are big targets for hackers. They're magnets for security breaches and can spill the beans on your sensitive data. Well, the Trezor Safe 3 is like the trusted guardian angel of your crypto, placing access in an offline, Fort Knox-like sanctuary, keeping it safe and sound.\"],\"/s+TbJ\":[\"Trusted by over\u003c0/\u003e 2 million users worldwide\"],\"/tZ0ns\":[\"Identity protection with \u003c0\u003eTor\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"/ta0VP\":[\"Label your wallets, accounts and transactions natively in Trezor Suite app.\"],\"/weSps\":[\"Get Your Trezor\"],\"/x/1h1\":[\"Simplify how you organize\"],\"/xVDed\":[\"Secure your backup with multiple shares\"],\"/yNjQ5\":[\"Keep your transactions smooth, safe, and free from blockchain manipulation.\"],\"/ymFis\":[\"Video guides\"],\"/z8sJe\":[\"Future-Proof\"],\"/zdVlL\":[\"Enter street \u0026 number\"],\"0+BcyQ\":[\"e.g. 007\"],\"00pbJ7\":[\"Still the best #bitcoin wallet @Trezor\"],\"02LS/O\":[\"Magnetic dock\"],\"02P3QO\":[\"Your bitcoin, fully protected—today, tomorrow, and beyond.\"],\"02PGwd\":[\"Jan 19, 2025\"],\"02S6xJ\":[\"Contact Support\"],\"03039R\":[\"FAQs | Trezor\"],\"07pUmB\":[\"It is certified under:\u003c0/\u003eCE, RoHS, REACH, WEEE, EN55032, EN55035, EN300328, EN303417, EN62311/50566, CE RF EMC, FCC Part 15B/15C, RSS-Gen, RSS-102, RCM CISPR32, AS4268 (BT), KC KN32/35/301489, VCCI CISPR32, BSMI CNS15396.\u003c1/\u003eYou can view the complete list of certifications here: \u003c2\u003eTrezor Safe 7 certificates\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"07sYr0\":[\"Certified EAL6+ Secure Element\"],\"0Csc7F\":[\"Where can I buy a Trezor Metal Keep—Shamir Backup?\"],\"0EQuzP\":[\"Quickly and easily exchange one cryptocurrency for another, while keeping your funds secure with Trezor Suite's \u003c0\u003eSwap\u003c/0\u003e feature.\"],\"0Fl9lT\":[\"Please enter description\"],\"0GRHCX\":[\"It’s easy to move your crypto stash from your online exchange to your Trezor. First, connect your Trezor device, pop open Trezor Suite, and punch in your PIN. Next, pick your receive account and copy the wallet address. Now, jump over to your online exchange, pick the cryptocurrency, paste in the address, and seal the deal with a confirmation. Voilà!\"],\"0HlLOs\":[\"Can I use my phone for my Trezor Expert Consultation?\"],\"0HqCAa\":[\"When setting up your Trezor, you'll get \u003c0\u003ea list of 12, 20, or 24 words\u003c/0\u003e. This is your wallet backup. Use the this to recover your wallet if it’s lost, stolen, or damaged.\"],\"0JYKHc\":[\"Check Your Coins\"],\"0NEjiA\":[\"It's required to agree to the Terms of service.\"],\"0P4S8h\":[\"In your email soon\"],\"0Tf6MU\":[\"Delivery complete\"],\"0UEpHe\":[\"Privacy \u003c0\u003e\u0026 Security\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"0UEsT6\":[\"0.96\\\" Monochromatic display\"],\"0UjQMs\":[\"Company ID:\"],\"0WRUJK\":[\"Protection \u0026 privacy\"],\"0XV4fk\":[\"Premium anodized aluminum unibody, reinforced glass back, and IP54-rated dust \u0026 splash resistant—an iconic design built to last.\"],\"0Y1Uaa\":[\"Safe \u0026 secure \u003c0/\u003e wallet\"],\"0YpSnx\":[\"Bitcoin, ETH, Solana and XRP logo\"],\"0ZAAlA\":[\"Yes, most Trezor products can be refunded as long as they are returned in the same condition they were sold, i.e. they haven't been opened, damaged or used.\"],\"0aDKs9\":[\"What’s the difference between Trezor Model One and Trezor Safe 3?\"],\"0ajZop\":[\"Banner background\"],\"0cTSmv\":[\"What is Multi-share Backup, and how does it work?\"],\"0gv+T2\":[\"X\"],\"0hdofE\":[\"Buy, sell, exchange, or spend using our partner Invity directly in Trezor Suite app.\"],\"0hyLMk\":[\"Please enter first name\"],\"0jQ4za\":[\"Cameroon\"],\"0lh4+O\":[\"1x Trezor Keep Metal 12-word\"],\"0lmFEe\":[\"Buy, sell, exchange, or spend using our partner Invity directly in Trezor Suite.\"],\"0mO60p\":[\"Delivery time may take from two days to six weeks, depending on your location and national post service.\"],\"0nNDSZ\":[\"A hardware wallet is a small, physical device that keeps your crypto safe. It stores your important info securely and away from the internet, so it’s protected from hackers and viruses. When you want to move your crypto, you use the device to approve the action—without ever putting your info online.\"],\"0nbJvE\":[\"Resist Censorship\"],\"0sQEr/\":[\"Wallet setup isn't currently available on iPad. Visit this page on your computer.\"],\"0sYPVo\":[\"Take control of your \u003c0/\u003e assets with complete confidence in the Trezor ecosystem.\"],\"0t1Xiw\":[\"Buy \u0026 sell\"],\"0uCOS4\":[\"Enter the phone number for the selected delivery country. You can change the country in the previous step.\"],\"0wcIw/\":[\"Tax (\",[\"taxPercentage\"],\"%)\"],\"0wdd7X\":[\"Join\"],\"0xA637\":[\"Supporting you at every step\"],\"0xWydI\":[\"Choose how many shares are needed to recover your backup\"],\"0ydhE4\":[\"Quickly exchange one cryptocurrency for another within your Trezor wallet, enjoying a secure and hassle-free swapping experience with competitive rates.\"],\"0zLsLf\":[\"I'd like to join the Trezor refer a friend rewards program and agree to \u003c0\u003ePrivacy policy\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"0zS9aY\":[\"Find the Best Deal\"],\"1/RmfN\":[\"Manage your assets\"],\"1/VWaZ\":[\"The Trezor Safe 5 focuses on comfort and usability with its vibrant color touchscreen and haptic feedback, while also incorporating a Secure Element chip for security. The Trezor Safe 3 utilizes a two-button interface for managing coins and tokens and also includes a Secure Element chip for added device security.\"],\"1195fw\":[\"Coin networks tooltip\"],\"11n1v+\":[\"Please enter company tax number\"],\"12/MtN\":[\"Customs issue\"],\"17Brjd\":[\"Real protection and peace of mind\"],\"19bexY\":[\"\u003c0\u003eBe the boss\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eof your financial\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003efuture\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"1A3EXy\":[\"Expand\"],\"1AECcH\":[\"Scroll up to join our newsletter. We promise not to be spammy.\"],\"1B64WV\":[\"View-only\"],\"1EvK68\":[\"Download and install the Trezor Suite app for the best experience, or open the web app on your browser.\"],\"1F7qJX\":[\"bitcoin\"],\"1GUK7u\":[\"Supported\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eCoins \u0026 Tokens\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"1Grfdz\":[\"The next generation of hardware wallets with Secure Element protection.\"],\"1KAUio\":[\"Move your coins \u0026 tokens to Trezor easily\"],\"1M0FBJ\":[\"Track your bitcoin balance\"],\"1MLFoo\":[\"Built for the Mission\"],\"1MXp3h\":[\"A man sits on a chair using a MacBook while holding a Trezor Safe 7 hardware wallet in one hand.\"],\"1NZ/gk\":[\"Manage your coins \u0026 tokens on your Trezor with \u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite\u003c/0\u003e or your preferred wallet app.\"],\"1PTC1M\":[\"Strong PMMA plastic body\"],\"1Q24go\":[\"e.g. 1234 5678 1234 5678\"],\"1QgV/G\":[\"First-ever quantum-ready architecture\"],\"1RT1yj\":[\"How do I transfer my funds from an online exchange (including Coinbase and Binance) to Trezor Model T?\"],\"1Tx/wN\":[\"Clickable crypto security\"],\"1Ur4Ha\":[\"Bitcoin-only\"],\"1ZaQUH\":[\"Last name\"],\"1aEzdB\":[\"Logos of Web3 dApps including Pump.fun, Polymarket, Pancakeswap, Morpho, Aave, Uniswap, OpenSea and Raydium.\"],\"1bL7Dc\":[\"We've transformed crypto security from a complex puzzle to a user-friendly playground. We're aiming is to shape a world that's not only better but also just.\"],\"1e2/fu\":[\"Something went wrong. This is a temporary issue on our side. Try again later or contact Trezor Support by replying to our last email.\"],\"1erJqm\":[\"Remove item from cart\"],\"1f92Df\":[\"*It’s necessary to have a Trezor device with you for this session.\"],\"1fPGVY\":[\"With Trezor Suite on your mobile, it’s easy to check your assets on the go.\"],\"1heZ+H\":[\"Protect identity with \u003c0\u003eTor\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"1ibMQD\":[\"Parcels sent using UPS can be tracked \u003c0\u003ehere\u003c/0\u003e and parcels sent by Economy shipping can be tracked \u003c1\u003ehere\u003c/1\u003e while in the country of origin and then through your local postal service’s website.\"],\"1ipDdF\":[\"There have been slight modifications to the packaging over the years and it could be that your package is an older design. You can check the \u003c0\u003epackaging timeline of Trezor Model T\u003c/0\u003e and \u003c1\u003eTrezor Model One\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"1kAgsP\":[\"Organize, store \u0026 use crypto the way you want.\"],\"1koHaP\":[\"FIDO2 for secure authentication\"],\"1lGsSH\":[\"Trezor uses a durable casing made from a PC/ABS engineering thermoplastic blend, designed for long-lasting durability. The color LCD touchscreen, constructed with a high-quality transparent polymer blend, delivers vivid colors and stunning visuals, creating a seamless and user-friendly interface.\"],\"1mleTU\":[\"This category matters most as Trezor is the ultimate point of security in our threat model.\"],\"1p3ZR2\":[\"Backend infrastructure misconfigurations\"],\"1qopyV\":[\"An invoice will be sent to your email if it hasn't been already.\"],\"1qpqtc\":[\"We've transformed crypto security from a complex puzzle to a user-friendly playground. We're aiming to shape a world that's not only better but also just.\"],\"1sreVI\":[\"Confirm every transaction on your device\"],\"1t4S2L\":[\"To move your crypto from your online exchange to your Trezor, connect your Trezor device, open Trezor Suite, and enter your PIN. Then, select your receiving account and copy the wallet address. Log into your online exchange, choose the cryptocurrency, paste the address, and confirm the transaction. Your crypto will be securely transferred to your Trezor hardware wallet.\"],\"1u+oyr\":[\"Requires an \u003c0\u003eadvanced setup\u003c/0\u003e on Trezor Model One\"],\"1zDzkz\":[\"Manage, send, receive, \u0026 trade crypto \"],\"1ztZEr\":[\"Click to hide\"],\"22GJPN\":[\"Power engineered to last\"],\"22fvSj\":[\"Secure your 12-word wallet backup\"],\"23CeoR\":[\"Currency, delivery\"],\"23s9zf\":[\"A hardware wallet stores the information needed to access and manage your coins. This information stays safely inside the device and never goes online. Even if your phone or computer is hacked, your coins will stay protected on a hardware wallet.\"],\"24DKN9\":[\"Set up your Trezor hardware wallet with confidence. Join a one-on-one live online session for personal guidance.\"],\"27hPem\":[\"Rating: \",[\"TRUSTPILOT_RATING\"],\" out of 5\"],\"29FlZV\":[\"Solve your Trezor questions with a tailored 60-minute session\"],\"29VNqC\":[\"Unknown error\"],\"2BWibm\":[\"One Trezor. Thousands of dApps\"],\"2CkGv/\":[\"Your privacy is important to us \u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eAll customer data is deleted or anonymized within 90 days. \u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eLearn more\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"2FYpfJ\":[\"More\"],\"2FumKI\":[\"Nigeria\"],\"2IDLUS\":[\"CPF (tax ID)\"],\"2Im67J\":[\"No—as long as you’ve kept your wallet backup you make during the setup, your crypto is safe. You can restore your entire wallet onto a new Trezor device using that wallet backup, also called a recovery phrase. It’s like having a secure recovery key. Just make sure to keep your wallet backup stored safely offline, and never share it with anyone.\"],\"2JslSR\":[\"Cable-Free Power \u0026 Connectivity\"],\"2KAdXw\":[\"Your order has been delivered.\"],\"2OsoTJ\":[\"Trezor hardware wallets support 1000s of coins and tokens.\"],\"2POOFK\":[\"Free\"],\"2W6yEo\":[\"Trezor Safe 3 features\"],\"2Y1g5R\":[\"When paying for your order with crypto you can create a temporary wallet online and transfer your Bitcoin funds from an exchange to your wallet. Once you've done that, you should be able to process the payment from your wallet instantaneously, without risking an underpaid or outdated payment.\"],\"2aV1OR\":[\"I agree to the \u003c0\u003eTerms of service\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"2bZVF9\":[\"Burundi\"],\"2h3cY9\":[\"Increase privacy with coin control\"],\"2i159O\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor hardware wallets\u003c/0\u003e secures your crypto with:\"],\"2i965z\":[\"Protect your device with a \u003c0\u003ePIN\u003c/0\u003e up to 50 digits\"],\"2mLu5A\":[\"Trade \u0026 Stake\"],\"2nLhxM\":[\"Use as a 2FA device\"],\"2nTWRO\":[\"Man lying on a couch looking at his smartphone, with illustrated icons of a phone, envelope, and padlock symbolizing secure messaging.\"],\"2ne8Gl\":[\"Bypassing user confirmation\"],\"2nyc5B\":[[\"itemName\"],\" added to cart\"],\"2oYrrB\":[\"Can I combine my 10% discount with other promotions?\"],\"2pRdWs\":[\"Note: Once the order is created, we are unable to modify the address details or the items ordered, but our agents will gladly instruct you on how to proceed in these cases. Let us know via the chat bubble in the bottom right corner.\"],\"2pS2Ag\":[\"\u003c0\u003e10+\u003c/0\u003e Years in crypto\"],\"2pgU4b\":[\"How do I schedule my Trezor Expert Onboarding Session?\"],\"2rNaCu\":[\"Social media: Trezor on \u003c0\u003eTwitter\u003c/0\u003e, \u003c1\u003eTrezor subreddit\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"2rVVb4\":[\"Orders which have been paid for are processed within 48 hours during business days, unless otherwise stated during checkout.\"],\"2uuLoX\":[\"Trezor supports hundreds of coins and tokens including Bitcoin, Monero, Litecoin, Dash, Zcash, Bitcoin Cash, Bitcoin Gold, Ethereum (+ all ERC20 tokens), and Ethereum Classic. Please refer to \u003c0\u003etrezor.io/coins\u003c/0\u003e for the complete list of supported cryptocurrencies.\u003c1\u003e\u003c2\u003eIn the list you can also find information about which Trezor model supports each cryptocurrency, as some coins cannot be used in the Trezor Suite app, but are supported through the use of a third party application with your Trezor.\u003c/2\u003e\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"2vxLGv\":[\"Crypto security \u0026 convenience in a gorgeous design. The EAL6+ Secure Element adds asset protection while the bright, vibrant color touchscreen \u0026 haptic feedback bring a new level to your crypto experience.\"],\"2wkmwU\":[\"Company page hero - trezors image\"],\"2xXRao\":[\"Failed to add item into cart, please try again.\"],\"2xoznd\":[\"\u003c0\u003eManage your Bitcoin\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ein Trezor Suite app\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"3++HXt\":[\"Trezor is the world's first and most secure #cryptocurrency hardware wallet because your info is kept safe...\"],\"3+dhnp\":[\"Loading more coins\"],\"30XQ+/\":[\"Cookies\"],\"348C0a\":[\"Rated \u003c0\u003e\",[\"score\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e / 5 based on \u003c1\u003e\",[\"count\"],\" reviews\u003c/1\u003e. Showing our \",[\"reviewTiers\"],\" star reviews.\"],\"348wF9\":[\"SLIP39 | Trezor's ne