buy, and stake crypto securely, backed by hardware-level protection.\"],\"4QjtGU\":[\"Easily integrate your solution into Trezor's ecosystem by following our comprehensive documentation.\"],\"4TuLBE\":[\"Reported by\"],\"4U2DmH\":[\"\u003c0\u003eA tracking ID is assigned to your order once the order status is “shipped”.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eOrders which have been paid for are processed within 48 hours during business days, unless otherwise stated during checkout.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eOnce the order has been shipped, you will receive a notification from noreply@trezor.io containing the tracking ID.\u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003eParcels sent using UPS can be tracked \u003c4\u003ehere\u003c/4\u003e and parcels sent by Economy shipping can be tracked \u003c5\u003ehere\u003c/5\u003e while in the country of origin and then through your local postal service’s website.\u003c/3\u003e\u003c6\u003eOrders to the USA and UK can be tracked using your local postal service’s website.\u003c/6\u003eIf you have not received your tracking number, please check your junk or spam folder, sometimes they can end up there.\"],\"4VEXeP\":[\"Personal 1:1 guide for Trezor hardware wallet setup\"],\"4WQ5SQ\":[\"Secure your 24-word recovery seed\"],\"4X1CEf\":[\"How do I buy a Trezor Model One hardware wallet?\"],\"4cJ0hF\":[\"Rewards\"],\"4cYQHY\":[\"Your privacy is important to us \u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eAll customer data is deleted or anonymized within 90 days.\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"4dXHHI\":[\"A smiling woman holding her Trezor and looking at the camera.\"],\"4fGU1E\":[\"Is there a minimum purchase amount to use the discount?\"],\"4fL/V7\":[\"Pay\"],\"4i8F5e\":[\"Scroll to the How It Works video section.\"],\"4kMFgw\":[\"Lock in your crypto savings\"],\"4kd9+F\":[\"Trezor may suspend or end your participation for fraud, abuse, or breaking the rules.\"],\"4m5G/f\":[\"Buy, sell, swap \u0026 stake crypto with peace of mind directly on your Trezor.\"],\"4nbEvi\":[\"Which hardware wallet is the Trezor Expert Consultation compatible with?\"],\"4qh0YB\":[\"Innovating since 2013\"],\"4tuFWT\":[\"Order success\"],\"4uDgdr\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor, the original hardware wallet, \u003c/0\u003egives you full control of your crypto, so you can store, manage, and use it securely and confidently.\"],\"4w4K93\":[\"Trezor supports 1000s of coins and tokens across leading networks like Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, Base, Arbitrum One, Cardano, and more.\"],\"4wTP3T\":[\"Less articles\"],\"4yp4G3\":[\"Add to cart\"],\"5/sZdi\":[\"Delivery in the UK and USA\"],\"50RlJR\":[\"Trade Crypto Safely with Trezor Suite | Buy, Sell \u0026 Exchange\"],\"54kmkB\":[\"“I have the Trezor Keep. It’s fantastically well built. I think everyone is scared to transfer their stack to cold storage the first time, but it’ll go super smooth and you’ll be just fine.”\"],\"54smPY\":[\"When setting up your Trezor, you'll get \u003c0\u003ea list of 12, 20, or 24 words\u003c/0\u003e. This is your \u003c1\u003ewallet backup\u003c/1\u003e. Use this to recover your wallet if it’s lost, stolen, or damaged.\"],\"57btvA\":[\"Trezor Suite: Your all-in-one crypto app\"],\"585zFk\":[\"For a secure purchase of a new Trezor Safe 3 hardware wallet, head over to the official Trezor Shop or check out one of our trusted resellers. Going through these channels is your top choice to guarantee that your device is genuine, unaltered, and absolutely legit. If you have any questions with your Trezor purchase, reach out to Trezor Support.\"],\"5D9BxW\":[\"Your crypto is not stored on your Trezor, so losing the device does not mean losing your funds. They remain on the blockchain and are secured by your wallet backup. By entering your wallet backup (the list of words you created when setting up your Trezor), you can restore access on a new Trezor device or another compatible wallet.\"],\"5Ds57X\":[\"MEV Protection\"],\"5ELlx2\":[\"Buy, manage \u0026 stake your \",[\"name\"],\" \",[\"withText\"]],\"5L+3vD\":[\"You are responsible for any taxes or reporting obligations related to your rewards.\"],\"5MoFZc\":[\"Go to trezor.io/coins to find a compatible wallet app for your coin or token. Download, open, and follow the steps to connect your Trezor.\"],\"5NGSI0\":[\"Taproot enhances bitcoin safety, privacy \u0026 network efficiency.\"],\"5Ndvl/\":[\"Is there a difference between the Trezor Safe 5 and the Trezor Safe 5 Freedom Edition?\"],\"5P/I8f\":[\"In case the download hasn't started please \u003c0\u003edownload manually\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"5PFmQC\":[\"Set up with confidence\"],\"5PNX45\":[\"The Card Verification Code (CVC) you entered is incorrect. Please verify and re-enter with the correct CVC.\"],\"5Thmz2\":[\"Trezor Suite app compatible\"],\"5TqDVt\":[\"Apr 11, 2025\"],\"5VT741\":[\"Do more with Trezor\"],\"5Yndu3\":[\"In case you had an issue with your payment or the delivery of your order, please, let us know via\\nthe chat bubble in the bottom right corner where our chatbot Hal and our support team will be happy\\nto assist you!\"],\"5dE7fN\":[\"No worries! Just reply to our previous email, and we’ll send you a fresh link right away.\"],\"5e1hSB\":[\"Collection of popular cryptocurrency coins supported by Trezor Suite - left view\"],\"5gdUqQ\":[\"Since we created the first hardware wallet, we’ve been dedicated to providing security, growth \u0026 ease of use for our over 2 million users on their crypto journey.\"],\"5iCFUq\":[\"Show \",[\"question\"],\" answer\"],\"5l74qz\":[\"Certified Chip EAL6+\"],\"5lSSbK\":[\"If your discount code isn’t working, double-check for typos and ensure it’s entered exactly as you received it. Make sure your cart total meets the $49 minimum purchase requirement and that you’re not combining multiple promo codes, as only one code can be used per order. Also, verify that the code hasn’t expired. If the issue persists, contact Trezor Support for help.\"],\"5ltm8t\":[\"Unprecedented security. \u003c0\u003eUnparalleled design.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"5lxPJ4\":[\"Create a passphrase wallet to lock your assets in an impenetrable virtual safe deposit box on your Trezor device.\"],\"5qOeBC\":[\"Discover decentralized apps like Aave, Uniswap, OpenSea, and more via WalletConnect.\"],\"5qo+AM\":[\"Physical protection for your digital assets\"],\"5rW5nZ\":[\"Download for desktop\"],\"5rd0XP\":[\"What is the difference between the seed phrase and private key?\"],\"5t2zTT\":[\"We never postpone shipping without notifying you first. If there is a delay before the package has been dispatched, it may be due to incomplete shipping information being provided. In that case, our Customer Support team will contact you and request the missing information.\"],\"5tXvrw\":[\"145x92x21 mm / 75 g\u003c0/\u003e5.7x3.6x0.8 in / 2.6 oz\"],\"5u+lai\":[\"Where can I find the serial number of my Trezor device? Can you check if the serial number of my device is genuine?\"],\"5uTn4r\":[\"Security seals ensure packaging and Trezor wallets are tamper-evident.\"],\"5ue8+y\":[\"Analytical \u0026 Marketing\"],\"5utW2N\":[\"Recover access to your coins in case of device loss, damage, or theft.\"],\"5xKEnp\":[\"Earn more with staking\"],\"5yKFih\":[\"Is the Trezor Expert Onboarding Session secure?\"],\"6+eSrn\":[\"Efficient, intuitive navigation on a large display\"],\"6+zcvD\":[\"Maximum length exceeded\"],\"6/dCYd\":[\"Overview\"],\"61au2G\":[\"Soon you will be able to work with Suite also on mobile devices (Android \u0026 iOS).\"],\"621rYf\":[\"Payment\"],\"64LegO\":[\"All Trezors are shipped without preloaded software for your safety.\"],\"658QCH\":[\"Make the most of your \",[\"coinCode\"]],\"65DeLY\":[\"Your referral link\"],\"65b7Ed\":[\"Prefer expert guidance?\"],\"66/0lx\":[\"Industry standard for improved wallet usability, security \u0026 user experience.\"],\"67W1Ci\":[\"Wallet onboarding\"],\"68v2Jd\":[\"Organize your portfolio with separate accounts for each cryptocurrency, daily expenses, and future savings.\"],\"69VzN9\":[\"\u003c0\u003eCu