otect Bitcoins.\"],\"7ORrpD\":[\"Scroll to Buy, Sell, and Swap section\"],\"7OajVN\":[\"Pay again for your order\"],\"7QzE9n\":[\"Basket icon\"],\"7Sf2kd\":[\"Your wallet backup is your wallet’s safety words, a sequence of readable words to back up and recover your wallet. Private key, on the other hand, is your super-secret code, typically a long jumble of characters. It’s what you use to sign transactions and access your crypto stored at a specific address.\"],\"7Vnb44\":[\"Buy an authentic Trezor Metal Keep Multi-share Backup at the official Trezor Shop or connect with one of our reputable authorized sellers. These are the best ways to get genuine Trezor products, no gimmicks involved. If you have any questions regarding your Trezor purchase, feel free to contact Trezor Support.\"],\"7VpPHA\":[\"Confirm\"],\"7XS2RP\":[\"Clear \u0026 simple wallet backup\"],\"7ZZYC6\":[\"I want to add/remove/change items in my order\"],\"7ZyVHF\":[\"Sales tax added on next step\"],\"7cQijy\":[\"Security Portal\"],\"7gQhgj\":[\"Trezor was the first hardware wallet and has set the standard for over 10 years. With open-source code, independent security audits, and the Trezor Suite app, you get unmatched transparency and usability. With devices like the Safe 7, you also benefit from full iOS and Android support, a transparent Secure Element, and quantum-ready security.\"],\"7i8j3G\":[\"Company\"],\"7j5YjK\":[\"24-word \u003c0\u003ewallet backup\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"7q6y1a\":[\"Trezor 101\"],\"7rUY7y\":[\"How it Works\"],\"7s24la\":[\"Trezor Safe 7\"],\"7wRGwL\":[\"Track your crypto anytime, anywhere\"],\"7wgDV8\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Safe 5, Trezor Safe 3, Trezor Model T, and Trezor Model One\u003c/0\u003e → Full compatibility on Android. Limited compatibility on iOS (supports portfolio tracking, buying, and receiving assets). To sign other transactions, Trezor Suite desktop is required.\"],\"7xKikg\":[\"Discreet mode\"],\"7xvuL/\":[\"Trezor Suite available for\"],\"8/HbCN\":[\"Use with the desktop, web \u0026 mobile apps\"],\"80pENV\":[\"Transact freely with anyone, anywhere, anytime—no one can stop or block you.\"],\"81yLxc\":[\"Trezor Keep Metal\"],\"84LuyN\":[\"Made for everyone\"],\"8825Rj\":[\"Book a one-on-one online session with our experts to get your Trezor hardware wallet set up and questions answered.\"],\"89Yw1d\":[\"Some Trezor models\"],\"8AULTO\":[\"How it works\"],\"8CUTHw\":[\"Which hardware wallet is the Trezor Expert Onboarding Session compatible with?\"],\"8D7lod\":[\"A wallet backup, also known as a seed phrase or recovery seed, is like your wallet's safety words, a sequence of readable words to backup up and recover your wallet. Private key, on the other hand, is your super-secret code, typically a long jumble of characters. It's what you use to sign transactions and access your crypto stored at a specific address.\"],\"8E3D8E\":[\"Set up \u0026 use your Trezor\"],\"8EzMz9\":[\"Supported languages\"],\"8GhSC3\":[\"Invalid CPF number\"],\"8I8mVu\":[\"Trezor Suite supports a broad range of cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, Cardano, and many ERC-20 tokens. The full list of supported assets is constantly updated to include new coins and tokens. You can view the latest supported assets on the Supported Coins \u0026 Tokens page.\"],\"8KVApS\":[\"Order was returned\"],\"8Pv+PI\":[\"No states match your search. Please try a different term.\"],\"8QsInh\":[\"The world's first hardware wallet built to protect your crypto today and tomorrow.\"],\"8R5Ff+\":[\"Compare Trezor\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eHardware Wallets\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"8V2AiT\":[\"A Trezor Expert Consultation is for people looking to improve their knowledge of the Trezor wallet \u0026 Trezor Suite, and achieve advanced security and coin management.\"],\"8VzKEM\":[\"Receive 1:1 support from the team that built the world's first hardware wallet and master self-custody\"],\"8Xtx3I\":[\"Stay informed about the latest product releases and innovations.\"],\"8alIpl\":[\"Keep your coins and data fully under your control\"],\"8bQOdY\":[\"The Trezor Keep Metal—Shamir Backup rocks a simple four-letter wallet backup entry layout plus security seals, making sure it’s clear if anyone has tampered with your backup. On the flip side, the Cryptotag Zeus goes for the more complicated BIP-39 wordlist input without any tamper-seal protection, putting your wallet backup at risk.\"],\"8bSyWY\":[\"Trezor hardware wallets now use SLIP39 to generate a 20-word backup (also called Single-share Backup), providing more accessibility to backup options. Both 12- \u0026 24-word backups are created following the BIP39 standard.\"],\"8cJGr8\":[\"Flag of \",[\"code\"]],\"8fLtEH\":[\"Does Trezor Metal Keep Multi-share Backup work with all Trezor hardware wallets?\"],\"8fZ997\":[\"Elegantly designed,\u003c0/\u003eseriously secure\"],\"8h9+95\":[\"Amadeus, Spain\"],\"8hQAJ/\":[\"Seated woman looking at a Trezor safe 7.\"],\"8hXoWh\":[\"Buy bitcoin securely\"],\"8ij4QW\":[\"Pre-order \",[\"price\"]],\"8jJBLx\":[\"Exchanges are targets for hackers\"],\"8kYVBx\":[\"Level up your skills and security during 1:1 session with a Trezor Expert.\"],\"8kfjle\":[\"Join the Trezor \u003c0\u003eNewsletter\u003c/0\u003e!\"],\"8l7you\":[\"Easily manage Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, Arbitrum, USDC, and many more with one secure hardware wallet.\"],\"8nD7yq\":[\"What is stored on a hardware wallet?\"],\"8p424C\":[\"Sign \u0026 Verify\"],\"8qZ4X7\":[\"Stake your coins and earn rewards while helping to secure and maintain the blockchain network. Available now for Ethereum, Cardano and Solana.\"],\"8rH2TV\":[\"Please enter billing street\"],\"8sIgYX\":[\"Definitions, Services, Availability, Warranties and liability, Communication, Law and jurisdiction.\"],\"8t1cR1\":[\"e.g. 0007\"],\"8tdsXY\":[\"Check the compatible wallet apps \",[\"wallets\"],\" for your coin or token. Then, download it, open it, and follow the steps to connect your Trezor.\"],\"8wCi+I\":[\"Characteristics\"],\"8wiQ19\":[\"Keeping your wallet backup safe and sound offline is super important when you're dealing with stuff like bitcoin, Ethereum, and other cryptocurrencies. This way, you can chill without worrying about hackers, hardware issues, or tricky social tricks messing with your coins. It's all about safeguarding your privacy and providing long-term resilience.\"],\"8y6dPs\":[\"Resist financial censorship\"],\"8zymrg\":[\"Up 40% Off Bestsellers\"],\"9+0+qw\":[\"Please enter email\"],\"9/1YKL\":[\"Enter last name\"],\"90075V\":[\"Buy, sell, send, and receive bitcoin\"],\"91PPYd\":[\"Made for Bitcoin\"],\"91rsi0\":[\"Write to us\"],\"92ee5p\":[\"All about Bitcoin\"],\"92f/AN\":[\"Native altcoin support\"],\"93w1EY\":[\"I’ve heard big exchanges are safe now, do I really need a hardware wallet?\"],\"95HGQX\":[\"Install the desktop app on your computer. This step isn’t necessary for web app users.\"],\"96cTEN\":[\"Copy the your code \u003c0\u003e\",[\"promoCode\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e and apply it in your cart on orders of $49 or more.\"],\"99W5gt\":[\"Securely trade crypto with your device\"],\"99z+Pu\":[\"After pairing your Trezor with the wallet app, manage your crypto securely. Your Trezor is used to confirm every important transaction.\"],\"9AA+8E\":[\"Maximize your savings\"],\"9Aq5R5\":[\"Link copied!\"],\"9DZc3D\":[\"Loading more resellers\"],\"9DwEl+\":[\"Save \",[\"selectedSalePercentage\"],\"%\"],\"9GSXk9\":[\"Go to Support\"],\"9HLIMi\":[\"Simplify your \u003c0\u003ewallet backup\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"9I8UkE\":[\"Company page hero image\"],\"9IAeUR\":[\"Recover your wallet from \u003c0\u003emultiple shares\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"9JzQ9X\":[\"Every transaction on the app requires your explicit confirmation directly on your Trezor hardware wallet.\"],\"9KY2N+\":[\"Hardware wallet set up session\"],\"9Ly4v8\":[\"Code the revolution\"],\"9P8fsw\":[\"One Secure device.\"],\"9PaXfA\":[\"Feb 27, 2025\"],\"9Qolbq\":[\"All payment details are required.\"],\"9Qs99X\":[\"E