TkFB\":[\"On-device entry\"],\"B+fccC\":[\"What is a Hardware Wallet\"],\"B+ny5p\":[\"Owning crypto \u003c0\u003eshouldn't mean stressing over it\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"B3gfuY\":[\"Get started with\u003c0/\u003eTrezor Expert\"],\"B3gz8R\":[\"If your device is lost or damaged, your wallet backup lets you quickly and securely restore access to your crypto without losing anything.\"],\"B4CHkU\":[\"Find out how to navigate the crypto world safely and securely with your Trezor hardware wallet.\"],\"B6zvhF\":[\"Shares\"],\"B7TG8c\":[\"Remove gift from cart\"],\"B8AaMI\":[\"This field is required\"],\"B9tXGC\":[\"Independence isn’t given — it’s taken. Trezor empowers \u003c0\u003eyou with the tools to opt out of centralized control and protect what you believe in.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"BBIfn6\":[\"Language, currency, delivery\"],\"BBqGS9\":[\"Desktop\"],\"BF5zb7\":[\"Download Trezor Suite today and take control of your crypto assets with ease.\"],\"BGDx07\":[\"IP54-rated protection\"],\"BJlm0d\":[\"I agree to \u003c0\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"BNGu+O\":[\"\u003c0/\u003e or third-party wallets\"],\"BPtJ/a\":[\"Trezor wallets use public, open-source code designs, so you can check and make sure each process is legit.\"],\"BQ8WVv\":[\"YouTube video player\"],\"BSKxIO\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 on notebook case with tablet and keys.\"],\"BTMdQQ\":[\"Trade with confidence, knowing your crypto is under your control after each trade.\"],\"BUPEZH\":[\"No compromises. No friction.\"],\"BYtvcP\":[\"Bigger Display\"],\"Bb4I5v\":[\"Error setting the pickup point. Please try again.\"],\"BbOrk5\":[\"Own your data like \u003c0/\u003ea boss \u003c1\u003ewith Trezor\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"BddSYM\":[\"Safe \u0026 secure \",[\"name\"],\" wallet\"],\"BfBwbb\":[\"Use as a 2FA Device\"],\"Bg931m\":[\"Conveniently check your portfolio and assets at home or on the go.\"],\"BhjhiX\":[\"Tor is open-source software that enables anonymous communication. Using Tor makes it more difficult to trace a user's Internet activity.\"],\"BisT2M\":[\"No Single Point of Failure\"],\"BmfykU\":[\"Guides\"],\"Bmm25W\":[\"Trezor hardware wallet\"],\"Bn8FoJ\":[\"SaSa, Slovakia\"],\"BnLq6J\":[\"Enter a valid CPF\"],\"BpCRtG\":[\"Compare products\"],\"BqR9Z8\":[\"For a secure purchase of a new Trezor Safe 3 hardware wallet, head over to the official Trezor Shop. Going thought this channel is your top choice to guarantee that your device is genuine, unaltered, and absolutely legit. If you have any questions with your Trezor purchase, reach out to Trezor Support.\"],\"BtIb7D\":[\"Protect your assets with advanced security \u0026 privacy features—already on your Trezor hardware wallet and Trezor Suite.\"],\"Btn7P2\":[\"We strongly believe this enhanced 20-word standard is an evolution of the previous standard with many significant improvements to wallet backup and recovery. It offers more variability in creating backups, ensuring safer and more reliable self-custody for everyone.\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1/\u003eUsers can seamlessly upgrade from a standard Single-share Backup to an advanced Multi-share Backup, obtaining distributed security with no single point of failure for backup.\u003c2/\u003e\u003c3/\u003eAdditionally, it comes with an upgraded wordlist, with carefully selected words that are easily distinguishable from each other compared to the old standard. In case of one mistake in the backup, users can identify which word is incorrect. In the case of 2 or 3 mistakes, they can identify how many words are incorrect.\"],\"BzMUyw\":[\"\u003c0\u003eReady to\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003estart trading?\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"BzrBIZ\":[\"micro USB → USB-A\"],\"C+kAEu\":[\"Bigger than Trezor Safe 5\"],\"C+qBvX\":[\"Grow your portfolio and earn rewards on your crypto with ease in the Trezor Suite app.\"],\"C37WT1\":[\"1.54\\\" Color display\"],\"C4Kms+\":[\"Wireless freedom for your crypto—securely connect, charge, and use it anytime, anywhere, on any device.\"],\"C4PakT\":[\"Trezor Bitcoin wallet apps logos\"],\"C4qLbj\":[\"The main difference between the Trezor Safe 5 and the Trezor Model T is their usability. The Trezor Safe 5 is designed to be the most comfortable, user-friendly hardware wallet on the market. It also comes with a Secure Element chip, making it super secure, along with a slick, vibrant touchscreen and haptic feedback for more intuitive usability. The Trezor Model T uses a touchscreen and several security features designed to keep your crypto safe and secure.\"],\"C5qyr7\":[\"Your crypto today, tomorrow \u0026 forever\"],\"C6DhpM\":[\"Intuitive touchscreen\"],\"C7WgMG\":[\"If you completed and paid for your order with cryptocurrency and it was canceled, one of the following may have occurred:\"],\"C869wE\":[\"Why a hardware wallet?\"],\"C8xC9Q\":[\"45 g / 1.6 oz\"],\"CBDlOI\":[\"To apply your referral discount, \u003c0\u003esome of your data\u003c/0\u003e will be shared with a trusted third-party service.\"],\"CCKN5N\":[\"Go to Visualbook\"],\"CCkW+y\":[\"Because your security is never optional.\"],\"CCnsqY\":[\"Don’t see your issue?\"],\"CDz5TF\":[\"Order tracking is added to each shipment.\"],\"CEN2VZ\":[\"You alone control and own your crypto; no banks, exchanges, or governments can touch it.\"],\"CFmiDK\":[\"Check your coins\"],\"CH3mDU\":[\"Error setting the pickup point. Please try again\"],\"CHh0qa\":[\"Search, find, and answer basic questions about Trezor hardware wallets and their purchase.\"],\"CNGrY3\":[[\"salePercentageByCurrency\"],\"% Off\"],\"COam5C\":[\"Why store my seed phrase offline?\"],\"CRMOwg\":[\"12-word wallet backup\"],\"CS6To4\":[\"Download Trezor Suite app for desktop for the best experience, or click “Continue in browser” to open the web app.\"],\"CSDyld\":[\"A crypto-mobile experience to track and keep control over coins on the go.\"],\"CSXlIT\":[\"Specifically designed to receive quantum-secure updates\"],\"CTnAVz\":[\"Protect\"],\"CUld1i\":[\"Secure your 20-word wallet backup\"],\"CW7kr7\":[\"Personalized 1:1 assistance for your Trezor questions\"],\"CXACKk\":[\"Participants will receive comprehensive support from Trezor, including access to technical guidance, development resources, and consultations with our experts. Our team is committed to assisting you at every step to ensure successful implementation. Upon completion, chosen applicants will receive a bounty ranging from $2,000 to $6,000, depending on the complexity and depth of SLIP-39 integration achieved.\"],\"CXK7SX\":[[\"totalCount\"],\" articles\"],\"CYlgvT\":[\"30% off\"],\"Cb4ZrT\":[\"Order #\",[\"orderNumber\"]],\"Cgsu6N\":[\"Both versions of the Trezor Safe 3 offer top-notch security thanks to their integrated Secure Element layer. The Trezor Safe 3 Bitcoin-only wallet takes your bitcoin protection to the next level when combined with a passphrase. Step into the future of coin security with confidence, brought to you by industry pioneers.\"],\"CiKa2z\":[\"Collects data on website performance, visitor interaction, and potential technical issues. Collects data for personalised marketing campaigns.\"],\"Cj69cr\":[\"Avoid risks—your wallet is completely offline\"],\"CkZvrC\":[\"Connect with 30+ leading crypto wallet apps\"],\"Cnxmj8\":[\"Start using your new Trezor device with Trezor Suite App. Buy, trade \u0026amp; send coins in the safest crypto ecosystem\"],\"CpBpoA\":[[\"lengthOfFilteredModels\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[[\"lengthOfFilteredModels\"],\" model\"],\"other\":[[\"lengthOfFilteredModels\"],\" models\"]}]],\"CpK5yo\":[\"Buy an authentic Trezor Metal Keep—Shamir Backup at the official Trezor Shop or connect with one of our reputable authorized sellers. These are the best ways to get genuine Trezor products, no gimmicks involved. If you have any questions regarding your Trezor purchase, feel free to contact Trezor Support.\"],\"CpXcTh\":[\"2x 20-word wallet backup cards\"],\"CrTjR+\":[\"Customs duties apply for deliveries to certain countries (except the USA, the UK and those within the EU).\"],\"CtUzJC\":[\"I