\u0026 tokens\"],\"E4/c/s\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 screen size\"],\"E4BPY8\":[\"NDA-free design\"],\"E6Qd1p\":[\"A hot wallet stores your private keys on a device that’s connected to the internet - such as a mobile wallet app, desktop wallet, or browser extension. Because the keys are on an internet-connected device, they’re more exposed to hacks, malware, and outages. A hardware wallet like Trezor stores your private keys in a secure offline device, keeping them isolated from the internet even when you connect it to make a transaction.\"],\"E6TK1l\":[\"CTA button\"],\"E7MgHO\":[\"Click \u003c0\u003ehere\u003c/0\u003e to read more on our knowledge base. Access all technical documentation around the subject \u003c1\u003ehere\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"E8YA+A\":[\"Trade \u0026 Stake Without Worry\"],\"EB9P+K\":[\"Just powerful, physical security ready for anything you want to do with crypto.\"],\"ECDg/S\":[\"Supported dApps via\"],\"ECMzzC\":[\"Failed to send the form. Please retry.\"],\"EDl9kS\":[\"Subscribe\"],\"EGe1KM\":[\"Check Trezor forum\"],\"EHBe7i\":[\"Unlock 70,000+ dApps, DeFi platforms, and marketplaces\"],\"EHf2Ns\":[\"The Trezor Metal Keep Multi-share Backup is compatible with Trezor Safe 5, Trezor Safe 3, and Trezor Model T hardware wallets. Take your wallet backup security to the next level by creating, splitting, sharing, storing your wallet backup shares. Regain access to your coins by collecting your threshold shares and recovering your funds on a new Trezor device.\"],\"EIRMHS\":[\"\u003c0\u003eJoin the Trezor bug\u003c/0\u003ebounty program\"],\"EIU345\":[\"Two-factor authentication\"],\"EJU4KN\":[\"Economy shipping\"],\"EJqQRd\":[\"Trezor Suite is the official app for managing your Trezor hardware wallet.\"],\"EJz8+5\":[\"All customer data is \u003c0\u003edeleted or anonymized\u003c/0\u003e 90 days after purchase on the Trezor Shop.\"],\"EKJzCA\":[\"Unconfirmed transaction\"],\"EKzS+D\":[\"Where is my crypto stored? Is it on the device?\"],\"EL1iS5\":[\"Water