\"GkP5nz\":[\"Trezor Suite works seamlessly with the Trezor hardware wallet to keep your assets safe and easy to manage.\"],\"GlIBpN\":[\"Delivery takes place within 3 to 5 business days after the order is processed and the package has been dispatched. Packages are fully trackable.\"],\"GmOO9X\":[\"Designed for 12-word wallet backups for all crypto hardware wallets\"],\"Gmlpaf\":[\"USB-C → USB-C cable\"],\"GnJso3\":[\"Friends must place and pay for an order of $49 or more (before taxes and shipping).\"],\"GpY2el\":[\"Terms Of Service | Trezor\"],\"Gpbmev\":[\"What is a hardware wallet?\"],\"GsivdV\":[\"Download the Trezor Suite app and follow the steps to get started.\"],\"GvrAgc\":[\"Long-term investing needs long-term protection — and that’s what Trezor was built for.\"],\"GwN7a7\":[\"Explore all Black Friday deals\"],\"GxTHUE\":[\"Our enhanced 20-word backup standard ensures a more robust process for backing up and recovering your wallet compared to the legacy standard. With an upgraded, user-friendly wordlist and seamless transition to Multi-share Backup, SLIP39 offers superior security with no single point of failure.\"],\"Gy9cv+\":[\"Please enter contact name\"],\"Gys299\":[\"for Mobile\"],\"Gz/dAR\":[\"Tell us what you \u003c0\u003ereally think\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"GzPQ2f\":[\"Stay in the loop\"],\"H/kJGZ\":[\"\u003c0\u003eCompare Trezor\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eHardware Wallets\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"H2/dBw\":[\"Got an issue?\"],\"H38+Wx\":[\"Explore Trezor Academy\"],\"H3eJTm\":[\"Signing key 2021\"],\"H5+6rA\":[\"Do I have to use Trezor Suite, or can I connect with other wallets?\"],\"H7Lwxu\":[\"This is for all the Bitcoiners out there. Go OG and get the Trezor Safe 3 designed exclusively for Bitcoin-only transactions. Install an optimized, lightweight firmware crafted specifically for Bitcoin operations and functionality, available across all Trezor wallets. Your other coins remain secure and intact, but they won't be detected or displayed in the Trezor Suite app.\"],\"HBI6nY\":[\"Need help?\"],\"HGEUZl\":[\"Manage, send, and receive crypto\"],\"HH4zKs\":[\"Device characteristics\"],\"HL7oz2\":[\"If the referred order is cancelled, refunded, or disputed, the reward may be removed.\"],\"HMrYMJ\":[\"Utilize the most effective methods to protect your crypto, including advanced security features like Multi-share Backup and Passphrase.\"],\"HPadYm\":[\"Backup \u0026 recovery\"],\"HPfl54\":[\"Go to cart\"],\"HPiuSz\":[\"\u003c0\u003eOne wallet. One app.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eZero compromises.\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"HSiIbO\":[\"153x100x35 mm / 600 g\u003c0/\u003e6.0 x 3.9 x 1.4 in / 21.1 oz\"],\"HSwOn3\":[\"Don't have a Trezor yet?\"],\"HTorr8\":[\"2.5\\\"\"],\"HZsTKI\":[\"Increase Quantity\"],\"HZwOOA\":[\"You may have noticed features like the Tropic Secure Element or quantum-ready security mentioned in the product description. These are part of the Trezor Safe 7’s advanced hardware and security. This FAQ focuses specifically on the Bitcoin-only version, so for a full overview of all features and detailed explanations, check out the main Trezor Safe 7 Frequently Asked Questions.\"],\"HiLkA5\":[\"Definitions, Personal data, How to place your order, Product prices and availability, Payment Method, Delivery Service, Contract Withdrawal, Liability for defects and commercial warranty, Consumer dispute resolution, Applicable law and choice of forum clause, Final provisions.\"],\"HkVsVz\":[\"What assets does Trezor Suite support?\"],\"Hm2Ohe\":[\"terms of use\"],\"HmcqGP\":[\"Built with two advanced security chips for ultimate safety\"],\"HmxPWC\":[\"Security portal\"],\"HopgKr\":[\"Keeping your seed phrase safe and sound offline is super important when you're dealing with stuff like bitcoin, Ethereum, and other cryptocurrencies. This way, you can chill without worrying about hackers, hardware issues, or tricky social tricks messing with your coins. It's all about safeguarding your privacy and providing long-term resilience.\"],\"HpYpx4\":[\"Describe the issue\"],\"Hpi4Jm\":[\"Join now\"],\"HqyJ9z\":[\"Identity protection with Tor\"],\"Ht5tyG\":[\"Pick privacy and control your Bitcoin UTXOs precisely as you need.\"],\"HtGbWD\":[\"I’d like to receive the Trezor newsletter.\"],\"Htnb06\":[\"Paid after timeout\"],\"Hv6XVm\":[\"Trezor Academy is an educational program designed to accelerate the global adoption of bitcoin. It features in-person sessions led by local bitcoin educators. All sessions are free to attend.\"],\"HzXDNW\":[[\"lengthOfFilteredModels\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[[\"lengthOfFilteredModels\"],\" Trezor model\"],\"other\":[[\"lengthOfFilteredModels\"],\" Trezor models\"]}]],\"I+JmSD\":[\"Open-source security and design\"],\"I/kume\":[\"No. The 10% Trezor Shop discount your friend receives from this program can’t be combined with other promotions or codes.\"],\"I0+wRo\":[\"Recover access to your digital assets with a new backup standard\"],\"I0pHYD\":[\"“I have been using the Trezor Safe 5 for over a year now and I’m completely satisfied with it. A huge advantage for me is that both the Firmware and Hardware are fully open source.”\"],\"I43Hlc\":[\"Is a Bitcoin-only hardware wallet more secure?\"],\"I5WS7w\":[\"How can I recover my funds with SLIP39?\"],\"I5uMS4\":[\"Coins \u003c0/\u003e\"],\"I7SNFO\":[\"The Trezor Keep Metal rocks a simple 4-letter recovery seed entry layout plus security seals, making sure it’s clear if anyone has tampered with your backup. On the flip side, the Cryptotag Zeus goes for the more complicated BIP-39 wordlist input without any tamper-seal protection, putting your recovery seed at risk.\"],\"I8g/BK\":[\"Explore all features\"],\"I9+8jZ\":[\"Protect your identity and coins.\"],\"I9hx7n\":[\"Stick \u0026 Slush\"],\"IAFYrP\":[\"Simple \u0026 effective navigation\"],\"IBz0Rf\":[\"Go to the Trezor newsletter subscription form\"],\"IC4Gd5\":[\"Check if your favorite coins \u0026 tokens are supported on Trezor, the Trezor Suite app, and \u003c0\u003ethird-party wallet apps\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"IDDYFS\":[\"How do I schedule my Trezor Expert Consultation?\"],\"IEAFaz\":[\"I’d like to join the Trezor Refer-a-friend rewards program and agree to \u003c0\u003ePrivacy policy\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"IIMI1D\":[\"Save selected\"],\"IIN6lo\":[\"A seed phrase, also known as a recovery seed or wallet backup, is like your wallet's safety words, a sequence of readable words to back up and recover your wallet. Private key, on the other hand, is your super-secret code, typically a long jumble of characters. It's what you use to sign transactions and access your crypto stored at a specific address.\"],\"IKODr9\":[\"Keeping your seed phrase safe and sound offline is super important when you're dealing with stuff like bitcoin, Ethereum, and other cryptocurrencies.This way, you can chill without worrying about hackers, hardware issues, or tricky social tricks messing with your coins.It's all about safeguarding your privacy and providing long-term resilience.\"],\"IMjmSq\":[\"Shop offers\"],\"IN63wL\":[\"Where can I buy the Trezor Safe 7 Bitcoin-only wallet?\"],\"IOLOAR\":[\"The best place to keep your coins super safe is offline. And guess what? You can easily do that with a Trezor hardware wallet. Once your coins are in there, they're all yours, and no one can mess with them. Don't forget to back up your wallet and stash it in a Trezor Metal Keep just to be extra safe, no matter what life throws at you.\"],\"IOMtQl\":[[\"amount\"],\"× \u003c0\u003e\",[\"itemName\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e as a free gift\"],\"IOr39w\":[\"Remove unavailable items from your cart to continue.\"],\"IPGI2o\":[\"Vic, USA\"],\"IQUuL+\":[\"SQL injection\"],\"ITFJnO\":[\"What's inside?\"],\"ITcB+x\":[\"Trezor is a physical device that protects your crypto from online hacks, malware \u0026 unauthorized access.\"],\"IWSbbY\":[\"No articles found for this tag\"],\"IYYkxX\":[\"All products \u0026 accessories\"],\"IYYqN/\":[\"Discover your\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eideal wallet\u003c