ypto\"],\"JGMkKO\":[\"Fire, water \u0026\u003c0/\u003eimpact-resistant\"],\"JHxGP5\":[\"Trade\"],\"JJ+vfH\":[\"South Africa\"],\"JLVZD+\":[\"Please enter a valid expiry date.\"],\"JMG5ld\":[\"Packaging \u0026 device security seals protect your Trezor’s integrity\"],\"JNCzPW\":[\"Country\"],\"JPFPJi\":[\"Labeling\"],\"JPmkpk\":[\"Warranty \u0026 RMA\"],\"JUfvGM\":[\"Secure pairing with Bluetooth 5.0+ devices\"],\"JWtByx\":[\"If paying with cryptocurrency, it's not recommended to pay directly from an exchange. This can result in an underpayment, causing the order to fail.\"],\"JXy8VB\":[\"Watch how to trade\"],\"JYKRJS\":[\"Stake\"],\"JZNkQQ\":[\"Watch guide video\"],\"JZTUgD\":[\"Why should I use Trezor Model One instead of holding crypto on an exchange?\"],\"JZwOun\":[\"Help us improve\"],\"JeJt+b\":[\"Adam, USA\"],\"JgTukh\":[\"World-Class Security\"],\"JlJfsj\":[\"Sorry, not possible, delivery process has already started. If you wish to cancel this order and create a new one, let us know and we will help you with it.\"],\"Jm5VF8\":[\"Users agree: for security and privacy, the Trezor Safe 5 delivers Trezor-level protection with a smooth user experience. With a built-in Secure Element layer, it acts as your ultimate guardian in the crypto world. Its large, true-color touchscreen and haptic feedback make managing your crypto easy. Supporting 1000s of coins and tokens, Trezor Safe 5 has your back, whatever you’re into.\"],\"JmxT4l\":[\"Please enter a valid last name\"],\"Jn7bhg\":[\"Get to know our awesome team of Trezor Experts. They’re here to walk you through setting up your hardware wallet with ease and give you the confidence to kickstart your crypto journey!\"],\"JoKHgi\":[\"Trezor supports your coin on these networks. Some may require a third-party wallet app.\u003c0\u003eLearn more\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"Jqo//f\":[\"Whatever your crypto journey looks like, Trezor gives you the power to do it safer — and with zero trade-offs.\"],\"Js+taO\":[\"Engineered for excellence. Designed to inspire.\"],\"JsIB7O\":[[\"0\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[\"Supported \",[\"name\"],\" Network\"],\"other\":[\"Supported \",[\"name\"],\" Networks\"]}]],\"JtItrJ\":[\"Buy, sell \u0026 swap\"],\"JtSIMa\":[\"Suite Updates\"],\"Jw4xpL\":[\"Is a Bluetooth connection less secure than a USB connection?\"],\"Jz+zd7\":[\"Secure the integrity of your backup\"],\"K/kOrM\":[\"An investigation into a lost package can be initiated if your order meets at least one of the following criteria:\"],\"K0eNWW\":[\"For a full list of supported cryptocurrencies, check out Supported Coins \u0026 Tokens.\"],\"K2ny7O\":[\"Trezor Suite app downloads\"],\"K5NRW+\":[\"Own Your Money\"],\"K9V4i2\":[\"Error fetching builds info. Please refresh the page.\"],\"KAi1V0\":[\"What does a quantum-ready hardware wallet mean?\"],\"KBwgvG\":[\"Manage your \",[\"name\"],\" with your Trezor hardware wallet synced with several wallet apps.\"],\"KCD/2u\":[\"Extra-durable PC-ABS plastic body\"],\"KCLsbQ\":[\"Friends get 10% off $49+ orders — you get $20 each.\"],\"KDUWLT\":[\"Our blog post\"],\"KF2MBS\":[\"VAT: \",[\"companyTaxNumber\"]],\"KHNg0v\":[\"Your privacy is important to us\"],\"KHsPMA\":[\"Why is my box different from what is shown on the website? How can I check if the product has not been tampered with?\"],\"KI0HWo\":[\"Get the latest on crypto security, Trezor tips \u0026 product updates.\"],\"KK/YLV\":[\"The Trezor Keep Metal Multi-share Backup is an advanced solution for securely storing your wallet backup. It’s made from durable stainless stain and is your best bet when it comes to keeping your cryptocurrency access safe and sound. Trezor elevates your wallet backup with unmatched practicality, functionality, and security.\"],\"KKLfmx\":[\"If an exchange fails, you lose your coins\"],\"KMWc6D\":[\"What’s the difference between Trezor Safe 5 and Trezor Safe 3?\"],\"KQUsIu\":[\"Shop now\"],\"KS7pW9\":[\"Trezor Hardware Wallet (Official) | Bitcoin \u0026 Crypto Security\"],\"KScsIx\":[\"