of your keys, protected by industry-leading security and no third-party risk.\"],\"L8rTz+\":[\"Monochromatic display \u003c0\u003e0.96\\\"\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"L938BX\":[\"Apply voucher\"],\"L9M80K\":[\"60-minute live, online Trezor Expert Consultation session in English\"],\"LA3Xo/\":[\"The idea of a hardware wallet is cemented \u0026 Trezor is off to the races.\"],\"LA66AX\":[\"Trezor Safe 3\"],\"LBPC9a\":[\"Special Offers\"],\"LCGtA/\":[\"Secure, split, and share your wallet backup\"],\"LCTj0f\":[\"Highlights from our community. Tweets, reviews, feedback and more.\"],\"LCVoXQ\":[\"Please enter city\"],\"LCbSjQ\":[\"Only \",[\"lengthOfFilteredModels\"],\" \u003c0\u003eTrezor\u003c/0\u003e models\"],\"LDxYx5\":[\"If you're still interested, place your order again in \u003c0\u003eour store\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"LE8IBO\":[\"We couldn’t confirm your payment with your card provider. Please contact them or try again.\"],\"LEbOpR\":[\"More details\"],\"LFo1uC\":[\"Invite your friends to Trezor and earn $20 for each order they place. They’ll get 10% off their first $49+ purchase. Help others stay safe in crypto with the world’s most trusted hardware wallet.\"],\"LH+K41\":[\"Setup \u0026 customize your backup configuration\"],\"LHwbIl\":[\"Your order’s been \u003c0\u003eplaced,\u003c/0\u003e congrats\"],\"LIUPrr\":[\"The service or wallet you used to send the payment has deducted fees from the final amount, so the full price has not been paid. This can happen when paying from an exchange.\"],\"LJDLoH\":[\"Compatible with \u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite app\u003c/0\u003e \u003c1/\u003eand \u003c2\u003ethird-party wallet apps\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"LJxepI\":[\"Trezor Keep Metal Shamir\"],\"LMUw1U\":[\"App\"],\"LPmEG5\":[\"Check your portfolio, manage assets, and keep your funds absolutely secure at home or on-the-go on any device.\"],\"LPvySO\":[\"Voucher removal failed. Please try again later.\"],\"LQLn/G\":[\"City cannot be longer than 100 characters\"],\"LTPBMY\":[\"How do I transfer my funds from an online exchange (including Coinbase and Binance) to Trezor Safe 3?\"],\"LVHvY4\":[\"Why has my order been canceled?\"],\"LVO7Bh\":[\"Trezor Safe 3 hardware wallet\"],\"LVo0UF\":[\"QR code for mobile app download\"],\"LXShfH\":[\"You must agree to the terms and conditions.\"],\"LcET2C\":[\"Privacy Policy\"],\"LeImZl\":[\"If you have used this asset with Trezor in the past, please contact our support team via the chat window for assistance.\"],\"LfTvBm\":[\"3.2V, 330mAh with built-in overheating protection\"],\"LftI5q\":[\"Get rewarded\"],\"LgnR35\":[\"For a safe bet on getting your hands on a new Trezor Model One, just head to the official Trezor Shop or check out one of our trusted resellers. These are your go-to options to make sure your device is the real deal, no funny business. And if you've got any questions about your Trezor purchase, don't hesitate to hit up Trezor Support. They've got your back!\"],\"Lh+ZIl\":[\"If you have your Confirmo crypto payment URL you can apply for a refund yourself using the same link that you used to pay. ****The URL starts with \u003c0\u003ehttps://confirmo.net/public/invoice\u003c/0\u003e and once clicked on Request refund button, you will need to fill in your preferred address where you would like the refund sent. If you do not have that payment URL please reach out to \u003c1\u003eTrezor support\u003c/1\u003e via our \u003c2\u003echatbot Hal\u003c/2\u003e. so we can assist you further.\"],\"LiQu1Z\":[\"Subscribe to Trezor's newsletter for updates on the latest in products and crypto security. Get exclusive tips on safeguarding your digital assets.\"],\"Likn1S\":[\"My discount code isn’t working—what should I do?\"],\"LjdWEx\":[\"Enhanced Security\"],\"LkVUv0\":[\"Trezor Suite Lite app for mobile\"],\"LlH+av\":[\"Punching tool\"],\"Lo4UqT\":[\"Who is a Trezor Expert Onboarding Session for?\"],\"LpBadF\":[\"Securely buy, sell, swap, and manage your crypto from the palm of your hand with any Android or iOS device.\"],\"LtRSbo\":[\"Failed to copy link\"],\"LtuVPE\":[\"Buy card illustration\"],\"LwBE4i\":[\"Deliver to\"],\"LwhCQ2\":[\"Transfer your \",[\"coinCode\"]],\"LxEYiw\":[\"Wallet-backup compatibility\"],\"LyjQNa\":[\"Once the \u003c0/\u003e transfer is complete, you can easily and securely manage your \u003c1/\u003e with your Trezor hardware wallet, all through the Trezor Suite app.\"],\"Lz6ejP\":[\"A hardware wallet is a secure physical device for sending, receiving, and storing cryptocurrencies and tokens offline. It ensures maximum security by never exposing your \u003c0\u003ewallet backup\u003c/0\u003e or sensitive data to an internet-connected environment like your PC or smartphone.\"],\"M0+EuN\":[\"Economy shipping is available in EU and several non-EU countries. Package tracking is limited.\"],\"M0dcUk\":[\"Step-by-step tutorials to easily set up and use your Trezor.\"],\"M33rsB\":[\"Fully wireless on\u003c0/\u003e mobile \u0026 desktop\"],\"M94jCE\":[\"Designing security in the open world\"],\"M9ZSOd\":[\"Other Trezor models (Trezor Safe 5, Safe 3, and earlier) rely on a wired connection. On iOS, wired accessories require Apple-specific licensing that isn’t supported by these models. This means they can be used to track your portfolio, view assets, and buy through integrated providers on iOS, but a desktop or Android device is required to sign transactions.\"],\"MAuu98\":[\"\u003c0\u003eDescription\u003c/0\u003e – A thorough explanation of the bug and its potential impact.\"],\"MBVmDf\":[\"Blockbook server exploitation\"],\"MCd0Az\":[\"Backpack, MyEtherWallet, Exodus, MetaMask, Rabbit, Lace, Ronin, and Monero wallet logos\"],\"MDIcYi\":[\"Secure access\"],\"MG32El\":[\"Buy \u0026 sell on \u003c0/\u003eyour own terms\"],\"MJEQHz\":[\"First-ever security feature against quantum-powered threats\"],\"MJzLbj\":[\"What happens to my crypto assets if I lose my Trezor?\"],\"ML7omr\":[\"Trezor.io\"],\"MMsdK0\":[\"62%\"],\"MQfQOh\":[\"Take full control—no reliance on others for access to your funds\"],\"MR/Gs/\":[\"At Trezor, we’ve always believed in empowering individuals to take control of their financial freedom and make their own destiny. As one of the pioneers of crypto security, we stand for self-custody, financial education, and the democratization of Bitcoin access worldwide. The Freedom Edition reflects this ethos—giving you the opportunity to own a piece of history while directly supporting initiatives like Trezor Academy, which bring Bitcoin education to those who need it most.\"],\"MR5ygV\":[\"This link is no longer valid\"],\"MUVGFV\":[\"The Trezor Safe 7 isn't just another hardware wallet. It's built for transparency, usability, and long-term security. With dual Secure Elements, a full-color intuitive touchscreen, wireless and wired options, open-source firmware, and a quantum-ready foundation, you stay in charge of your assets and privacy without relying on hidden components or closed NDAs. Advanced backup options, including multi-share Backup and Passphrase Protection, give you extra control and peace of mind, ensuring your funds are always protected.\"],\"MVDxj/\":[\"basket icon\"],\"MX3Yg/\":[\"Open-source security\"],\"MbOt+N\":[\"for each capsule\u003c0/\u003e115x30 mm / 475 g\u003c1/\u003e4.5x1.2 in / 16.8 oz\"],\"MdiHNH\":[\"Please enter last name\"],\"MhPYgj\":[\"An intuitive, secure companion app that puts full control in your hands. Track, manage, trade, and transact seamlessly on \u003c0\u003edesktop and mobile with Trezor Suite\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"MiE4ZU\":[\"freedom\"],\"Mj+9ja\":[\"Something went wrong: \",[\"message\"]],\"MkHGrQ\":[\"Upgrade effortlessly from Single-share to Multi-share backup\"],\"MkLasO\":[\"Step-by-step instructions for everything\"],\"Mo27NG\":[\"Turn referrals into rewards\"],\"Mp78Wt\":[\"Trezor Suite is your crypto powerhouse for managing, sending, and trading assets on \u003c0\u003edesktop \u0026 mobile.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"MpXGqi\":[\"\u003c0\u003eWe started\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ethe industry\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"MqbQEE\":[\"Official Trezor logos, typography, and visual style guidelines.\"],\"Mqy/Zy\":[\"United States\"],\"Mr7QiK\":[\"Please enter message\"],\"MwF6T6\":[\"Learn advanced security features to protect your assets\"],\"MxNP76\":[\"Why it’s safer\"],\"MyTiQL\":[\"Your transactions stay secure, with your assets protected in your Trezor wallet after the trade.\"],\"MzZ/8w\":[\"Review every detail and sign all transactions with crystal-clear confidence on our biggest, brightest color display yet.\"],\"N+gd2i\":[\"The Trezor Metal Keep Multi-share Backup is an advanced solution for securely storing your wallet backup. It’s made from durable stainless stain and is your best bet when it comes to keeping your cryptocurrency access safe and sound. Trezor elevates your wallet backup with unmatched practicality, functionality, and security.\"],\"N0qXpE\":[\"Products\"],\"N10HSt\":[\"Shop Now\"],\"N1A11t\":[\"Connect \u0026 learn from our community.\"],\"N2UrKp\":[\"Premium aluminum unibody\"],\"N39Ax4\":[\"Ethereum\"],\"N3bJX2\":[\"Peace of mind\"],\"N40H+G\":[\"All\"],\"N4en3S\":[\"Fully wireless experience\"],\"N5+9+C\":[\"Are there hidden fees when using Trezor?\"],\"N6Fn7f\":[\"Alternatively you can purchase your order by cryptocurrency. You can pay with Bitcoin, Bitcoin Lightning, Ethereum or Litecoin via Confirmo. You can also try to use one of our\"],\"N6PW9K\":[\"Please enter a valid city name\"],\"N7yZt/\":[\"Anti-spam check failed, please try again\"],\"N8LjOf\":[\"I got my Trezor from a reseller and it stopped working, can you replace it?\"],\"NEE4yh\":[\"Tracking link has been sent to your email.\"],\"NIMf1D\":[\"Maximum satisfaction! \u003c0\u003eI’m not a tech-savvy person\u003c/0\u003e, but even I can easily navigate the Trezor Suite. My Trezor One worked flawlessly for several years, and I’ve had no issues with the Trezor Safe 3 either. The \u003c1\u003einstallation was simple, and using it is a breeze\u003c/1\u003e. I found all the necessary installation videos on web.\"],\"NIv1PT\":[\"Add a Trezor Expert Consultation session to your cart and complete your order. If you don’t have a Trezor hardware wallet, be sure to purchase one through the Trezor Shop.\"],\"NJw7Fy\":[\"Event Previews\"],\"NKriyB\":[\"Recover your wallet from multiple shares\"],\"NLZVPO\":[\"Buy, Sell, and Swap Cryptocurrencies with World-Class Security and Ease\"],\"NLbSqU\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite app\u003c/0\u003e is an app designed to work with \",[\"coinName\"],\", available on desktop, web \u0026 mobile.\"],\"NN2qkS\":[\"Trezor supports 1000s\u003c0/\u003e of coins \u0026 tokens\"],\"NO0Ze0\":[\"Once you complete your purchase, click on the link in your order confirmation email to book your session. Simply select a date and time.\"],\"NOmDyv\":[\"Share on Telegram\"],\"NQ6ypt\":[\"Vulnerability class\"],\"NRJ3Hu\":[\"Plug in your device and follow the steps to set up your Trezor hardware wallet. This takes about 15 minutes.\"],\"NTRW2g\":[\"Voucher $\",[\"promoCodeName\"]],\"NU/Si5\":[\"Made \u003c0\u003eTough\u003c/0\u003e Easy\"],\"NUWtZM\":[\"Simple setup and use\"],\"NV9voA\":[\"Reassuring touch with every interaction\"],\"NYM3S5\":[\"PIN \u0026 passphrase protection\"],\"NYu4zA\":[\"Package size \u0026 weight\"],\"Na6zmY\":[\"Compatibility\"],\"Nanq00\":[\"Your personal data may be exposed\"],\"Nb+ASz\":[\"You can reschedule your Trezor Expert Onboarding Session once, but you must do so at least 72 hours before the session begins. Rescheduling isn’t possible if your session is scheduled to start within 72 hours.\"],\"NdEoka\":[\"There’s no limit. Your link can be used as many times as you like. You’ll earn $20 for every successful order over $49.\"],\"NdN5Mo\":[\"We couldn’t process your payment of \u003c0\u003e\",[\"price\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e for your order \u003c1\u003e#\",[\"orderNumber\"],\"\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"NdkYOC\":[\"Product size \u0026 weight\"],\"NfebWP\":[\"100x100x13 mm / 44 g\u003c0/\u003e3.9x3.9x0.5 in / 1.55 oz\"],\"NgNacf\":[\"Refer up to 50 friends per year, earning $20 for each referral (up to $1,000/year).\"],\"NgNkFF\":[\"All-metal body for exceptional build quality\"],\"Nhkg5Y\":[\"What topics will the session cover?\"],\"NhpOGP\":[\"Zip / Postal code cannot be longer than \",[\"postcodeLength\"],\" characters\"],\"NihQNk\":[\"Customers\"],\"NipOUO\":[\"We bleed security, so do our devices. We take every measure to eliminate any space for unauthorized activities within our wallets. Once a Trezor is in your hands, the torch of responsibility is passed to you, ensuring the ongoing security of your wallet.\"],\"Nk4ved\":[\"Selected product is out of stock.\"],\"Nl5Gkz\":[\"Coin Management\"],\"Nn4jSP\":[\"Enhance your knowledge with educational pieces that demystify the world of Bitcoin.\"],\"Nr8hxm\":[\"AISI 304 aerospace grade stainless steel with a durable black surface treatment\"],\"NrvJBR\":[\"A smartphone displaying a \\\"Bitcoin news December\\\" article is encircled by a green ribbon that transforms into a Bitcoin symbol at its end.\"],\"NvfzsU\":[\"Thousands of Coins.\"],\"O+mFt5\":[\"Watch how it works\"],\"O/UsnV\":[\"Wallet setup isn't currently available on the Android app. Continue in your browser or visit this page on your computer.\"],\"O0PFYo\":[\"All UK orders are shipped from our UK warehouse, to ensure a fast hassle free delivery for our UK customers.\"],\"O37aqb\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor hardware wallets\u003c/0\u003e are also sold on the official \u003c1\u003eTrezor Amazon store\u003c/1\u003e. Products sold through Amazon are kept separate from other inventory and are safe to use as long as they pass \u003c2\u003estandard security checks\u003c/2\u003e.\"],\"O3dBQe\":[\"Recommended by\"],\"O3oNi5\":[\"Email\"],\"O8bR+4\":[\"Value owning a limited-edition product that symbolizes freedom and self-custody\"],\"O8dBLE\":[\"Industry standards for improved wallet usability, security \u0026 user experience.\"],\"O9A3ht\":[\"My reward isn’t working—what should I do?\"],\"OAp2B2\":[[\"networkCount\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[\"1 network\"],\"other\":[[\"networkCount\"],\" networks\"]}]],\"OApLSW\":[\"Tax (\",[\"percentage\"],\"%)\"],\"OBFIW5\":[\"Trezor Suite is your powerhouse for managing, sending, and tracking bitcoin on \u003c0\u003edesktop \u0026 mobile.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"OBUbeD\":[\"Tech specs\"],\"OD8NZa\":[\"What are the reviews of Trezor Model T?\"],\"ODfWks\":[\"To move your crypto from your online exchange to your Trezor, connect your Trezor device, open Trezor Suite app, and enter your PIN. Then, select your receiving account and copy the wallet address. Log into your online exchange, choose the cryptocurrency, paste the address, and confirm the transaction. Your crypto will be securely transferred to your Trezor hardware wallet.\"],\"OHeWAE\":[\"In case you consider this a sensitive matter, we will provide instructions on how to set up a Signal encrypted channel.\"],\"OIUUeC\":[\"Reclaim funds\"],\"OJsxs8\":[\"Thank you! Your message was successfully sent.\"],\"ONa4x2\":[\"Use the security of your Trezor hardware wallet to safely manage your \",[\"name\"],\".\"],\"OO0gQp\":[\"Select from a wide range of languages to easily manage your assets in Trezor Suite app, in the language that suits you best.\"],\"OR+WZn\":[\"Hide your identity \u0026 online activity\"],\"ORltDj\":[\"Get the right tools in Trezor Suite to safely send, receive, trade, and manage your coins. Increase your transaction security and privacy with coin control, and the Tor network.\"],\"OSRvgd\":[\"Contact person\"],\"OXhbzV\":[\"Trezor Suite Compatibility\"],\"OZBumg\":[\"Required for basic website functionality and anonymous tracking to support marketing campaigns.\"],\"OacBxK\":[\"Trade crypto confidently with Trezor Suite. Buy, sell \u0026 exchange coins securely - right from your hardware wallet, with no hidden fees or risks.\"],\"Ocxo+p\":[\"The Trezor Keep Metal rocks a simple four-letter wallet backup entry layout plus security seals, making sure it’s clear if anyone has tampered with your backup. On the flip side, the Cryptotag Zeus goes for the more complicated BIP-39 wordlist input without any tamper-seal protection, putting your wallet backup at risk.\"],\"Ofxc4g\":[\"What's the difference between Bitcoin-only Trezor Safe 5 and universal Trezor Safe 5?\"],\"OiItG+\":[\"More articles (\",[\"restArticlesCount\"],\")\"],\"Ok/O6P\":[\"Discover how to manage your crypto\"],\"OkofjH\":[\"Recover\"],\"OlA3b6\":[\"Refer a friend tooltip\"],\"On8Z0U\":[\"Learn how we process your data in our \u003c0\u003eTerms of Service\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"OnldDA\":[\"Do More with Your Crypto — No Stress\"],\"OpUGAt\":[\"Buy, sell and swap cryptocurrencies with the safety and security of your hardware wallet, \u003c0\u003eall within the Trezor Suite app.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eall within the Trezor Suite app.\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"OsJNLT\":[\"Use Trezor with 30+ wallet apps\"],\"OsyrJd\":[\"Secured by your hardware wallet\"],\"Otbbk4\":[\"Lost parcel\"],\"OvwyLs\":[\"We’re a group of talented, like-minded individuals with a common goal to bring crypto accessibility and security to all.\"],\"OzKkMt\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite\u003c/0\u003e is a desktop and mobile app that connects to your Trezor, making it easy to securely send, receive, buy, sell, swap, and stake your coins \u0026 tokens—all in one place.\"],\"P+Dnbg\":[\"Trusted touch navigation\"],\"P/3YWz\":[\"60-minute live, online Trezor Expert Onboarding Session in English\"],\"P/PEbj\":[\"Compare exchanges, choose the best offer and trade.\"],\"P/etpg\":[\"Restore and Setup\"],\"P0r2pA\":[\"153x100x35 mm / 455 g\u003c0/\u003e6.0 x 3.9 x 1.4 in / 16.0 oz\"],\"P1JVB0\":[\"Trezor Hardware Wallet Accessories | Get Swag For Your Wallet\"],\"P33NHx\":[\"Strengthen self-sovereignty with multi-share. Become an early adopter today!\"],\"P3FYCT\":[\"Download Trezor Suite for desktop for the best experience, or click “Continue in browser” to open the web app.\"],\"P3eEl/\":[\"The text you entered is too long.\"],\"P4PBFr\":[\"A man wearing glasses and wireless earbuds sits at a desk, thoughtfully looking at a computer monitor displaying a Trezor Suite dashboard. He holds a Trezor Save 5 in one hand and rests his chin on the other. The background features neon Bitcoin symbols and a dimly lit room with purple and blue lighting, creating a modern, tech-focused atmosphere.\"],\"P4rgQ7\":[\"Solid security and proven reliability in every Trezor.\"],\"P5JGPi\":[\"included\"],\"P7C2Sm\":[\"Security where it \u003c0\u003ematters most\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"P8Aitc\":[\"Write your wallet backup on the paper card included with your Trezor, or choose \u003c0\u003eTrezor Keep Metal\u003c/0\u003e for lifetime durability.\"],\"P8fBlG\":[\"Authentication\"],\"PAW68k\":[\"Transferring your cryptocurrency from your online exchange to your Trezor is a breeze. Start by connecting your Trezor Model One, launching Trezor Suite app, and entering your PIN. Then, select your preferred receiving account and copy the wallet address. Switch to your online exchange, choose the cryptocurrency, paste the address, and confirm the transaction. That’s it!\"],\"PBUwPw\":[\"Made Easy\"],\"PBfZ94\":[\"If you are interested in more information in the meantime, please read our\"],\"PDpC+c\":[\"Your Trezor works with a wide range of third-party wallets and apps! Check out the full list, discover new features, and see how to keep your crypto safe while using the tools you love.\"],\"PEIEZP\":[\"Online exchanges\"],\"PEJRo4\":[\"Control your crypto assets with ease\"],\"PEr6Lm\":[\"Bounty Program.\u003c0/\u003e Empower. Secure. Innovate.\"],\"PFxVst\":[\"Clear voucher\"],\"PH0Df/\":[\"Explore decentralized services like Aave and OpenSea safely. Your keys stay secured in Trezor, never exposed.\"],\"PHXBVv\":[\"Resolved vulnerabilities\"],\"PIFO4s\":[\"You can reschedule your Trezor Expert Consultation once, but you must do so at least 72 hours before the session begins. Rescheduling isn’t possible if your session is scheduled to start within 72 hours.\"],\"PIS06w\":[\"In case you had an issue with your payment or the delivery of your order, please, let us know via the chat bubble in the bottom right corner where our chatbot Hal and our support team will be happy to assist you!\"],\"PLCGYw\":[\"Trezor Keep Metal 20-word\"],\"PLWL/o\":[\"By clicking \\\"Agree and continue\\\", you give Trezor permission to share your name and email address with Trustpilot so you can leave a review. Your name will appear with your review on Trustpilot. Submission of the review and use of Trustpilot are governed by their \u003c0\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/0\u003e and \u003c1\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"PM2gtJ\":[\"Missing holographic seal\"],\"POwVRQ\":[\"Durable PC-ABS plastic, tamper-evident casing, anodized aluminum backplates, and intricate laser engraving.\"],\"PQQM/b\":[\"Please enter subject\"],\"PQeJqS\":[\"Contains:\"],\"PRJZ6m\":[\"Monero icon\"],\"PRdbG6\":[\"I am new to the whole crypto world and I'm very satisfied with my Trezor 5. \u003c0\u003eSet up was super simple and now all my coins are safe.\u003c/0\u003e It's a great feeling knowing I don't have to worry about an exchange being hacked or going under.\"],\"PSGjEt\":[\"Terms of Use\"],\"PTgcSZ\":[\"Supported third-party wallet apps\"],\"PTngrY\":[\"No resellers in \",[\"countryName\"],\".\"],\"PUgdmm\":[\"Download for Windows\"],\"PXnPLH\":[\"\u003c0\u003eCode\u003c/0\u003e – A proof of concept demonstrating the issue.\"],\"PZ8qXR\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Shop supports Google Pay, Apple Pay, debit/credit card, Bitcoin and selected cryptocurrencies for order payment.\u003c/0\u003eIf paying with cryptocurrency, it's not recommended to pay directly from an exchange. This can result in an underpayment, causing the order to fail.\"],\"Pb+bGC\":[\"Wireless security comes built in with the Trezor Safe 7. Both Bluetooth and USB-C connections are secured with open-source Trezor Host Protocol (THP), which encrypts every command and transaction to ensure no one can intercept, alter, or inject malicious messages. The wallet stays invisible to unknown devices and uses open-source encryption to ensure it connects only with trusted devices and applications, keeping your wireless connections protected.\"],\"Pck8tZ\":[\"12-, 20- \u0026 24-word \u003c0\u003ewallet backup\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"Pf/N3S\":[\"High-performance STM32U5G ARM Cortex M33 processor (160MHz)\"],\"PiH3UR\":[\"Copied!\"],\"PlDDnl\":[\"Secure your backup in a resilient steel design\"],\"PlDY/Y\":[\"\u003c0\u003eGive us time to fix the issue\u003c/0\u003e before disclosing it publicly.\"],\"PmAia2\":[\"Track balances\"],\"PmzURA\":[\"The hardware wallet that changes crypto security forever.\"],\"PqLf9j\":[\"Restore anytime\"],\"PqkBsI\":[\"Add an extra layer of security built directly into your Trezor device.\"],\"PsJD5M\":[\"Error setting the shipping method. Please try again.\"],\"PspKO4\":[\"The card's expiry date you entered is invalid. Please enter the valid expiry date and try again.\"],\"PuaRCS\":[\"Sounds like a place for you?\"],\"Pw3pGz\":[\"Tanzania\"],\"Px2w0O\":[\"Start now with Trezor Suite\"],\"Q0bIPo\":[\"Connect your Trezor wallet to Trezor Suite to securely manage, send, buy \u0026 trade crypto, and explore the wider ecosystem.\"],\"Q179L4\":[\"Share on WhatsApp\"],\"Q2AUH/\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 combines the TROPIC01 chip with an additional NDA-free EAL6+ secure element for the strongest physical protection in the industry.\"],\"Q2lUR2\":[\"Currency\"],\"Q3o8yk\":[\"Ultra-tough screen, ready for everyday use\"],\"Q4yJwb\":[\"Vulnerabilities in trading or staking sections\"],\"Q55R98\":[\"Find out how to choose the correct network for your Trezor.\"],\"Q5RTui\":[\"Get your \u003c0\u003e\",[\"code\"],\" wallet\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"Q6KJkZ\":[\"Your hardware wallet acts like a digital vault. It handles transactions offline, ensuring your precious crypto data is safe from internet exposure. It’s the smart way to manage your cryptocurrencies.\"],\"Q7Es43\":[\"More at satoshilabs.com\"],\"Q7nLg4\":[\"Up to 40% off\"],\"QAVLbJ\":[\"Future-proof your crypto security with Trezor Safe 7's quantum-ready architecture\u003c0\u003e—the only hardware wallet capable of receiving quantum-secure updates against threats of tomorrow.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"QFOc85\":[\"Early Access Program\"],\"QI5TgB\":[\"Please enter street\"],\"QIzCb5\":[\"Slip\u003c0\u003e39\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"QJBSGy\":[\"Trezor Expert Session\"],\"QLBjI4\":[\"It's required to agree to the Terms of Service.\"],\"QMSWKW\":[\"What if I lose my hardware wallet?\"],\"QOG8/9\":[\"Unlock the Ecosystem\"],\"QPahoP\":[\"Is wireless connectivity secure, and can I use the wallet without Bluetooth?\"],\"QQIC2k\":[\"IP54 Protection\"],\"QSZYwx\":[\"Kenya\"],\"QVHGMV\":[\"My credit card payment did not go through, what should I do?\"],\"QVuTI6\":[\"Lost, stolen, or damaged Trezor? Easily recover access to your coins with your wallet backup created during setup.\"],\"QWT1vh\":[\"Please make sure that the product is still under warranty (see the next question).\"],\"QWTNjz\":[\"540 x 380 pixels\"],\"QZSF/M\":[\"12+ years in crypto security\"],\"QasO5M\":[\"What does a hardware wallet do?\"],\"Qca3rH\":[\"Crypto hardware wallets\"],\"QcoDOK\":[\"Denial of Service attacks\"],\"Qh7tWs\":[\"Can I still use DeFi, NFTs, or swap coins with Trezor?\"],\"QhKCDO\":[\"Seamlessly manage crypto on any device with open-source encrypted Bluetooth and enjoy cable-free simplicity with Qi2-compatible wireless charging.\"],\"QiqqLB\":[\"Signing key 2020\"],\"QkH1ni\":[\"This may take a few minutes. We’ll notify you by email once it’s complete. You can refresh the status anytime.\"],\"QkYSVh\":[\"Delivery time may vary between two days to six weeks depending on your location and your national post service.\"],\"QlApKl\":[\"Earn More With Staking\"],\"QmX73s\":[\"Your wallet backup is your wallet's safety words, a sequence of readable words to back up and recover your wallet. Private key, on the other hand, is your super-secret code, typically a long jumble of characters. It's what you use to sign transactions and access your crypto stored at a specific address.\"],\"QollkT\":[\"Set up your Trezor and the Trezor Suite app in minutes. No experience needed, and you can start with any amount.\"],\"QpDn2Z\":[\"$$10 goes to supporting Trezor Academy\"],\"QpGVJx\":[\"The hardware wallet that redefines bitcoin security forever\"],\"Qt8sp3\":[\"We believe that crypto security and accessibility can make the world a better, more just place.\"],\"QuMAZI\":[\"Suite downloads\"],\"QvBRqJ\":[\"Pre-marking pen\"],\"Qw+Xyp\":[\"Liberty Bronze backplate, symbolizing independence\"],\"QwKaHy\":[\"I don't want the order after all, I want my money back\"],\"R+jGPL\":[\"\u003c0\u003eSupported\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eCoins \u0026 Tokens\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"R/+uB8\":[\"Scroll to the Bundles section\"],\"R05oXu\":[\"Eliminate mistakes by marking letters\"],\"R1lLpJ\":[\"\u003c0\u003eThousands of Coins.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eOne secure device.\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"R2l9Y4\":[\"Do I really need to worry about quantum threats today?\"],\"R3UVaQ\":[\"The UK orders are shipped from Manchester.\"],\"R4erZg\":[\"More than just a physical wallet, the Trezor Safe 7 is the ideal decentralized wallet to provide a gateway to the crypto ecosystem while keeping your assets private, secure, and fully under your control.\"],\"R55t0R\":[\"Product safety guide\"],\"R5Cb2K\":[\"View styleguide\"],\"R5Gylp\":[\"Suite Terms of Use\"],\"R8NGLx\":[\"Independence isn’t given—it’s taken. \u003c0\u003eBreak free from centralized power and take control of your financial freedom with Trezor.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"R8eVDa\":[\"This coin will be deprecated soon.\"],\"RA55Iu\":[\"Company name\"],\"RArjiQ\":[\"A physical shield for\u003c0/\u003eyour data\"],\"RB6FQ9\":[\"For detailed information about how to return an item and situations in which a return will not be possible, please check the terms of our refund policy, which you can read under section 7 of our Trezor \u003c0\u003eEshop Terms of Use\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"RCItpQ\":[\"Standard (expedited) shipping\"],\"RDdrXL\":[\"The best place to keep your coins super safe is offline. And guess what? You can easily do that with a Trezor hardware wallet. Once your coins are in there, they’re all yours, and no one can mess with them. Don’t forget to back up your wallet and stash it in a Trezor Metal Keep just to be extra safe, no matter what life throws at you.\"],\"RE08w3\":[\"Session booking\"],\"REZtuo\":[\"Damaged parcel upon delivery\"],\"RIf//Q\":[\"Can I use my phone for my Trezor Expert Onboarding Session?\"],\"RJ5gAM\":[\"Efficient, responsive navigation on a large display\"],\"RMWlyo\":[\"Trading isn’t available in the iOS version of Trezor Suite just yet. We’re currently working on bringing it to the App Store and awaiting regulation approval. Once approved, trading will gradually roll out, with availability depending on regional regulations.\"],\"ROYb1R\":[\"Our biggest savings ever on the Trezor Safe Family\"],\"ROi2UV\":[\"Hide your sensitive information from potential unwanted onlookers.\"],\"RQlFFj\":[\"No trading\"],\"RS0o7b\":[\"State\"],\"RVT6yO\":[\"Get it here\"],\"RVtSPs\":[\"Country of delivery\"],\"RWOQkb\":[\"Get your wallet\"],\"RWw9Lg\":[\"Close modal\"],\"RX8SJ0\":[\"Support the blockchain and collect rewards\"],\"RXPWHM\":[\"Mobile app\"],\"RXRv8K\":[\"\u003c0\u003eOne wallet\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eZero limits\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"Rbp+dM\":[\"\u003c0\u003eDiscover your\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eideal wallet\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"RgAhLY\":[\"What’s the difference between Bitcoin-only Trezor Safe 3 and universal Trezor Safe 3?\"],\"RgkjdO\":[\"Once you complete a payment on Confirmo payment gateway, bookmark the page, as you can use it later to check on your payment status.\"],\"RkXlPZ\":[\"GitHub\"],\"RmZRLs\":[\"Google Pay payment failed. Please try again later.\"],\"Rpvvgs\":[\"Trezor Suite app\"],\"RtHGDr\":[\"Canada\"],\"RuK8kc\":[\"We were unable to authenticate your purchase with a third-party. Check with your payment card provider or try again. \"],\"Rury98\":[\"Check balances, buy, \u0026 receive crypto\"],\"RvuY+h\":[\"Screenshot of a mobile email newsletter from Trezor titled “Trezor Pulse.” The header includes the Trezor logo, a green illustration of a rising chart and a checkmark, and the text “Welcome to the Monthly Trezor Pulse.” The body of the email begins with a greeting and an introduction summarizing January’s updates, followed by a section titled “Product / Tech headlines of the month.\"],\"Rw/KVQ\":[\"No stress! Get a new Trezor from the Trezor Shop or an official reseller. Then use your \u003c0\u003ewallet backup\u003c/0\u003e, which you created when setting up your first wallet, to regain access to your funds on the new wallet. Need help? Reach out to Trezor Support.\"],\"RxIudq\":[\"View. Tap. Feel. Confirm.\"],\"RyQRel\":[\"Privacy and Security\"],\"RzkKDw\":[\"The best place to keep your coins super safe is offline. And guess what? You can easily do that with a Trezor hardware wallet. Once your coins are in there, they’re all yours, and no one can mess with them. Don’t forget to back up your wallet and stash it in a Trezor Keep Metal just to be extra safe, no matter what life throws at you.\"],\"S1xYlg\":[\"Safeguard your wealth \u003c0/\u003e with Keep Metal\"],\"S3auW+\":[\"Trezor Suite is your crypto powerhouse for managing, sending, and trading assets on \u003c0\u003edesktop \u0026 mobile.\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"S7VQ+F\":[\"USB-C connection\"],\"S7vHVc\":[\"Dual Secure Elements with TROPIC01\"],\"S8377m\":[\"About your company\"],\"S8WKLf\":[\"Can my friend combine the 10% with other promotions?\"],\"S8yo4k\":[\"Yes, the 10% discount is valid on orders of USD 49 or more. Make sure your cart meets this requirement before applying the code.\"],\"SDk2+P\":[\"Trusted by over 2 million customers\"],\"SEdoIl\":[\"Engineered for lasting power\"],\"SH4zyF\":[\"Download Trezor Suite\"],\"SHcKyP\":[\"See open positions\"],\"SMMfxf\":[\"Track your portfolio balance\"],\"SOaTa5\":[\"e.g. Satoshi Nakamoto\"],\"SRGGyN\":[\"Own a piece of history—\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003ebefore it’s gone\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"SSRWkZ\":[\"Standard features of all three models\"],\"SSyZJE\":[\"Now in Trezor Suite!\"],\"STJz1y\":[\"Share on X\"],\"SURR9s\":[\"Model One\"],\"SVYu8H\":[\"Invite a friend and earn $20 when they order. They’ll get 10% off their order of $49 or more.\"],\"SWOlw0\":[\"\u003c0\u003eSecure Element safeguards assets in your Trezor hardware wallet from online and offline threats. With a customizable PIN of up to 50 digits, your device remains inaccessible to unauthorized users.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eYou can utilize a passphrase which is required each time you access your Trezor wallet, adding an additional layer of protection.\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"SWRXKr\":[\"Trezor Keep Metal 24-word\"],\"SY4mk0\":[\"Trezor Safe 5 color options\"],\"SYWcWn\":[\"Private key extraction\"],\"SZ7U0I\":[\"The bootloader verifies the firmware signature each time you connect your Trezor to a computer. \u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite app will only accept the device if the installed firmware is correctly signed by SatoshiLabs\u003c/0\u003e. If unofficial firmware has been installed, your device will flash a warning sign on its screen upon being connected to a computer.\"],\"SZx7sM\":[\"Trade \u0026 earn confidently\"],\"Sdaz0z\":[\"Trezor's enhanced 20-word backup standard offers superior wallet security with no single point of failure. It offers an effortlessly upgrade from single-share to multi-share backup.\"],\"SdrTLF\":[\"Designed for Shamir Backup wallet backup\"],\"Sdv9cS\":[\"64x39x10 mm / 22 g\u003c0/\u003e2.52x1.54x0.39 in / 0.77 oz\"],\"Sfo8Wl\":[\"For Trezor users, apps like MetaMask or Electrum provide access to cryptocurrencies or features not supported in Trezor Suite. These apps rely on the hardware wallet to securely store private keys, ensuring safety even if the app itself is compromised.\"],\"SfrAmR\":[\"\u003c0\u003eManage your crypto\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ein Trezor Suite app\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"Sg6HVX\":[\"Reclaim your funds with Confirmo\"],\"ShO/tV\":[\"Protect your assets with advanced security \u0026 privacy features—already on your Trezor hardware wallet and Trezor Suite app.\"],\"SijKyJ\":[\"Advanced hardware security and fully open-source code protect millions of Trezor users every day.\"],\"SlPYSC\":[\"Device protection\"],\"SmeZs8\":[\"Hi there, our team is happy and ready to answer your question. Please fill out the form below and we will get in touch as soon as possible.\"],\"SnmODw\":[\"Vouchers can be combined on a single order but may not be valid for all products.\"],\"SrLCI4\":[\"The full \",[\"title\"]],\"Ssk3i6\":[\"Durable battery\"],\"St5oCV\":[\"Discover what a hardware wallet does and why it's the safest way to protect your crypto.\"],\"StLmU2\":[\"Something went wrong. Please refresh the page. If the issue persists, \u003c0\u003econtact our support\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"SuBOpq\":[\"If you would like to take a closer look at our position in relation to foreign governmental bodies, please refer to section 5.10 of the Trezor \u003c0\u003eEshop Terms of Use\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"Sv9CFq\":[\"Secure Element \u003c0/\u003e Certified Chip EAL6+\"],\"SxjRFb\":[\"Please contact \u003c0\u003eTrezor support\u003c/0\u003e via our \u003c1\u003echatbot Hal\u003c/1\u003e if you believe that your package has been lost.\"],\"SytIYE\":[\"To securely purchase a new Trezor Safe 5 hardware wallet, visit the official Trezor Shop or one of our trusted resellers. Using these channels ensures your device is genuine, unaltered, and authentic. If you have any questions about your Trezor purchase, contact Trezor Support.\"],\"Szu6qx\":[\"In contrast, a software wallet, also referred to as a hot wallet or online wallet, is software-based and keeps private keys stored on internet-connected devices like computers, smartphones, or cloud services. While software wallets are convenient and easy to set up, they are more vulnerable to cyber threats, including hacking and phishing attacks, due to their constant connection to the internet.\"],\"T1CqDj\":[\"Make your Trezor untouchable\"],\"T1giml\":[\"Application Process\"],\"T3Bj32\":[\"Search supported coins \u0026 tokens\"],\"T4NkIc\":[\"No results found for \u003c0\u003e\\\"\",[\"term\"],\"“\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"T57OwD\":[\"Answers are just an email away—real people, ready to help you.\"],\"T6T65i\":[\"One or more of your card's details aren’t correct. Double-check your card number, CVC, or expiration date and try again.\"],\"T91vKp\":[\"Play\"],\"TCRG0x\":[\"Address poisoning protection\"],\"TCgH28\":[\"Increased privacy with \u003c0\u003ecoin control\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"TDKlO/\":[\"USB-C → USB-A cable\"],\"TGgdDU\":[\"Aerospace grade stainless steel\"],\"TId9dP\":[\"After completing your order on the Trezor Shop, you’ll get a purchase confirmation email with a link to schedule your session. Select a date and time from the available options, and you’ll soon be on your way to setting up your Trezor.\"],\"TJBHlP\":[\"Standard\"],\"TLTetO\":[\"ZIP/Postal code must be at least 3 characters\"],\"TLa9Xw\":[\"Secure the integrity of your device\"],\"TMjt14\":[\"Be the first to know of exclusive discounts and promotions.\"],\"TN9454\":[\"Touchscreen\"],\"TOv9Wb\":[\"Go to forum\"],\"TPhJso\":[\"Pick your newsletter!\"],\"TQbbcp\":[\"We’ve worked hard to make crypto security easy and accessible. Our customers have played a big part in that mission.\"],\"TQlcBS\":[\"The world’s first auditable Secure Element, TROPIC01, sets a new standard with radically transparent crypto protection and the most advanced hardware security ever created.\"],\"TSSxNh\":[\"Your discount code\"],\"TSYCiX\":[\"Feel confident knowing that your security advice comes directly from our trusted team of experienced and knowledgeable in-house specialists.\"],\"TUt9Cc\":[\"Accessories\"],\"TVQpdq\":[\"Make it more difficult to trace your internet activity.\"],\"TVtJma\":[\"\u003c0\u003eOnline \u003c/0\u003eexchanges\"],\"TW7oLn\":[\"How do I transfer my funds from an online exchange (including Coinbase and Binance) to Trezor Model One?\"],\"TWSTQ/\":[\"Do I need a Trezor hardware wallet for the session?\"],\"TWvN/r\":[[\"days\"],\"d \",[\"hours\"],\"h \",[\"minutes\"],\"m \",[\"seconds\"],\"s\"],\"TZCqSD\":[\"Need help? We've got answers\"],\"Ta77hL\":[\"Rewards are emailed as vouchers redeemable at checkout on trezor.io. To use, add items to your cart, copy the voucher code from the email, and apply it on the cart page. The discount will apply automatically — you can even use multiple codes at once.\"],\"Taihza\":[\"Confidence from day one\"],\"TfyrIu\":[\"Coin wallet apps tooltip\"],\"Th5AO9\":[\"Referral discounts can't be combined with other promotions or offers (e.g., Black Friday).\"],\"ThdeKN\":[\"Trezor Forum\"],\"ThlRxt\":[\"Give your hard-earned assets the long-term security they deserve with Trezor.\"],\"TmfWn6\":[\"Session prep \u0026 \u003c0/\u003e good-to-knows\"],\"TmhNHr\":[\"Avoid common mistakes and move your assets correctly.\"],\"TriNN4\":[\"More about security\"],\"TrjJ//\":[\"Trezor is designed for the long game — secure, durable, and built for the years ahead.\"],\"TsXJBR\":[\"Page missing,\u003c0/\u003elike an unmined block.\"],\"Tt5T6+\":[\"Articles\"],\"TuZnAM\":[\"The all-in-one app for Bitcoin \u0026 digital assets. Buy, sell, send, and receive coins in the most secure crypto ecosystem.\"],\"TwnhCQ\":[\"I was a bit nervous about taking custody of my crypto but their technology and assistance setting up the wallet \u003c0\u003eput my concerns to rest\u003c/0\u003e. Thank you!\"],\"TxcAM4\":[\"Anniversary sale\"],\"TxuXFb\":[\"Stay private—Trezor wallets don’t collect identifying data\"],\"U+Yv9S\":[\"Supported Payment Methods \u0026 Countries\"],\"U38HXl\":[\"128 x 64 pixels\"],\"U3rlaB\":[\"Curious about hardware wallets? Learn how they work, why they’re safer than exchanges, and how Trezor makes crypto security easy - even for beginners.\"],\"U6IAs4\":[\"Protect your wealth\"],\"U92V+A\":[\"Supported Apps \u0026 third-party wallets available to manage this asset.\"],\"U9DFpw\":[\"After completing your order, you’ll receive a link to watch a prep video. Additionally, make sure you have a compatible USB cable, pen, stable internet connection, secure environment, and your Trezor device ready in your hands.\"],\"UC63pP\":[\"Easily integrate your solution into Trezor’s ecosystem by following our comprehensive documentation.\"],\"UEMxuo\":[\"12-word \u003c0\u003ewallet backup\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"UFYCB4\":[\"Search countries\"],\"UFsse+\":[\"The Trezor Safe 7 isn't just another hardware wallet. It's built for transparency, usability, and long-term security. With dual Secure Elements, a full-color intuitive touchscreen, wireless and wired options, open-source firmware, and a quantum-ready foundation, you stay in charge of your assets and privacy without relying on hidden components or closed NDAs. Advanced backup options, including Multi-share Backup and \u003c0\u003ePassphrase\u003c/0\u003e Protection, give you extra control and peace of mind, ensuring your funds are always protected.\"],\"UHmpZU\":[\"Tooltip not found.\"],\"UJ8AhN\":[\"Business inquiries phone:\"],\"UJbdlF\":[\"$7\"],\"UJmAAK\":[\"Subject\"],\"UKsIWv\":[\"Which Trezor should I choose if I use an iPhone?\"],\"ULGT1e\":[\"28° Privacy Filter\"],\"UN9456\":[\"Requires an \u003c0\u003eadvanced setup\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"UNmgkT\":[\"Securely buy bitcoin with your device\"],\"UOJlLb\":[\"Products \u003c0/\u003e\"],\"UOY/o3\":[\"Explore other supported coins \u0026 tokens\"],\"UXD7gL\":[\"\u003c0\u003eSecure Element chip\u003c/0\u003e (EAL6+ certified) provides tamper-resistant protection.\"],\"UYsZvY\":[\"A parcel sent via Economy shipping can be traced \u003c0\u003ehere\u003c/0\u003e until it leaves the country of origin. After that, it can be traced on the website of the postal service in your country, if available.\"],\"UYul/z\":[\"Hide your sensitive information from potential eavesdroppers with just one click.\"],\"UazOau\":[\"Trezor Shop supports Google Pay, Apple Pay, debit/credit card, Bitcoin and selected cryptocurrencies for order payment.\"],\"UbeShr\":[\"A hardware wallet shields you from account freezes, hacks \u0026 exchange collapses.\"],\"Uclhrc\":[\"Third-party\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003ewallet apps\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"UdfHPL\":[\"close message\"],\"UdoJtL\":[\"About Company\"],\"UiNuLZ\":[\"Micro USB\"],\"Ul+PAS\":[\"20% off\"],\"Um5n1p\":[\"Trezor supports over 30 wallet apps in addition to Trezor Suite.\"],\"Un8Am/\":[\"In 2013, our visionary founders created the first hardware wallet. Over the past decade, relentless innovation and dedication have driven us to incredible heights, now serving over 2 million users worldwide. Our success is powered by a team of over 150 exceptional employees.\"],\"Ur5RvF\":[\"Version: \",[\"version\"],\" \u003c0\u003e·\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"UsSzJl\":[\"Payment issues\"],\"UslXqL\":[\"USB-C\"],\"Uv2rCt\":[\"Storing your bitcoin online can be pretty risky, you know? Online exchanges are like magnets for hackers, and they’re always trying to break in and mess things up. But check this out—the Trezor Safe 3 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet is like a fortress for your bitcoin. It’s offline and super secure, so your bitcoin are safe and sound.\"],\"UvjCFk\":[\"e.g. 10/28\"],\"UxAIiV\":[\"About Trezor and our mission\"],\"Uxiv5t\":[\"Experience our most advanced hardware wallet ever, setting a new standard for crypto security.\"],\"V+D/YP\":[\"Careers\"],\"V/2mMC\":[\"Next-gen TROPIC01 secure chip\"],\"V1EGGU\":[\"First name\"],\"V1QtdQ\":[\"Only you can access your assets—no banks, no exchanges, no governments, not even us here at Trezor.\"],\"V1fa9u\":[\"See more\"],\"V27Ekl\":[\"Get top-notch security and total peace of mind! Trezor hardware wallets keep your crypto safe from hackers, malware, and other threats by keeping sensitive data offline, keeping your crypto safe 24/7. With easy wallet backup, your funds are always recoverable, no matter what happens.\"],\"V2OjHz\":[\"Scroll to the features section\"],\"V48glw\":[\"Multi-share Backup eliminates single failure risks\"],\"V4MNv/\":[\"Show more features\"],\"V4dUed\":[\"Yes, it’s necessary to have a Trezor hardware wallet with you during the session. This ensures you can follow the setup process step by step, enabling our Trezor Expert to provide tailored guidance for your Trezor device.\"],\"V51jYm\":[\"Compatible with \u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite app\u003c/0\u003e and \u003c1\u003ethird-party wallet apps\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"V55Tu4\":[\"Trezor is responsible for several key crypto innovations, including SLIP39, pushing the envelope in hardware wallet security.\"],\"V6FQdE\":[\"Video placeholder image - The video failed to load. Please try refreshing the page.\"],\"V8yTm6\":[\"Clear search\"],\"V91zx8\":[\"Feel free to turn on your camera during the session, but \u003c0\u003eonly the voice of the Trezor Expert is recorded\u003c/0\u003e for liability purposes.\"],\"VI3ECC\":[\"The Model T is a crypto hardware wallet designed to securely store access to your coins and tokens with a sleek touchscreen interface. The wallet provides native support for 14 assets, including well-known cryptocurrencies like Bitcoin, Ethereum, and Dogecoin. Additionally, it offers support for a vast array of 1000s of coins and tokens.\"],\"VIompX\":[\"Users' opinions are in, and when it comes to security and privacy, Trezor Safe 3 is a solid hardware wallet from the industry founders. With its built-in Secure Element layer, it's your ultimate guardian in the crypto world. Supporting 1000s of coins and tokens, it's got your back no matter what you're into.\"],\"VJpfbO\":[\"Device security\"],\"VL4rZC\":[\"Trezor devices and firmware\"],\"VLcEnJ\":[\"75.4x44.5x8.3 mm / 45 g\u003c0/\u003e2.97x1.75x0.33 in / 1.6 oz\"],\"VMNGG2\":[\"\u003c0\u003eOffline key storage\u003c/0\u003e keeps your crypto safe from online threats.\"],\"VQrkKB\":[\"\u003c0\u003eThe price that you pay at the checkout of your order on Trezor e-shop does not include tax/customs fees.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eDuring checkout, you confirm that you agree with and have read the \u003c2\u003eTerms of Service\u003c/2\u003e, which states that \u003c3\u003eyou are responsible for paying customs duties, local taxes, and other related fees, if applicable\u003c/3\u003e.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c4\u003eCustoms duties apply for deliveries to certain countries (except the USA, the UK and those within the EU).\u003c/4\u003e\u003c5\u003eCustoms duties and related taxes vary from country to country, and are subject to your local legislation. Please contact your local authorities in order to get an estimated customs fee.\u003c/5\u003eIf you would like to take a closer look at our position in relation to foreign governmental bodies, please refer to section 5.10 of the Trezor \u003c6\u003eEshop Terms of Use\u003c/6\u003e.\"],\"VT9ZHP\":[\"Benefit from transparent verification and community-tested security.\"],\"VW0/mU\":[\"Navigate to coins page\"],\"VWB5Ky\":[\"Seamlessly manage your bitcoin across all your devices—mobile, desktop, and tablet—with a fully encrypted Bluetooth connection.\"],\"VY82NA\":[\"\u003c0\u003eone wallet\u003c1\u003e.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c2\u003ezero limits\u003c3\u003e.\u003c/3\u003e\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"VYxs3B\":[\"Indestructible wallet \u003c0/\u003ebackup forged in steel\"],\"VaozyA\":[\"Where should I store my Trezor Keep Metal?\"],\"VdQFq9\":[\"Trezor co-founders\"],\"VeJmqy\":[\"Personalized assistance\"],\"VlTWG5\":[\"A hardware wallet is a secure physical device for sending, receiving, and storing cryptocurrencies and tokens offline. It ensures maximum security by never exposing your wallet backup or sensitive data to an internet-connected environment like your PC or smartphone.\"],\"VlY3DE\":[\"open chat\"],\"VloUwG\":[\"Choose your language\"],\"VobqCl\":[\"Blockbook and other backend infrastructure\"],\"VpSaQd\":[\"Definitions, Privacy policy, User account, Website access, Online conduct, Copyright, Trademarks, Links, Disclaimers and limitations of liability, Applicable law, Dispute resolution, Contact us, Final provisions.\"],\"VpiB+j\":[\"The discount code has been removed.\"],\"VqJAwK\":[\"\u003c0\u003eRemain confident about your funds even in the event of device loss, theft, or damage.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eCreate a wallet backup to safeguard access to your coins and protect your crypto in all events.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eSimply enter your backup on another Trezor hardware wallet and instantly gain access to your funds.\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"VrHz3m\":[\"What's in the box?\"],\"VsT6EJ\":[\"“Great support, which is important and rare nowadays”\"],\"VskdJ+\":[\"Trezor hardware wallets are compatible with a wide range of third-party wallet apps, including popular options like Rabby, Backpack, MetaMask, Electrum, Exodus, and Wasabi Wallet. These third-party wallet apps allow you to access additional features and manage your crypto assets outside of Trezor Suite.\"],\"Vsn7MP\":[\"Trezor Expert Onboarding Sessions are designed to get your Trezor hardware wallet up and running. This includes connecting your Trezor, setting up a PIN, creating a wallet backup, and a general overview of the Trezor Suite app.\"],\"VtTJlT\":[\"Haptic feedback\"],\"VusINy\":[\"It is certified under:\u003c0/\u003eCE, RoHS, REACH, WEEE, EN55032, EN55035, EN300328, EN303417, EN62311/50566, CE RF EMC, RSS-Gen, RSS-102, RCM CISPR32, AS4268 (BT), KC KN32/35/301489, VCCI CISPR32, BSMI CNS15396.\u003c1/\u003eYou can view the complete list of certifications here: \u003c2\u003eTrezor Safe 7 certificates\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"VyE4k7\":[\"\u003c0\u003eWe're all about\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003esafety \u0026 security\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"VzHt2N\":[\"Quick look\"],\"VzKnry\":[\"Notification email not received\"],\"W/fSUB\":[\"Get the funds from the failed payment back to your account.\"],\"W2iax5\":[\"Networks\"],\"W4wZhk\":[\"You have successfully subscribed to our newsletter.\"],\"W5V2tc\":[\"Crypto-industry pioneer\"],\"W6Nlb2\":[\"Brand manual\"],\"W8pZFV\":[\"1 000s of supported coins \u0026 tokens\"],\"W9Myiw\":[\"Reinforced glass backplate\"],\"W9hDgp\":[\"Use with your favorite bitcoin software wallets\"],\"WDSmjM\":[\"Next-gen secure chip\"],\"WE4lRF\":[\"Parcels ordered using Economy shipping can be tracked \u003c0\u003ehere\u003c/0\u003e until it leaves the country of origin. It can then be tracked using your country's postal service website if available.\"],\"WEV7al\":[\"Working on better products. Striving for a better world.\"],\"WJCzwt\":[\"Choosing the right network is key\"],\"WLfEv1\":[\"Search country\"],\"WMKZNe\":[\"Life is safer when you share\"],\"WMN1P1\":[\"The Trezor Keep Metal rocks a simple 4-letter wallet backup entry layout plus security seals, making sure it’s clear if anyone has tampered with your backup. On the flip side, the Cryptotag Zeus goes for the more complicated BIP-39 wordlist input without any tamper-seal protection, putting your wallet backup at risk.\"],\"WQV1j+\":[\"Trezor bug bounty program – full terms\"],\"WRLCCU\":[\"Eligibility \u0026 Limits\"],\"WSqwRL\":[\"How to Trade in Trezor Suite\"],\"WTnk86\":[\"Micro USB connection\"],\"WVvDk9\":[\"The session for this payment has expired. Please restart the payment process to complete your transaction.\"],\"WXhZXi\":[\"Street cannot be longer than \",[\"streetMaxLength\"],\" characters\"],\"WaX8in\":[\"12-, 20- \u0026 24-word wallet backup\"],\"WdNY6k\":[\"Partner logos\"],\"Wdv7Mv\":[\"Trezor stickers\"],\"WgEud+\":[\"Team background\"],\"WowFwc\":[\"\u003c0\u003e\u003c1\u003eGo offline \u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003ewith Trezor\u003c/2\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c3\u003eGo offline \u003c/3\u003e\u003c4\u003e\u003c5\u003ewith Trezor\u003c/5\u003e\u003c/4\u003e\"],\"Wp9Qi2\":[\"\u003c0\u003eBuilt-in phishing protection\u003c/0\u003e guards against fake transactions.\"],\"Wq7Gfc\":[\"Standard \u0026 Shamir Backup\"],\"WtIrAM\":[\"Discover your\u003c0/\u003eideal wallet\"],\"WxPrnj\":[\"Buy crypto instantly with Visa, Mastercard, SEPA, PayPal, Revolut, Venmo \u0026 more.\"],\"WzxzQ6\":[\"Easily buy thousands of coins and tokens. Trezor Suite automatically compares multiple providers to secure the best deal for you.\"],\"X/kjX9\":[\"Creator of the original crypto hardware wallet.\"],\"X0smfF\":[\"How can I use my $20 reward?\"],\"X1Us7/\":[\"Securely \u003c0\u003estake\u003c/0\u003e your \",[\"ticker\"],\" with Trezor and earn rewards with a competitive rate.\"],\"X2rrlw\":[\"Subtotal\"],\"X4Hucg\":[\"How to buy and sell Bitcoin in Trezor Suite\"],\"X4Iq8r\":[\"Use your Trezor as a \u003c0\u003e2FA device\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"X6UPu+\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 meets the highest standards of quality, reliability, environmental responsibility, and safety.\"],\"X8DupE\":[\"\u003c0\u003eAuthorized\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eResellers\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"X8nz4T\":[\"Increase privacy with \u003c0\u003ecoin control\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"X9o1MR\":[\"Trezor Academy\"],\"XAnrVS\":[\"Back view of three Trezor cryptocurrency hardware wallets — Safe 3, Safe 5, and Safe 7 — arranged side by side, showing their sleek, minimalist casing and engraved branding.\"],\"XCNpBH\":[\"or visit our\"],\"XEoGkQ\":[\"Go to homepage\"],\"XI+m93\":[\"Receive insider offers, product news, and crypto insights, straight to your inbox.\"],\"XJgNiJ\":[\"The sent amount exceeded the requested total.\"],\"XMw5RX\":[\"Multi-share Backup is a storage solution designed for safeguarding wallet backup using multiple shares, built upon the SLIP39 standard. You then share these word lists with folks you trust or stash them in safe spots nearby. So, if your Trezor ever goes missing, gets stolen, or takes a beating, all you have to do is gather the right number of shares to get your wallet back on track.\"],\"XNU7b+\":[\"Our hardware design is completely transparent. We have no secrets.\"],\"XOU5dL\":[\"You overpaid via Confirmo\"],\"XPGDPc\":[\"Store Hero Navigation\"],\"XPHa67\":[\"Failed to set currency into cart, please try again.\"],\"XPVZjx\":[\"Apt/Suite (optional)\"],\"XSmUKO\":[\"Our largest touchscreen\"],\"XTqpzl\":[\"Find out more about us at Trezor\"],\"XTtR6a\":[\"Germany\"],\"XU/Vof\":[\"Unlock dApps and Marketplaces\"],\"XWBua9\":[\"Detect \u0026 avoid suspicious transactions that may be address poisoning attacks.\"],\"XX8fj9\":[\"A hardware wallet is a physical device that gives you security and \u003c0\u003ecomplete ownership \u003c1/\u003e\u003c/0\u003e of your crypto.\"],\"XYLcNv\":[\"Support\"],\"XZd9LG\":[\"Both editions of the Trezor Safe 5 provide exceptional security with their built-in Secure Element layer. Elevate your bitcoin protection to new heights by pairing the Trezor Safe 5 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet with a passphrase. Step confidently into the future of bitcoin security, backed by the industry pioneers.\"],\"XZfi/F\":[\"“I already use a Trezor Safe 3, which I'm already extremely satisfied with, and I couldn't resist purchasing a Trezor Safe 5 as well. It was incredibly easy to set up and very comfortable to use.”\"],\"XdMxH5\":[\"Manage securely\"],\"XdfIX+\":[\"Some items in your cart aren't available in the selected country\"],\"Xdik8x\":[\"The best and safest way to buy the new Trezor Safe 5 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet is either thought the official Trezor Shop or one of our trusted resellers. Opting for these channels ensures your device is genuine, unaltered, and completely legitimate. If you have any questions about your Trezor purchase, feel free to contact Trezor Support.\"],\"Xef/yw\":[\"Transaction security\"],\"XhQttV\":[\"Extra layer of physical protection for your bitcoin\"],\"XhWCxC\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite\u003c/0\u003e or third-party wallets\"],\"Xiot+/\":[\"Micro USB → USB-A\"],\"XjjZEf\":[\"Convinced?\"],\"XlASD9\":[\"Contact us at \u003c0\u003esecurity@satoshilabs.com\u003c/0\u003e and include the following:\"],\"Xp2zO1\":[\"\u003c0\u003eSimple setup,\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003elasting protection\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"Xt6QoP\":[\"Email cannot be longer than 50 characters\"],\"XvjE5f\":[\"The primary difference lies in security versus convenience: hardware wallets prioritize safety by keeping keys offline, while software wallets offer easier access at the cost of increased risk. For long-term storage or significant funds, hardware wallets are the safer option. Software wallets are better suited for quick transactions or smaller amounts of crypto.\"],\"Xx9eHx\":[\"Cookies settings\"],\"XxjPi+\":[\"Trezor devices and its firmware\"],\"XyaHYP\":[\"For iPhone users who want full Trezor Suite functionality from their phone, such as sending, buying, selling, and device management—Trezor Safe 7 is the best choice. Its Bluetooth connection ensures seamless compatibility with iOS.\"],\"Y1juki\":[\"No.1\"],\"Y21Jmy\":[\"Tiktok logo\"],\"Y2YxkY\":[\"Maximum lenght exceeded\"],\"Y3OWck\":[\"The Trezor Advantage\"],\"Y4A0Kp\":[\"Trezor Suite is the official app for managing your Trezor hardware wallet. Securely store, send \u0026 receive, buy \u0026 sell, stake, and swap cryptocurrencies while maintaining complete control of your crypto access. Trezor Suite also offers features like portfolio tracking, transaction history, coin management, and advanced security settings to enhance your crypto experience.\"],\"Y4Ijsa\":[\"Benefit from community-testing, giving users protection from threats.\"],\"Y4PcD+\":[\"Report vulnerability\"],\"Y5/J2P\":[\"Contact \u0026 delivery\"],\"YApMfE\":[\"What does Trezor Suite do?\"],\"YDw2Oz\":[\"Refer-A-Friend Program\"],\"YFCkh5\":[\"Trezor Suite app is the official app for managing your Trezor hardware wallet. Securely store, send \u0026 receive, buy \u0026 sell, stake, and swap cryptocurrencies while maintaining complete control of your crypto access. Trezor Suite app also offers features like portfolio tracking, transaction history, coin management, and advanced security settings to enhance your crypto experience.\"],\"YFSQm1\":[\"$8\"],\"YIaCYT\":[\"for Mac\"],\"YJISOj\":[\"Instagram logo\"],\"YJn8ST\":[\"We're working on a fix.\"],\"YKO1pT\":[[\"coinName\"],\" in a nutshell\"],\"YL/cep\":[\"Other Resources\"],\"YPIvgK\":[\"Email must be at most 255 characters\"],\"YQ93Ap\":[\"\u003c0\u003eThe \u003c1\u003eTrezor Help Center\u003c/1\u003e is our official troubleshooter, where you can also submit questions for help with technical, payment or logistics issues. Before opening a ticket, check our other support channels to see if the issue can be resolved more easily on your own:\u003c/0\u003e\u003c2\u003e\u003c3\u003eTrezor Forum\u003c/3\u003e: find support agent answers to other users' issues or post a question of your own.\u003c/2\u003e\u003c4\u003e\u003c5\u003eTrezor Blog\u003c/5\u003e: important announcements, updates and news are published regularly on our blog.\u003c/4\u003e\u003c6\u003eSocial media: Trezor on \u003c7\u003eTwitter\u003c/7\u003e, \u003c8\u003eTrezor subreddit\u003c/8\u003e\u003c/6\u003eLike Trezor? \u003c9\u003eGet one here!\u003c/9\u003e\"],\"YQWvbR\":[\"Your bitcoin, fully protected —\u003c0\u003etoday, tomorrow, and beyond.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"YR9YS+\":[\"Please enter a valid first name\"],\"YTUvSl\":[\"Open Trezor Suite, select \",[\"coinName\"],\", go to \\\"Receive,\\\" show full address, verify it on your Trezor, copy \u0026 paste it into your exchange's \\\"Send to\\\" field. Voilà!\"],\"YU4ou1\":[\"Outside the United States and United Kingdom, Economy shipping is only available in EU and several non-EU countries. Tracking information can sometimes prove limited.\"],\"YYfY7g\":[\"Wallet setup on iPhone is only supported for Trezor Safe 7. For other Trezor models, please visit this page on your computer.\"],\"Yc3bel\":[\"Get More from Trezor: Safely Use Third-Party Wallets, Apps, and Services\"],\"YcAHfn\":[\"Contact our support\"],\"YeEGF8\":[\"Issues with crypto payment?\"],\"YhhMLT\":[\"0.96' Monochromatic OLED\"],\"YkLwlA\":[\"Why should I use Trezor Safe 3 instead of holding crypto on an exchange?\"],\"Ynj7xQ\":[\"Your crypto, fully protected—today, tomorrow, and beyond.\"],\"Ynr+Ds\":[\"Countries With Resellers\"],\"YuYybT\":[\"An unexpected error occurred while processing your payment. Please try again or use a different payment option. If the issue persists, contact support for further assistance\"],\"YwJCWD\":[\"If you believe you’ve discovered a vulnerability that could significantly affect Trezor devices, software, or infrastructure, please report it to security@satoshilabs.com. Our Security Team will verify the issue, work with you on a fix, and reward the first valid submission.\"],\"YzXkBn\":[\"Tactile feedback for confident actions\"],\"Z+mQWY\":[\"Add your name, check the terms, and hit \\\"Agree \u0026 continue\\\" to leave a review on Trustpilot.\"],\"Z/FDr+\":[\"Show \",[\"headline\"],\" hint\"],\"Z/oLHy\":[\"Apr 15, 2025\"],\"Z3FXyt\":[\"Loading...\"],\"Z4EX/c\":[\"Easily paired with any device, no cables needed\"],\"Z56B1s\":[\"Why should I use Trezor Safe 5 Bitcoin-only wallet instead of having bitcoin on an online exchange?\"],\"Z64QfV\":[\"\u003c0\u003ea part of \u003c/0\u003eSatoshiLabs Group\"],\"Z6GVx+\":[\"Sales tax added after address\"],\"Z700a0\":[\"You can browse our \u003c0\u003eavailable appointment slots\u003c/0\u003e before making your purchase.\"],\"Z8lGw6\":[\"Share\"],\"ZBkJdx\":[\"Security \u0026 privacy your way with the Trezor Suite app\"],\"ZBo+BS\":[\"Why a\u003c0/\u003ehardware wallet?\"],\"ZE/cvd\":[\"$9\"],\"ZFxdrd\":[\"“I love my Trezor Safe 5. I love the videos walking you through the use of their products and the easy directions provided in the packages.”\"],\"ZGzbRt\":[\"Evolving with your security needs, ensuring long-term protection\"],\"ZILLFu\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite app\u003c/0\u003e is a desktop and mobile app that connects to your Trezor, making it easy to securely send, receive, buy, sell, swap, and \u003c1\u003estake\u003c/1\u003e your coins \u0026 tokens—all in one place.\"],\"ZIQMSQ\":[\"This content is temporarily unavailable to UK users\"],\"ZKBT2g\":[\"SECURE SMARTER\"],\"ZMOcBv\":[\"Gorilla® Glass protection\"],\"ZNitu7\":[\"Compact and lightweight design\"],\"ZSOgvN\":[\"Color Touchscreen\"],\"ZSo9rj\":[\"Trezor compatibility\"],\"ZURk8I\":[\"Please enter your last name\"],\"ZW04Wa\":[\"Share on Facebook\"],\"ZXRpMj\":[\"Monitor your cryptocurrency holdings stored on your hardware wallet while on the move using the secure and privacy-preserving Trezor Lite mobile app, without compromising your personal data. View-only.\"],\"ZXUYR5\":[\"Backup solutions\"],\"ZYuk5h\":[\"Trezor features PIN protection, wallet backup for asset recovery, and the option to add a passphrase for an extra layer of security.\"],\"ZZYWr6\":[\"By clicking Subscribe you agree that Trezor Company s.r.o. will use your email solely to send you its newsletter. You can unsubscribe anytime using the link in any email. To see how we handle your data, view Trezor’s \u003c0\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"ZaMQK/\":[\"Have your questions answered and learn about self-custody and crypto security in a one-on-one session.\"],\"ZeM7L9\":[\"A collage of diverse people holding or using Trezor, in various settings such as indoors, outdoors, and tech-lit environments.\"],\"ZhPnY5\":[\"Explore the thriving crypto ecosystem, while Trezor keeps your private keys safe.\"],\"ZhQRsd\":[\"2x Wallet backup card\"],\"Zhdlgh\":[\"If your order arrived damaged or incomplete, please let us know and we will be able to solve\\nthat for you as well.\"],\"ZjPPUP\":[\"Trezor supports 1000s of coins and tokens across leading networks like Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, Cardano, and more. You don’t have to choose between chains — secure them all in one place.\"],\"Zl0Eop\":[\"Collection of popular cryptocurrency coins supported by Trezor Suite - bottom view\"],\"ZlEiFy\":[\"Guarantee access to your coins \u0026 tokens\"],\"ZowXuk\":[\"An intuitive, secure companion app that puts full control in your hands. Track, manage, trade, and transact seamlessly on \u003c0\u003edesktop and mobile with Trezor Suite.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"ZowkxF\":[\"Taxes\"],\"Zrm+pR\":[\"Can I return my order after it has been delivered?\"],\"ZsDGPM\":[\"Join the program to get your referral link.\"],\"ZuLy43\":[\"Phone number\"],\"Zw942j\":[\"The Trezor Keep Metal Multi-share Backup is compatible with Trezor Safe 5, Trezor Safe 3, and Trezor Model T hardware wallets. Take your wallet backup security to the next level by creating, splitting, sharing, storing your wallet backup shares. Regain access to your coins by collecting your threshold shares and recovering your funds on a new Trezor device.\"],\"ZwHd5U\":[\"Seamless Upgradability\"],\"ZwNcc2\":[\"What are the reviews of Trezor Safe 3?\"],\"Zzl3ux\":[\"The Trezor Safe 7 delivers exceptional security with dual Secure Elements, including the auditable next-gen TROPIC01 chip, and a quantum-ready architecture that keeps your wallet security updated against quantum threats. Choose the Bitcoin-only Trezor Safe 7 for an even more focused and hardened defense. With its quantum-resistant foundation and Bitcoin-dedicated firmware, you can secure your holdings with the most advanced and future-proof protection ever designed for Bitcoin.\"],\"a0Y/GU\":[\"Custom Backend\"],\"a1zXKF\":[\"Seated man looking at a Trezor safe 7 while holding a smartphone in his other hand.\"],\"a2PdVF\":[\"Supported bitcoin wallet apps\"],\"a3LDKx\":[\"Security\"],\"a3pVqb\":[\"Frequently asked questions\"],\"a4jcKB\":[\"Use fingerprint or face recognition to lock and unlock securely.\"],\"a8acXW\":[\"In addition, Trezor devices and the Trezor Suite software interface are designed for ease of use, making them suitable for both beginners and advanced cryptocurrency users.\"],\"aBWRzQ\":[\"No, there’s no difference in functionality between the Trezor Safe 5 and the Freedom Edition. The Trezor Safe 5 Freedom Edition is a limited release featuring a unique backplate design. Additionally, a portion of the revenue from each sale goes directly to Trezor Academy, supporting global Bitcoin education initiatives.\"],\"aDzOsT\":[\"To securely buy a new Trezor Safe 3 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet, go to the official Trezor Shop or check out one of our trusted resellers. Going through these channels is your top choice to guarantee that your device is genuine, unaltered, and absolutely legit. If you have any questions with your Trezor purchase, reach out to Trezor Support.\"],\"aEL8XM\":[\"Your download has started\"],\"aJ4pMe\":[\"FAQs\"],\"aKDuPH\":[\"All Trezor devices are CE and RoHS certified meeting all quality, reliability, and environmental standards. Trezors are X-ray safe and suitable for air travel.\"],\"aL+Zfm\":[\"Use your Trezor as a 2FA device\"],\"aLR5Gg\":[\"About company\"],\"aMvrzb\":[\"During checkout, you confirm that you agree with and have read the \u003c0\u003eTerms of Service\u003c/0\u003e, which states that \u003c1\u003eyou are responsible for paying customs duties, local taxes, and other related fees, if applicable\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"aNCJA3\":[\"Material\"],\"aOu0QG\":[\"3D secure order payment\"],\"aSYKJG\":[\"Install the app\"],\"aSetfe\":[\"Explore our global styleguide including graphic and visual guidelines.\"],\"aSyVo1\":[\"Online, your crypto is exposed. Hackers hunt. Scammers steal. Exchanges fail. Only you can protect what’s yours—because your crypto belongs to no one but you.\"],\"aW7A9M\":[\"Compare wallets\"],\"aX2pXO\":[\"We’ll get our site back online soon.\"],\"aXgerP\":[\"Search wallet apps\"],\"aZ2Gzf\":[\"How do I transfer my funds from an online exchange (including Coinbase and Binance) to Trezor Safe 5?\"],\"aZpCY4\":[\"Google play\"],\"aazByq\":[\"Two-factor authentication \u0026 FIDO2 Standard\"],\"ab4d9y\":[\"We’ve encountered server issues and are working on a fix.\"],\"abSeRK\":[\"If that does not work it may be that your card is being declined due to the fact that your card is not able to process transactions without first informing your bank or credit card company. If your card continues to be declined please reach out to your bank to determine if this could be the issue or if there is something else that is causing your payment to fail.\"],\"ac5Vae\":[\"Please enter a valid card number.\"],\"acnybQ\":[\"Here's more on what you can expect in each \u003c0\u003enewsletter\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"afaihK\":[\"We’ve also emailed your link so you can easily find it anytime.\"],\"agPptk\":[\"Medium\"],\"ahRHUo\":[\"Cart\"],\"ahls78\":[\"Secure Element protected\"],\"aidXnJ\":[\"Help us secure the future of self-custody. Report vulnerabilities. Earn rewards. Follow these rules:\"],\"aktytU\":[\"Security seals\"],\"am1D38\":[\"Where can I buy a Trezor Metal Keep Multi-share Backup?\"],\"amEdCO\":[\"By clicking \\\"Agree and continue\\\", you're giving us permission to share your name and email address with Trustpilot. Your name will appear with your review. Your email address will be deleted shortly after it is received.\"],\"aoI3/L\":[\"Bigger than Trezor safe 5\"],\"apIwWP\":[\"The program may be changed or ended at any time.\"],\"aqIUxr\":[\"Trezor Suite app works with all Trezor models. Check them out if you don't have one.\"],\"aqay8s\":[[\"coinName\"],\" networks tooltip\"],\"arvw9+\":[\"Wallet setup isn't currently available on iPhone. Visit this page on your computer.\"],\"aspaom\":[\"On desktop, you can securely buy, sell, stake, swap, and send assets while keeping full control of your private keys. It also includes portfolio tracking, transaction history, and advanced security features.\"],\"astDB+\":[\"Blog\"],\"auHH+b\":[\"Long-Life Battery\"],\"auOGUU\":[\"Screenshot of \",[\"name\"],\" wallet interface not supported in Trezor Suite app.\"],\"auaprg\":[\"Suite Services by Invity\"],\"axcj+D\":[\"Hide \",[\"question\"],\" answer\"],\"aydWVR\":[\"Stay up to date with your portfolio using our mobile app.\"],\"b+wmaQ\":[\"App store\"],\"b40rt/\":[\"A stunning 2.5” color touchscreen built for absolute usability. Every action, transaction, and detail is easy to read, confirm, and control with complete confidence.\"],\"b4yEw4\":[\"Scroll to the Hardware wallets section\"],\"b5WkZz\":[\"\u003c0\u003e\u003c1\u003ePIN\u003c/1\u003e and \u003c2\u003epassphrase\u003c/2\u003e\u003c/0\u003e ensure only you can access your wallet.\"],\"b5gyDZ\":[\"Equip yourself with handy security advice and tips to safeguard your crypto effectively.\"],\"b5xs5Y\":[\"Once connected, you can manage your crypto through the wallet app, but all sensitive actions, like approving transactions, must be authorized directly on your Trezor. This ensures your private keys remain securely stored on the device, maintaining the highest level of security even when using external applications.\"],\"b7VP+k\":[\"Future-proof your \",[\"currencyType\"],\" security with Trezor Safe 7's quantum-ready architecture\u003c0\u003e—the only hardware wallet capable of receiving quantum-secure updates against threats of tomorrow.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"b8eG+a\":[\"How to transfer assets to a hardware wallet?\"],\"bBkfoc\":[\"Solana icon\"],\"bBmmjG\":[\"Stay updated with Trezor news\"],\"bBuuEd\":[\"Trezor spokesperson\"],\"bDy2aj\":[\"Download Trezor Suite App\"],\"bEfE4X\":[\"Trezor Model One, a mainstay in the crypto hardware wallet industry for over a decade, offers a sleek OLED screen and user-friendly button interface for a straightforward crypto experience. Meanwhile, Trezor Safe 3 prioritizes security with its Secure Element chip and offers easy usability with a monochromatic screen and two-button input.\"],\"bKEbYm\":[\"Buy now\"],\"bKiccr\":[\"How to transfer crypto to a hardware wallet?\"],\"bKjGbV\":[\"Pre-order. Once the item is in stock, we will send you the whole order.\"],\"bMcjNU\":[\"All-in-one crypto app\"],\"bMr/Hq\":[\"290x220x65 mm / 1885 g\u003c0/\u003e11.4x8.7x2.6 in / 66.5 oz\"],\"bPDN8Q\":[\"Trezor hardware wallets stay completely offline, ensuring your protection and adding a true physical layer of security to your sensitive data. Enable device PIN and passphrase protection, and your wallet becomes untouchable. Your wallet is community-tested, providing robust protection against real-world threats.\"],\"bPEYmc\":[\"The Trezor Metal Keep—Shamir Backup is compatible with Trezor Safe 5, Trezor Safe 3 and Trezor Model T hardware wallets. Take your wallet backup security to the next level by creating, splitting, sharing, storing your recovery seed wordlists. Regain access to your coins by collecting a pre-set number of wordlists and recovering your fund on a new wallet.\"],\"bPhpXz\":[\"Designed for 24-word recovery seeds for all crypto hardware wallets\"],\"bQxoL8\":[\"Top-tier security, built to give you peace of mind and protect you from online threats.\"],\"bTcqZX\":[\"The most secure and advanced \u003c0\u003ewallet backup standard\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"bUUVED\":[\"Asset\"],\"bUdZsz\":[\"Parcels ordered using Standard shipping can be tracked \u003c0\u003ehere\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"baqiv9\":[\"Invalid company number\"],\"bd7doj\":[\"Supported Third-party Wallet Apps\"],\"bdc+fs\":[\"The Trezor Safe 7 uses a LiFePO₄ (lithium iron phosphate) battery, known for long life, thermal stability, and safety. It offers up to 4x more charge cycles than standard lithium batteries and is safe to fully drain, keeping your crypto secure for years. Even if your battery eventually fails, the device can still be used and powered via the USB-C cable, ensuring your wallet remains fully functional and your crypto accessible whenever you need it.\"],\"biu4TL\":[\"Trezor Model T hardware wallet\"],\"bj0FGp\":[\"By joining the Trezor Refer-A-Friend Program, you agree to these rules — for full terms \u003c0\u003eclick here\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"bo50yq\":[\"NCVM-coated glass backplate: A durable glass backplate with a vibrant metallic finish that ensures flawless Bluetooth and wireless charging performance.\"],\"boXwvq\":[\"Trezor is the safest crypto ecosystem-no personal data collected, seed generated \u0026 stored offline, full crypto custody\"],\"bocT3B\":[\"Keeping coins online is risky, as online exchanges are prime targets for hackers and security breaches, exposing your sensitive data. The Trezor Safe 5 acts as a trusted guardian angel for your crypto, storing it offline in a Fort Knox-like sanctuary, ensuring it stays safe and secure.\"],\"bqLxh8\":[\"Product Information\"],\"bvViSv\":[\"Trezor Expert \u003c0/\u003e Consultation\"],\"bwAk1P\":[\"Manage, store \u0026 use your crypto within the inclusive Trezor environment for complete financial privacy \u0026 security.\"],\"byxPyV\":[\"Absolute control of every transaction with on-device confirmation\"],\"bzSVn7\":[\"Security Wisdom and Tips\"],\"c/rYAo\":[\"Trezor Suite natively supports many altcoins directly in the app.\"],\"c36VNR\":[\"Change pick-up point\"],\"c3H83f\":[\"Pre-order\"],\"c4cLe+\":[\"\u003c 2020 models\"],\"c694FZ\":[\"Third-party libraries and supply chain attacks\"],\"c6KuHi\":[\"No spam, bots, or self-referrals.\"],\"c8tRdB\":[\"520 x 380 pixels\"],\"cHAXoe\":[\"Where can I buy a Bitcoin-only Trezor Safe 3 hardware wallet?\"],\"cKW9eq\":[[\"alt\"],\" icon\"],\"cLS6rg\":[\"Can I use Trezor with my phone?\"],\"cLf7QB\":[\"The original crypto hardware wallet remains a solid, trustworthy solution for coin storage and management. With a user-friendly interface and a high-quality OLED screen, it continues to be reliable choice for securely managing your cryptocurrency portfolio.\"],\"cOkZob\":[\"International deliveries will be processed by customs on arrival. This is where most delays occur. The delivery will only appear in a customer's local post tracking system once it has been released by customs. This process can sometimes delay items by many weeks.\"],\"cQZyvD\":[\"Bundle up \u0026 save big this Black Friday\"],\"cQlPDN\":[\"Read\"],\"cRJdj+\":[\"Once the \",[\"name\"],\" transfer is complete, you can easily and securely manage your \",[\"name\"],\" with your Trezor hardware wallet, all through the Trezor Suite app.\"],\"cRyNRK\":[\"If we are unable to help you, you will need to ship the product back to us and start the RMA process. Do not worry, we will give you all the necessary information when you contact us.\"],\"cSHujI\":[\"Program Changes \u0026 Violations\"],\"cSpO9Y\":[\"Bundles\"],\"cVeIFd\":[\"Join the 2M+ users who secure their future with Trezor\"],\"cX5bzS\":[\"Trezor is the world\u0026apos;s first and most secure #cryptocurrency hardware wallet because your info is kept safe...\"],\"cck7Pv\":[\"Copy your code \u003c0\u003e\",[\"promoCode\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e and apply it in your cart on orders of $49 or more.\"],\"ceabgv\":[\"Limited stock. Limited time.\"],\"cedOs0\":[\"Trezor is responsible for several key crypto innovations including SLIP39, pushing the envelope in hardware wallet security.\"],\"cfYis3\":[\"Visit Trezor on Reddit\"],\"chelB7\":[\"\u003c0\u003eUSB-C → USB-C\u003c/0\u003e cable included\"],\"cnd0tO\":[\"I referred a friend, they used my link and discount, but I didn’t get an email notification or reward. Why?\"],\"cofIfl\":[\"Join the Trezor community\"],\"cq791K\":[\"USB-C → USB-C cable included\"],\"d+OIzC\":[\"Third-party wallet apps with Trezor\"],\"d+hN2c\":[\"Extra-durable PC-ABS plastic bodyt\"],\"d08hnM\":[\"Bitcoin management in Trezor Suite app\"],\"d0xhDz\":[\"Trezor logo with light green background\"],\"d3XuTY\":[\"XRP icon\"],\"d4LvAX\":[\"Get clear, one-on-one guidance to master your crypto security and level up your Trezor skills without the stress.\"],\"d5IiP1\":[\"180MHz embedded ARM processor (Cortex M4)\"],\"d68bCS\":[\"Enter a valid e-mail address\"],\"d7jHaP\":[\"Hot wallets store your crypto online—for example, on an exchange—making them more vulnerable to hacks, viruses, and service outages. A hardware wallet like Trezor keeps your crypto access offline, giving you stronger protection against online threats.\"],\"d9d1mA\":[\"Search resellers...\"],\"dACGh+\":[\"close modal\"],\"dDaiA8\":[\"Your hardware wallet acts like a digital vault. It handles transactions offline, ensuring your precious crypto data is safe from internet exposure. It's the smart way to manage your cryptocurrencies.\"],\"dEREgC\":[\"120 MHz embedded ARM processor (Cortex M3) running a custom developed system\"],\"dG8ZEK\":[\"A hardware wallet, also known as a hard wallet or cold wallet, is a physical device that securely stores your cryptocurrency’s private keys offline. This makes it highly resistant to hacking or malware attacks, as the keys are never exposed to an internet-connected device. Trezor is an example of a leading hard wallet, designed for ultimate security and ease of use.\"],\"dGVXUb\":[\"The sent amount was less than the requested total. Your payment is ready to be refunded.\"],\"dGrr4U\":[\"Once the \",[\"coinName\"],\" transfer is complete, you can easily and securely manage your \",[\"coinName\"],\" with your Trezor hardware wallet, all through the Trezor Suite app.\"],\"dHbSsu\":[\"Seated woman looking at a Trezor safe 7 while holding a smartphone in his other hand.\"],\"dK4mmk\":[\"Gain exclusive insights into what's happening at Trezor, from team updates to development progress.\"],\"dKGg8T\":[\"Out of stock\"],\"dMdidb\":[\"Protecting your screen from prying eyes\"],\"dMuhYr\":[\"What’s the difference between Bitcoin-only Trezor Safe 5 and universal Trezor Safe 5?\"],\"dPnlio\":[\"*In exceptionally disastrous cases, there is no upper limit.\"],\"dQ6nSF\":[\"Trezor Suite App (Official) | Desktop \u0026 Web Crypto Management\"],\"dSC2si\":[\"Durable, Long-Life Battery\"],\"dXl6tk\":[\"2.5' High-res color display\"],\"dZ6HZw\":[\"A transparent Secure Element lets anyone verify how their crypto is protected. What sets apart the next-generation TROPIC01 chip used in the Trezor Safe 7 from other secure elements is its auditability and open architecture. It’s tested by experts, customers, and the open-source community, with results publicly disclosed for verifiable trust and reliability. With the Trezor Safe 7, you can be confident your crypto is protected by security you can see and trust.\"],\"dgO8li\":[\"Orders delivered to customers in the United Kingdom and the United States of America are dispatched by local fulfillment centers using local delivery services.\"],\"dh7dqK\":[\"Watch now\"],\"diqMtd\":[\"The bootloader verifies the firmware signature each time you connect your Trezor to a computer. \u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite will only accept the device if the installed firmware is correctly signed by SatoshiLabs\u003c/0\u003e. If unofficial firmware has been installed, your device will flash a warning sign on its screen upon being connected to a computer.\"],\"dofrws\":[\"Manage your assets directly in Trezor Suite—secure \u0026 easy to use.\"],\"dsBEK6\":[\"110+ like-minded individuals\"],\"dwG7iN\":[\"By doing so, everyone benefits from the community-tested design of your wallet, providing robust protection against real- world threats.\"],\"dyWF1+\":[\"First Steps\"],\"e+RpCP\":[\"Sign up\"],\"e1CI59\":[\"Install Trezor Suite app\"],\"e5p+Le\":[\"\u003c0\u003e\u003c1\u003eTrezor hardware wallets\u003c/1\u003e are also sold on the official \u003c2\u003eTrezor Amazon store\u003c/2\u003e. Products sold through Amazon are kept separate from other inventory and are safe to use as long as they pass \u003c3\u003estandard security checks\u003c/3\u003e.\u003c/0\u003eOfficial Trezor Amazon stores: This stock is supplied by us directly and kept separate so devices are not mixed with other goods:\u003c4\u003e\u003c5\u003e\u003c6\u003eUnited States\u003c/6\u003e\u003c/5\u003e\u003c7\u003e\u003c8\u003eUnited Kingdom\u003c/8\u003e\u003c/7\u003e\u003c9\u003e\u003c10\u003eCanada\u003c/10\u003e\u003c/9\u003e\u003c11\u003e\u003c12\u003eGermany\u003c/12\u003e\u003c/11\u003e\u003c13\u003e\u003c14\u003eFrance\u003c/14\u003e\u003c/13\u003e\u003c/4\u003e\"],\"eAg3MN\":[\"Download for Linux\"],\"eCQh8E\":[\"Error setting state. Please try again\"],\"eFxfk5\":[\"Cryptocurrency hardware wallets\"],\"eHaMYj\":[\"Move, save \u0026 store your assets using your Trezor hardware wallet.\"],\"eK2grf\":[\"Voucher $\",[\"voucherName\"]],\"eLFzql\":[\"Open Trezor Suite, select \",[\"name\"],\", go to \\\"Receive,\\\" show full address, verify it on your Trezor, copy \u0026 paste it into your exchange's \\\"Send to\\\" field. Voilà!\"],\"eMuGsw\":[\"Video placeholder - The video failed to load. Please try refreshing the page.\"],\"ePK91l\":[\"Edit\"],\"ePejKc\":[\"What is the safest place to store bitcoin \u0026 crypto?\"],\"eQ1huZ\":[\"Please enter your first name\"],\"eQnXKh\":[\"In rare cases, using standard shipping, your package may get lost during transport. These are processed as a \u003c0\u003elost package\u003c/0\u003e and dealt with through an \u003c1\u003einvestigation process\u003c/1\u003e. \u003c2\u003eContact\u003c/2\u003e \u003c3\u003eTrezor support\u003c/3\u003e via our \u003c4\u003echatbot Hal.\u003c/4\u003e if you believe your package has been lost.\"],\"eVDb83\":[\"Never lose access to your assets\"],\"eVltjP\":[\"Stay up to date with balances and manage assets directly from your phone. Available on Android, view-only on iOS.\"],\"eXOUNn\":[\"If you have not received your tracking number, please check your junk or spam folder, sometimes they can end up there.\"],\"eXvuO/\":[\"The magic happens at our Prague offices, where ideas flourish, becoming practical concepts and prototypes. Through rigorous cycles of development, testing, and iteration, only the finest earn the Trezor name.\"],\"eaDPSa\":[\"Each session covers the specific topics you’d like to discuss. Typical topics covered include: how to improve coin management; implementation of advanced security methods; how to best utilize Trezor Suite. Topics we cannot discuss include: fixing broken or malfunctioning devices; recovering lost wallet backups (seed) or passphrases; investigating missing or stolen funds; helping with inaccessible wallets; confirming or tracing stuck or missing transactions; financial, tax, or investment advice; guidance for large-sum or high-risk transfers; inheritance or legacy planning.\"],\"eaxWrS\":[\"We reserve the right to determine the severity and eligibility of reports.\"],\"efavRq\":[\"The URL you entered is invalid\"],\"egHTWv\":[\"The price that you pay at the checkout of your order on Trezor e-shop does not include tax/customs fees.\"],\"egMR4h\":[\"Explore all supported assets\"],\"eh0Df3\":[\"Color touchscreen \u003c0\u003e1.54\\\"\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"ehk9U2\":[\"The Trezor Keep Metal Multi-share Backup rocks a simple 4-letter wallet backup entry layout plus security seals, making sure it’s clear if anyone has tampered with your backup. On the flip side, the Cryptotag Zeus goes for the more complicated BIP-39 wordlist input without any tamper-seal protection, putting your wallet backup at risk.\"],\"ejrJFJ\":[\"Add a Trezor Expert Onboarding Session to the cart and complete your order. If you don’t have a Trezor hardware wallet, be sure to add one to your cart.\"],\"el6s7c\":[\"44.5 mm / 1.75 in\"],\"enQS3U\":[\"The full name must not be longer than \",[\"fullNameLength\"],\" characters\"],\"enaBUm\":[\"Copyright belongs to Trezor company s.r.o. All rights reserved.\"],\"end+GM\":[\"Adding to cart\"],\"epDXLY\":[\"Person using the Trezor Suite app on a laptop, viewing a dashboard with cryptocurrency account details and analytics.\"],\"epuIbl\":[\"with the Trezor Suite app\"],\"etx0aO\":[\"Go offline \u003c0\u003ewith Trezor\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"eu4VpH\":[\"The first-ever quantum-ready hardware wallet\"],\"evCwfV\":[\"\u003c0\u003eUse Trezor with 30+\u003c/0\u003ewallet apps\"],\"evqc5s\":[\"If your discount code isn’t working, check for typos and enter it exactly as you received it in the reward email. Ensure you haven’t exceeded the 50-referral limit. If using multiple codes on one order, make sure they’re all $20 rewards from this referral program. If the issue persists, contact Trezor Support.\"],\"ewOzlh\":[\"Why launch a Freedom Edition?\"],\"ewavUR\":[\"First Advocate Rule: Your first referral link “locks” that friend to you, so you’ll keep earning rewards for their future referred orders, even if they use someone else’s coupon later.\"],\"exkC9K\":[\"No spam, bots, or self-referrals (including household members).\"],\"eyH7FV\":[\"If you’re simply looking for a Trezor Safe 5 to start securing your crypto, then the standard version is a perfect choice.\"],\"eyazxN\":[\"Once you complete your purchase, click on the link in your order confirmation email to book your session. Simply select an available day and time, and pick your topic.\"],\"ezE984\":[\"Failed to set country into cart, please try again.\"],\"ezkZw0\":[\"alt=\\\"A close-up, angled view of a small, black, custom-shaped circuit board featuring a large central microchip, a TROPIC01 chip with a palm tree logo, and a USB-C port at the bottom.\\\"\"],\"f/a0Nf\":[\"Referral discount codes cannot be used with the Trezor Safe 7.\"],\"f28C8+\":[\"Are hardware wallets connected to the internet?\"],\"f4+3PJ\":[\"Exodus, 1inch, Jupiter, MetaMask, Rabbit, Backpack, Crypto.com, Sparrow wallet logos.\"],\"f4Pk17\":[\"What is the safest place to store bitcoin / crypto?\"],\"f4ouYK\":[\"Holding your coins online comes with significant risks. Online exchanges are high-value targets for cyberattacks, making them susceptible to security breaches that could compromise your sensitive data. The Trezor Model One is a secure place for your crypto, offering an offline, highly secure environment to safeguard your assets.\"],\"f7Yak+\":[\"Future-proof your bitcoin security with Trezor Safe 7's quantum-ready architecture\u003c0\u003e—the only hardware wallet capable of receiving quantum-secure updates against threats of tomorrow.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"fHEEgB\":[\"What makes Trezor different from other crypto wallets?\"],\"fJHXEW\":[\"Why should I use a Bitcoin-only hardware wallet?\"],\"fKdMEB\":[\"THE all-new Trezor Safe 7\"],\"fLFdUV\":[\"Why should I use Trezor Safe 5 instead of having my crypto on an exchange?\"],\"fLqupb\":[\"For a secure purchase of a new Trezor Safe 5 hardware wallet, head over to the official Trezor Shop. Going through this channel is your top choice to guarantee that your device is genuine, unaltered, and absolutely legit. If you have any questions with your Trezor purchase, reach out to Trezor Support.\"],\"fMPkxb\":[\"Show more\"],\"fO4kJ2\":[\"$$1 000 – $100 000*\"],\"fOJncp\":[\"Gorilla® Glass 5\"],\"fSOn/g\":[\"More about using third-party wallet apps with Trezor\"],\"fSU9uD\":[\"\u003c0\u003eBluetooth convenience.\u003c/0\u003eEasy wireless charging.\"],\"fSvJ+n\":[\"Trezor founders and team\"],\"fTCVbg\":[\"180 MHz embedded ARM processor (Cortex-M4)\"],\"fW6sq3\":[\"Add for \",[\"price\"]],\"fW9mTJ\":[\"Read \u003c0\u003eThe full \",[\"title\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"fWJygR\":[\"...and many others across Africa, South America, and Central America.\"],\"fY0Xmq\":[\"Does Trezor Metal Keep—Shamir Backup work with all Trezor hardware wallets?\"],\"fYA2bA\":[\"Access a wide variety of cryptocurrencies to diversify your portfolio and meet all your trading needs.\"],\"faXmJL\":[\"We value your \u003c0\u003efeedback\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"fbvBSo\":[\"Users opinions are in, and when it comes to security and privacy, Trezor Safe 3 is a solid hardware wallet from the industry founders. With its built-in Secure Element layer, it’s your ultimate guardian in the crypto world. Supporting 1000s of coins and tokens, it’s got your back no matter what you’re into.\"],\"fjkuYL\":[\"20-word wallet backup\"],\"fnlO7Q\":[\"Curious about BTC, ETH, ERC-20 tokens, or Cardano and Solana tokens on Trezor? Check the supported assets.\"],\"foL/Tf\":[\"ZIP/Postal code\"],\"frdg67\":[\"Trezor @ Github\"],\"frm8og\":[\"Join our Early Access Program to get access to new features before everybody else.\"],\"fswkTW\":[\"Please select a valid country from the list.\"],\"ftNxWV\":[\"What topics will the session cover and what topics are we not able to cover?\"],\"ftoVcn\":[\"Could not subscribe to newsletter\"],\"fu/zWq\":[\"Our support team and community are ready to assist you.\"],\"fu2oho\":[\"Back to security portal\"],\"fw1Hnz\":[\"Bitcoin\"],\"fwyU1F\":[\"Definitions, Scope, Trezor device, Third-party products and services, Trezor Firmware, Two factor authentification (2FA), Recovery seed, Passphrase and PIN, Liability, Support, Law and jurisdiction.\"],\"fzWn7t\":[\"MagSafe \u0026 Qi compatible for effortless power-up\"],\"g+0hv4\":[\"Premium aluminum\u003c0/\u003eunibody design\"],\"g/9JAf\":[\"Your card was declined. Check your card’s balance, try again, or use a different payment method.\"],\"g/jYGk\":[\"The Trezor Suite app makes it easy and secure to manage, buy, sell, and swap your crypto—all in one place.\"],\"g0ojeF\":[\"Innovating industry-wide standards\"],\"g2bQll\":[\"Get the latest updates on what's new in the Trezor Suite app.\"],\"g492gA\":[\"All transactions are explicitly confirmed directly on Trezor device.\"],\"g4l0M1\":[\"Enter city\"],\"g83f9k\":[\"Scam airdrop protection\"],\"g8zJ2h\":[\"Get Trezor Safe 7\"],\"g9N+8U\":[\"SAVE BIGGER\"],\"gATMSH\":[\"Trezor-compatible\"],\"gB/T1b\":[\"FIDO2 Standard\"],\"gBmYV6\":[\"Privacy \u0026 Security | Trezor\"],\"gCFg2x\":[\"Supported Coins\"],\"gF+Y6z\":[\"Enhanced security\"],\"gIA9ZD\":[\"\u003c0\u003eYour wallet backup\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ebuilt for life\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"gJY4YL\":[\"Decrease quantity\"],\"gJaep8\":[\"Get started quickly\"],\"gJrQaZ\":[\"Tor network\"],\"gLaXMn\":[\"Trezor hardware wallets that support \",[\"name\"]],\"gMCKSM\":[\"The best defense against both online and offline threats\"],\"gPqJN/\":[\"Once the order has been shipped, you will receive a notification from noreply@trezor.io containing the tracking ID.\"],\"gRc+sn\":[\"\u003c0\u003eYour wallet backup\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eis now safer\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"gSsHWt\":[\"Trezor Blog\"],\"gVfOMZ\":[[\"itemName\"],\" as a free gift\"],\"gVucP3\":[\"\u003c0\u003eAs stated in \u003c1\u003eTrezor Terms of Use\u003c/1\u003e - How to place your order, section 3.4, you are solely responsible for any information listed during the order placement procedure, including, but not limited to, the email address, shipping address, and the amount and specification of the ordered products.\u003c/0\u003eIf you have an immediate issue you can contact \u003c2\u003eTrezor Support \u003c/2\u003e via our \u003c3\u003echatbot Hal.\u003c/3\u003e Additional changes are only possible as long as your order has not been dispatched.\"],\"gXAmsC\":[\"Correctly set up your Trezor hardware wallet\"],\"gYWdr7\":[\"Keep What You’ve Earned Safe\"],\"gYryUg\":[\"Press \u0026 Media\"],\"gZHqck\":[\"Trezor is a one-time purchase—no monthly fees, ever. You can use both the device and Trezor Suite without any ongoing costs.\"],\"gatfuj\":[\"Absolute ownership and control\"],\"gbMgo8\":[\"Trezor Suite app and Trezor Connect\"],\"gcJSA9\":[\"More details in full terms\"],\"gctFUw\":[\"Connect your Trezor\"],\"gdjPxY\":[\"Trezor Model One hardware wallet\"],\"geq/oA\":[\"Suite cannot be longer than \",[\"apartmentSuiteLength\"],\" characters\"],\"gfigVM\":[\"Rewards are discount vouchers emailed within 21 days after your friend's purchase is confirmed.\"],\"gjB9dt\":[\"Download for Mobile\"],\"glXxyx\":[\"Want to support Bitcoin education through Trezor Academy\"],\"gluMe9\":[\"If you need help, please reach out to Trezor support via our chatbot.\"],\"gmnwzB\":[\"Check \u0026 Verify\"],\"gnDO1B\":[\"Collection of popular cryptocurrency coins supported by Trezor Suite app - right view\"],\"gp2BbV\":[\"Connect with the community\"],\"gupe/I\":[\"Coin management in Trezor Suite app\"],\"gzEjAL\":[\"Billing address\"],\"h+KrOF\":[\"1x 24-word Trezor Keep Metal\"],\"h/7dmA\":[\"Hide your sensitive information from potential eavesdroppers.\"],\"h/e2he\":[\"You most likely created multiple orders at around the same time and paid for one, but abandoned the others. Your paid order will be shipped, but you may receive order cancellation notifications for the other order(s). All unpaid orders are automatically canceled after 4 days. Check the order ID to confirm which order was canceled. If there is another issue, please contact \u003c0\u003eTrezor support\u003c/0\u003e via our \u003c1\u003echatbot Hal.\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"h/el2w\":[\"What’s the difference between Trezor Safe 5 and Trezor Model T?\"],\"h081HY\":[\"Type to search\"],\"h0C+Rm\":[\"Set up a passphrase for added Trezor wallet security.\"],\"h222I0\":[\"Customers and users\"],\"h2WCzJ\":[\"Get a personal 1:1 wallet setup \u003c0/\u003e session with Trezor Expert\"],\"h3kadf\":[\"Selected cryptocurrency coins, with thousands more supported.\"],\"h5BNkr\":[\"Can I get a discount?\"],\"h5PXR9\":[\"like an unmined block.\"],\"h7BAp1\":[\"Support Order FAQ\"],\"hA0VlY\":[\"Trezor Suite app supports a broad range of cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, Cardano, and many ERC-20 tokens. The full list of supported assets is constantly updated to include new coins and tokens. You can view the latest supported assets on the Supported Coins \u0026 Tokens page.\"],\"hAFHnt\":[\"The transaction amount exceeds the limit allowed for your card. Please use a different payment method or contact your bank for assistance.\"],\"hCDPDQ\":[\"Advanced \u003c0\u003eMulti-share Backup\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"hHFwZN\":[\"2.5\\\" high-res color display\"],\"hJyy9z\":[\"Full terms\"],\"hKSHZ9\":[\"Is there a limit to how many times my referral link can be used?\"],\"hKz6y5\":[\"We are currently accepting applications on an ongoing basis. The review process will assess each proposal’s alignment with SLIP-39 standards, implementation timeline, and education plan for users. Submissions are evaluated as they come in, and selected projects will receive the necessary development resources and support to complete the integration.\"],\"hMnRxZ\":[\"Dual Secure Element architecture\"],\"hMqszB\":[\"Continue to payment\"],\"hQRttt\":[\"Submit\"],\"hR7z01\":[\"Contact support if you haven't already.\"],\"hUTfKC\":[\"Disabled button\"],\"hUbrsb\":[\"If you are having trouble completing your payment or your purchase has been declined, there might be an issue with your bank or credit card. There are a few steps you can take to try and remedy the situation.\"],\"hXouvz\":[\"Reddit logo\"],\"hXzOVo\":[\"Next\"],\"hapewk\":[\"Taproot makes Bitcoin transactions safer by improving privacy \u0026 network efficiency.\"],\"hdGrhR\":[\"Trezor Suite App (Official) | Congrats on your new Trezor\"],\"he20Bh\":[\"When setting up your Trezor, you'll get \u003c0\u003ea list of 12, 20, or 24 words\u003c/0\u003e. This is your wallet backup. Use this to recover your wallet if it’s lost, stolen, or damaged.\"],\"he3ygx\":[\"Copy\"],\"hebUan\":[\"0.96\\\" Monochromatic OLED screen\"],\"hedjq0\":[\"\u003c0\u003eThousands\u003c/0\u003e of Coins \u0026 Tokens\"],\"hfzNQZ\":[\"failed payment icon\"],\"hgqEdZ\":[\"Protect your assets with with advanced security \u0026 privacy features—already on your Trezor hardware wallet and Trezor Suite.\"],\"hhjZOh\":[\"Connect with our team to explore how we can work together. Email us at \u003c0\u003epartnerships@trezor.io\u003c/0\u003e to start the conversation.\"],\"hhjztW\":[\"“I knew Trezor was open source ... but I didn't realize it was soooo open source!”\"],\"hjx7HU\":[\"If you think that there is something wrong with your Trezor device, please contact \u003c0\u003eTrezor support\u003c/0\u003e via our \u003c1\u003echatbot Hal.\u003c/1\u003e We will do our best to help you resolve your issue.\"],\"hk57j9\":[\"The app is only half the story\"],\"hkcQxl\":[\"Visit Trezor on X (Twitter)\"],\"hmCpZ7\":[\"Prevent tracking of your wallet's data\"],\"hmFKrj\":[\"What’s a transparent secure element, and why does it matter?\"],\"hmm9lf\":[\"And own your coins. \u003c0\u003eForever.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"hmtH70\":[[\"remainingCount\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[\"Show more article (\",[\"remainingCount\"],\")\"],\"other\":[\"Show more articles (\",[\"remainingCount\"],\")\"]}]],\"hoK8R9\":[\"CPF: \",[\"taxNumber\"]],\"hpU+uE\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 screen\"],\"hqt/YQ\":[\"Seamlessly works with different apps\"],\"hrhHyk\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor wallets use public, open-source code designs, so you can check and make sure each process is legit.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eBy doing so, everyone benefits from the community-tested design of your wallet, providing robust protection against real- world threats.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eSolid security and proven reliability in every Trezor.\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"hsQvC9\":[\"All-metal body for sleek style \u0026 exceptional build quality\"],\"hsVjBS\":[\"Your wallet backup is at risk when stored online\"],\"huH5S8\":[\"After completing your order, we'll send you an email with all necessary information for the session. Make sure you have your questions ready, a stable internet connection, a secure environment, and your Trezor device at hand, if needed.\"],\"hxBFty\":[\"Button\"],\"hynz2K\":[\"Download started\"],\"i+i12u\":[\"Voucher\"],\"i+jttQ\":[\"Learn about the company\"],\"i/vx4s\":[\"Shield\"],\"i1I/e6\":[\"Sensitive data exposure\"],\"i29QIM\":[\"Please select state\"],\"i3wYoV\":[\"Hardware wallets - Save 50% on Trezor Icons\"],\"i6h6Fr\":[\"Your crypto \u003c0\u003eshouldn’t be someone else’s payday\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"i9mw48\":[\"Features of Trezor Suite app\"],\"i9uRG3\":[\"Yes, you can use Trezor with your phone! You can track and manage your assets using the Trezor Suite Lite mobile app. Trezor hardware wallets are compatible with Android devices when connected via USB. Currently, iOS devices can only track balances with view-only activated.\"],\"iDN6hj\":[\"Quantum-ready architecture\"],\"iF8QXF\":[\"Delivery in progress\"],\"iFq8q/\":[\"The hardware wallet that changes crypto security forever — radically transparent, fully wireless, and quantum-ready.\"],\"iHQhf+\":[\"Bitcoin Education\"],\"iHhEeV\":[\"What is the difference between the wallet backup and private key?\"],\"iII8Q1\":[\"Storing your bitcoin online? Risky move, my friend. Those online exchanges? Hacker magnets. Always trying to break in and cause chaos. But hey, behold the Trezor Safe 5 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet! It's your bitcoin fortress—offline and super secure. Your bitcoin safe and sound.\"],\"iIM4sX\":[\"Secure Element\"],\"iM5sIf\":[\"Specifically designed for the post-quantum future\"],\"iOZllW\":[\"One Secure Device.\"],\"iVTYF+\":[\"Select state\"],\"iXTrWv\":[\"Tor\"],\"idFEj7\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite\u003c/0\u003e is an app designed to work with \",[\"coinName\"],\", available on desktop, web \u0026 mobile.\"],\"ieumdg\":[\"Get the most out of your Trezor\"],\"igmrBm\":[\"When will Trading be available in Trezor Suite on iOS?\"],\"igycTq\":[\"Send \u0026 Receive\"],\"ihUKDX\":[\"The hardware wallet that redefines crypto security forever\"],\"ijACDQ\":[\"Why should I use Trezor Model T instead of holding crypto on an exchange?\"],\"ijBqdp\":[\"You might not get a reward notification if your friend’s order hasn’t been paid yet, didn’t meet the $49 minimum, or is already “locked” to another advocate under the First Advocate Rule.\"],\"ijieYX\":[\"Trezor Safe 5\"],\"imcOJM\":[\"You're ready to protect your crypto securely. Check \u003c0\u003eour guide\u003c/0\u003e to learn how to transfer your assets from an exchange to your Trezor.\"],\"imncvX\":[\"Full iOS compatibility\"],\"inIq2b\":[\"Common problems\"],\"io+Tsl\":[\"Safety \u0026 certifications\"],\"ioXNPT\":[\"Use with the wallet app you love\"],\"ipsjqK\":[\"Send \u0026 receive assets\"],\"iqKVqg\":[\"Orders to the USA and UK can be tracked using your local postal service’s website.\"],\"isRobC\":[\"New\"],\"iuV/tq\":[\"Failed order\"],\"ivxT8C\":[\"An extra layer of wallet security \"],\"iy7iVf\":[\"Manage everything—from DeFi to NFTs—with the security of your hardware wallet\"],\"izFLHj\":[\"Transact freely, globally. No one can freeze your assets or block your access.\"],\"j+4UJh\":[\"With Trezor, pricing is fully transparent, meaning there are no hidden fees or surprise costs. When you buy, sell, or swap crypto in Trezor Suite, you always see the full cost upfront and can choose the best available offer, with support for local payments where possible. When you send crypto, you only pay the standard transaction fee, which goes to the network (e.g., Bitcoin miners or Ethereum validators), not Trezor.\"],\"j+C+E6\":[\"Wireless security comes built in with the Trezor Safe 7. Both Bluetooth and USB-C connections are secured with Trezor Host Protocol (THP), which encrypts every command and transaction to ensure no one can intercept, alter, or inject malicious messages. The wallet stays invisible to unknown devices and uses open-source encryption to ensure it connects only with trusted devices and applications. This means you get secure, encrypted communication whether you connect wirelessly or with a cable.\"],\"j+VwRn\":[\"Who is a Trezor Expert Consultation for?\"],\"j0fG/I\":[\"Ask about other Trezor products or services, but \u003c0\u003ewe don't give financial advice\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"j31PTu\":[\"Users agree: for security and privacy, the Trezor Safe 5 delivers Trezor-level protection with a smooth user experience. With a built-in Secure Element layer, it acts as your ultimate guardian in the crypto world. Its large, true-color touchscreen and haptic feedback make managing your crypto easy. Supporting 1000s of coins and tokens, Trezor Safe 5 has your back, whatever you're into.\"],\"j5ZI19\":[\"Download Trezor Suite app\"],\"j7gc8S\":[\"All orders are usually processed and handed over to the delivery provider within 1 day. However, estimated delivery times can vary from country to country.\"],\"j8hwiP\":[\"The US orders are shipped from Chattanooga (TN), Grapevine (TX), Phoenix (AZ).\"],\"j9nUPb\":[\"Keeping your seed phrase safe and sound offline is super important when you’re dealing with stuff like bitcoin, Ethereum, and other cryptocurrencies. This way, you can chill without worrying about hackers, hardware issues, or tricky social tricks messing with your coins. It’s all about safeguarding your privacy and providing long-term resilience.\"],\"jBrAIY\":[\"Rewards are sent to you automatically.\"],\"jCkN6l\":[\"The world’s first auditable secure element, paired with a second NDA-free EAL6+ secure chip. A groundbreaking dual-chip architecture that delivers the highest level of physical crypto security.\"],\"jDW3vv\":[\"Improved capabilities\"],\"jDaKdD\":[\"Trezor Expert Onboarding Session\"],\"jEcDch\":[\"IP54 rated\"],\"jGK8zX\":[\"Payment failed. Please try again later.\"],\"jKjqqT\":[\"Enhanced usability with a 1.54” touchscreen\"],\"jMAoXy\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 is x-ray safe and suitable for air travel.\"],\"jMfpBG\":[\"Friends must be new customers and place an order of $49 or more (before taxes/shipping).\"],\"jMr1A2\":[\"Very good experience. Now my crypto is in a cold wallet and \u003c0\u003eI feel safe from get hacked\u003c/0\u003e. The software is very user-friendly and support goes very well to. Im 100% satisfied with Trezor.\"],\"jT5JJC\":[\"For Trezor users, apps like MetaMask or Electrum provide access to cryptocurrencies or features not supported in Trezor Suite app. These apps rely on the hardware wallet to securely store private keys, ensuring safety even if the app itself is compromised.\"],\"jWTy4K\":[\"Reclaim overpayment\"],\"jZvNkQ\":[\"What to do if I have received an incorrect, faulty or damaged item?\"],\"ja3lDX\":[\"Ghana\"],\"jaAquN\":[\"Connect securely via USB-C\"],\"jb9zPd\":[\"Waiting for stock or additional information\"],\"jc8clt\":[\"Your order’s been \u003c0\u003eplaced, \u003c/0\u003econgrats\"],\"jeVQ71\":[\"Quick and Easy\"],\"jfC/xh\":[\"Contact\"],\"jfIF+z\":[\"On mobile (iOS and Android), you can buy, sell, and send assets with the same security and privacy. The mobile app is continuously being improved to bring more features.\"],\"jhk+Mc\":[\"Most crypto assets are supported across all devices, with a few exceptions.\"],\"jj0ON0\":[\"What is a hardware wallet\"],\"jlRBU8\":[\"Trezor hardware wallets\"],\"jptiFw\":[\"You can't add both Trezor Expert Onboarding and Trezor Expert Consultation sessions to the cart in a single order. Please create a second order if you’d like to purchase both.\"],\"jqIsTv\":[\"Get a personal approach\"],\"jqoi51\":[\"Product confidence\"],\"jsImau\":[\"If it didn't, \u003c0\u003eclick here to download manually\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"jstiRs\":[\"In the list you can also find information about which Trezor model supports each cryptocurrency, as some coins cannot be used in the Trezor Suite app, but are supported through the use of a third party application with your Trezor.\"],\"jwXwjI\":[\"Yes—and securely. Trezor supports WalletConnect so you can interact with DeFi dApps like Uniswap, 1inch, or NFT marketplaces like OpenSea directly from your hardware wallet. You can trade, stake, and swap while keeping full control of your private keys.\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1/\u003eAnd with Trezor Suite, our native companion app, you can buy, sell, swap, and stake selected cryptocurrencies all in the most intuitive, secure environment possible. Trade crypto with the peace of mind that your keys never leave your device.\"],\"jwtM5y\":[\"Connect Trezor \u003e Open Trezor Suite \u003e Select account \u003e Generate and copy receive address \u003e Paste into sending app or exchange. Voilà!\"],\"jy+OF6\":[\"Focus on Bitcoin solely by installing Bitcoin-only firmware and use it easily in Trezor Suite app.\"],\"jyVgI4\":[\"Server misconfiguration\"],\"k/Czbf\":[\"\u003c0\u003eBe the boss of your\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003efinancial future\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"k0agbD\":[\"We usually respond within 2 days\"],\"k2l4l2\":[\"\u003c0\u003eThe app made\u003c/0\u003e for your \u003c1\u003eTrezor\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"k3zYmu\":[\"Video guide\"],\"k4TCze\":[\"Please enter \",[\"name\"]],\"k5vuAn\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 elevated view\"],\"k7Nd9z\":[\"A hardware wallet keeps your private keys completely offline, protecting them from online threats like hacking, malware, and account freezes. Hot wallets - such as a mobile wallet app, desktop wallet, or browser extension - are convenient for quick access, but keep your keys on internet-connected devices, which increases their exposure to attacks. Many people use a hardware wallet for long-term storage and a hot wallet for small, everyday amounts.\"],\"k8GGBU\":[\"Trezor Reseller Program | Trezor.io\"],\"kAdgy+\":[\"Two-button pad\"],\"kCIiM4\":[\"The Trezor Model T earns praise for its top-notch security, user-friendly touchscreen, compatibility with numerous cryptocurrencies, robust build quality, regular security updates, and reputation as a trusted brand in crypto security and privacy.\"],\"kCcBv8\":[\"Trezor cold wallets support Bitcoin and the most resilient and proven crypto worldwide. Check supported coins now.\"],\"kDIhrW\":[\"\u003c0\u003eCoin security\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ewith a touchscreen\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"kDfL2r\":[\"Security Principles\"],\"kEcWTE\":[\"Strength meets elegance. With an anodized aluminum unibody, a reinforced glass back, and an IP54 rating, this wallet is sleek, durable, and dust \u0026 water resistant—designed to impress.\"],\"kFTt32\":[\"Open a third-party wallet app\"],\"kFzMZv\":[\"Guides, articles, tips and answers to build your crypto confidence.\"],\"kJD0pq\":[\"City cannot be longer than \",[\"apartmentSuiteLength\"],\" characters\"],\"kLKoGJ\":[\"Gain skills to confidently manage your crypto\"],\"kQqAmX\":[\"Error setting the shipping method. Please try again\"],\"kRwwve\":[\"Start now\"],\"kSBy8q\":[\"Discover Trezor Press \u0026 Media resources, access our brand manual, and explore Trezor Academy's educational programs.\"],\"kWEA25\":[\"Tracking link has been sent to your email\"],\"kZZZOF\":[\"Wallet setup isn’t currently available on the Android app. Continue in your browser or visit this page on your computer.\"],\"kcvkX9\":[\"Trezor hardware wallets keep your crypto 100% offline and out of reach of hackers, malware, and other online threats.\"],\"kdFprI\":[\"Rating: \",[\"TRUSTPILOT_TRUST_SCORE\"],\" out of 5\"],\"keLH8d\":[\"Your payment via \u003c0\u003eConfirmo\u003c/0\u003e was below the amount of \u003c1\u003e\",[\"price\"],\"\u003c/1\u003e for your order \u003c2\u003e#\",[\"number\"],\"\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"keSirC\":[\"Control of Your Crypto\"],\"kfXbR6\":[\"Resistant against dust \u0026 water splashes\"],\"kffN7m\":[\"Black friday offer of Trezor hardware wallets, bundles, and accessories.\"],\"kiBN5g\":[\"Get started quickly with clear instructions and helpful guides ready to assist. No experience is needed—just connect and in minutes you’re ready to go.\"],\"kj3JSS\":[\"Trezor wallets have locks in place to keep out any unwanted visitors.\"],\"kkfoO3\":[\"If an exchange fails, you’ll lose all your coins\"],\"klbt48\":[\"No stress! Get a new Trezor from the Trezor Shop or an official reseller. Then use your recovery seed (wallet backup), which you created when setting up your first wallet, to regain access to your funds on the new wallet. Need help? Reach out to Trezor Support.\"],\"kmL8HR\":[\"Your wallet is 100% safe offline\"],\"kmk0hm\":[\"Access the ecosystem\"],\"koUM/F\":[\"Articles \u003c0/\u003e\"],\"kpgmML\":[\"Zambia\"],\"kqOsso\":[\"Recover your coins with a backup\"],\"kryGs+\":[\"Card\"],\"kvMvy6\":[\"Trezor bug bounty program | Trezor\"],\"kvTKTv\":[\"Trezor Expert Consultation sessions are available for all Trezor hardware wallets.\"],\"kvhBMQ\":[\"Transparent, public code anyone can review, audit \u0026 verify\"],\"kwa0/W\":[\"What is the earliest I can book the session?\"],\"kwllLK\":[\"Shipping\"],\"kx/Ij/\":[\"The \u003c0\u003eTrezor Help Center\u003c/0\u003e is our official troubleshooter, where you can also submit questions for help with technical, payment or logistics issues. Before opening a ticket, check our other support channels to see if the issue can be resolved more easily on your own:\"],\"kxB9rl\":[\"In preparation\"],\"kyCWr5\":[\"Pay for daily essentials while saving for the long term. Create wallets for each cryptocurrency to better manage and track balances.\"],\"kyR35r\":[\"No experience needed\"],\"kyRwgj\":[\"\u003c0\u003eMeet our Trezor\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eExperts\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"l/10Ly\":[\"\u003c0\u003eThe original\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ehardware wallet\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"l0PYTN\":[\"Vulnerabilities on sites hosted by third parties (Medium, Twitter, Facebook, Cloudflare, etc.)\"],\"l0e7sn\":[\"Export your transactions into CSV, PDF, and other formats in Trezor Suite.\"],\"l11JCa\":[\"What’s the difference between Trezor Keep Metal vs Cryptotag Zeus?\"],\"l208qi\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 hardware wallet\"],\"l3kgim\":[\"Website Terms of Use\"],\"l6ICTA\":[\"Company tile \",[\"title\"]],\"l6wUri\":[\"for Windows\"],\"l7Thvr\":[\"Secure and open-source — trusted by rebels and believers in financial freedom everywhere.\"],\"l88XNv\":[\"Easy-peasy! If you have cryptocurrencies stored online, just move them to your Trezor device. Use the Trezor Suite app to generate a receive address, confirm this address on your Trezor device, and then transfer your coins to it. Your crypto will be securely in your control.\"],\"l9JJjY\":[\"Quickly and easily exchange one cryptocurrency for another, while keeping your funds secure with Trezor Suite’s \u003c0\u003eswap\u003c/0\u003e feature.\"],\"lAm81O\":[\"I only have a small amount of crypto. Do I still need a hardware wallet?\"],\"lBDx7Y\":[\"I’d like to join the Trezor Refer-A-Friend rewards program and agree to the \u003c0\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/0\u003e, the \u003c1\u003eRefer-A-Friend Program Terms \u0026 Conditions\u003c/1\u003e, and the \u003c2\u003eGeneral Terms of Use\u003c/2\u003e.\"],\"lCF0wC\":[\"Refresh\"],\"lCJ5fy\":[\"Integrate Trezor with your services\"],\"lCUbpH\":[\"Enjoy a simple, user-friendly trading experience that completes your crypto transactions in just a few clicks.\"],\"lDiEbZ\":[\"You can't combine this voucher with your current discount. Remove the existing voucher first.\"],\"lLbEz4\":[\"Save \",[\"selectedPercentage\"],\"% (\",[\"formatedPrice\"],\")\"],\"lLmTWM\":[\"Please enter a valid CVC.\"],\"lN74zZ\":[\"PIN \u0026 Passphrase protection\"],\"lUrVO4\":[\"You can also buy Trezor wallets from one of our \u003c0\u003eofficial resellers\u003c/0\u003e. In some countries such as Brazil and the Philippines this lets you avoid a complex and expensive customs process.\"],\"lVZAPK\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrack coins\u003c/0\u003e on the move\"],\"lVqRlQ\":[\"Please enter a valid name.\"],\"lZovO6\":[\"Eshop Terms of Use\"],\"le2+e8\":[\"Secure your \u003c0\u003ebackup\u003c/0\u003e in a resilient steel design\"],\"lenXDG\":[\"Not found image\"],\"lhDQL1\":[\"Send, receive, \u003c0\u003estake\u003c/0\u003e \u0026 trade\"],\"lhg7oc\":[\"No minimum amount needed\"],\"ljNyY0\":[\"Distribute backup shares across locations or people\"],\"lkZf1X\":[\"Sent!\"],\"lm40zU\":[\"No posting on coupon sites, public forums, or social media you don't own.\"],\"lnL5Iy\":[\"Apple Pay payment failed. Please try again later.\"],\"lqZ78G\":[\"Indestructible wallet\u003c0/\u003ebackup forged in steel\"],\"lr0bcK\":[\"Feb 21, 2025\"],\"lrVgg9\":[\"About Trezor\"],\"ltja9A\":[\"Security starts with open-source\"],\"lvYn9G\":[\"\u003c0\u003ePIN\u003c/0\u003e \u0026 \u003c1\u003epassphrase\u003c/1\u003e protection\"],\"lwURZE\":[\"Do you ship to my country?\"],\"lxGcV2\":[\"Website (optional)\"],\"m20Saa\":[\"Discover more\"],\"m4SJt1\":[\"24-word wallet backup\"],\"m4rsTz\":[\"Toggle section\"],\"m53m3a\":[\"Create, split, share, store, collect \u0026 recover\"],\"m67czi\":[\"60x30x6 mm / 12 g\u003c0/\u003e2.4x1.2x0.2 in / 0.42 oz\"],\"m7Ntd2\":[\"Shamir Backup is a storage solution designed for safeguarding wallet backup (recovery seed) using multiple wordlists. You then share these word lists with folks you trust or stash them in safe spots nearby. So, if your wallet ever goes missing, gets swiped, or takes a beating, all you have to do is gather the right number of wordlists to get your wallet back on track.\"],\"m7PZCB\":[\"\u003c0\u003eYour crypto is on the blockchain and the keys to your crypto are kept on your physical device. To learn more about this we suggest you \u003c1\u003echeck out this fantastic blog article\u003c/1\u003e about where your coins are stored.\u003c/0\u003eYour coins are always associated with a set of keys: your private and your public key.\"],\"m7SEND\":[\"Establish your wallet backup preference\"],\"m9N80P\":[\"VAT ID:\"],\"m9wtog\":[\"Available for\"],\"mA++b6\":[\"Would you like to become official reseller of Trezor hardware wallets? Get in touch and we'll be happy to discuss it in detail.\"],\"mEBNzq\":[\"Supported Coins \u0026 Assets | Trezor Hardware Wallets\"],\"mFc+K+\":[\"Trezor founded\"],\"mIkUl4\":[\"\u0026 similar technologies\"],\"mQgHgR\":[\"$$20 rewards are emailed as Trezor discount vouchers.\"],\"mTKuRV\":[\"Privacy \u0026 Security background\"],\"mTQWf7\":[\"Processing payment\"],\"mUtBJu\":[\"Store your wallet backup inside your Trezor Keep Metal in a safe, secure place. This could be a hidden safe in the wall, a hole your pooch Rusty dug in the backyard, or anywhere else that is only known by you or others you trust completely. Once you’ve found the perfect hiding place, sit back, relax, and enjoy some peace of mind.\"],\"mWjMQd\":[\"Share article\"],\"mXAFdH\":[\"Why did you switch from a standard backup to a new format?\"],\"mXFWj9\":[\"$a\"],\"mXXeMy\":[\"Need help setting up? Book a 1:1 session with a Trezor expert.\"],\"mXzv4S\":[\"Fully booked\"],\"mYf5NY\":[\"All Trezor devices are CE and RoHS certified, meeting all quality, reliability, and environmental standards. Trezors are X-ray safe and suitable for air travel.\"],\"mZTRUl\":[\"Select issue\"],\"mZhteu\":[\"Store\"],\"mZmCk2\":[\"Payment methods\"],\"ma5HNR\":[\"If you want the Bitcoin-only Trezor Safe 7, there’s only one place to get it: our official E-shop on Trezor.io. Order now to get the wallet built exclusively for true Bitcoiners and dedicated entirely to Bitcoin security.\"],\"mb4sQe\":[[\"0\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[\"Supported \u003c0/\u003e Network\"],\"other\":[\"Supported \u003c1/\u003e Networks\"]}]],\"mcHBiP\":[\"Trezor Suite app user interface\"],\"mdjIGI\":[\"All customer data is either deleted or anonymized within 90 days. \u003c0\u003eLearn more\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"mdpz0b\":[\"Ultra-secure \u003c0/\u003e wallet \u003c1\u003ebackup solution\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"mgU7Pn\":[\"Protect identity with Tor\"],\"ml7iOm\":[\"Learn how to transfer your assets to Trezor safely using the right network for any wallet app.\"],\"mo/Muw\":[\"More assets\"],\"moW80a\":[\"Move your coins\"],\"mpby9d\":[\"Contact support\"],\"mrL1pX\":[\"Third-party wallet apps are software tools developed outside of hardware wallet manufacturers. They let users manage, send, and receive cryptocurrencies, often offering extra features like DeFi, staking, or token swaps.\"],\"ms/Leo\":[\"Swap directly from your wallet\"],\"mvGSEh\":[\"Third-party wallets\"],\"myOJYg\":[\"Give feedback\"],\"n+1yNf\":[\"Enjoy industry-leading security features built directly into the Trezor Suite app.\"],\"n+8yVN\":[\"Signature\"],\"n0zxuf\":[\"Currently, third-party wallets like Rabby, Electrum, Sparrow, and BlueWallet support the SLIP39 standard. We're actively collaborating with additional wallets to expand support and will provide updates here as new integrations are completed.\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1/\u003eFurthermore, we actively encourage enhanced backup support integration into software wallets through a bounty program. This initiative extends financial and expertise support to software wallet providers seeking to implement SLIP39.\u003c2/\u003e\u003c3/\u003eWe were in the same situation back in 2013 with our legacy backup standard, where we were the first who invented it, and the rest of the market followed us.\"],\"n2OmcP\":[\"Still unsure why you need a Trezor?\"],\"n4vt3Q\":[\"Download app\"],\"n5BxWp\":[\"A revolution in creating, using, storing, and protecting your wallet backup.\"],\"n6bA7l\":[\"Tags:\"],\"n7ebIc\":[\"Coin control\"],\"n9pPPm\":[\"Facebook logo\"],\"nAtg2d\":[\"Search articles\"],\"nB9RTO\":[\"Trezor Safe 5 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet\"],\"nCik30\":[\"Trezor products use open-source designs for transparent verification and community-tested security against real-world threats.\"],\"nDQwea\":[\"Crypto convenience with a vibrant color touchscreen \u0026 haptic feedback.\"],\"nGEkLn\":[\"Gain protection against future threats with the first-ever hardware wallet built with quantum-ready architecture.\"],\"nJjDZz\":[\"Shop Now \u0026 Save\"],\"nKiOIS\":[\"Privacy \u0026 Security\"],\"nLFe1b\":[\"Voucher $\",[\"promoCode\"]],\"nLNay6\":[\"Parcels ordered using Standard shipping can be tracked \u003c0\u003ehere\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"nLd/ZW\":[\"Reward depends on the product it affects and severity. We reserve the right to determine the severity and eligibility of reports.\"],\"nMbDcT\":[\"New standard for advanced, verifiable crypto security\"],\"nO2uIE\":[\"Large, high-res color touchscreen \u003c0\u003e2.56\\\"\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"nOz4gS\":[\"Get Boss-Level Security\"],\"nP5c6m\":[\"The world’s first transparent, auditable Secure Element\"],\"nPcL9E\":[\"This is \u003c0\u003ehow it works\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"nQMUIO\":[\"Increase quantity\"],\"nQQp5b\":[\"with Trezor Hardware wallets\"],\"nRdIbq\":[\"You must agree to the Terms of service.\"],\"nTWWCZ\":[\"Low\"],\"nUmCAH\":[\"Collection of popular cryptocurrency coins supported by Trezor Suite - right view\"],\"nWDXqa\":[\"World’s first auditable Secure Element\"],\"nWpi6G\":[\"Where can I buy a Trezor Safe 5 hardware wallet?\"],\"nXsQae\":[\"Share on Reddit\"],\"nYpaJs\":[\"Trezor model\"],\"nadpcE\":[\"Own it. Protect it. Grow it.\u003c0/\u003e All with Trezor.\"],\"ndH/1Q\":[\"Invoice has been sent to your email.\"],\"ndN+FD\":[\"Send \u0026 receive coins, track your portfolio, trade assets or pay for daily essentials directly from the app.\"],\"ndzNKH\":[\"Wireless freedom\"],\"ne8L7z\":[\"For a safe bet on getting your hands on a new Trezor Model One, just head to the official Trezor Shop or check out one of our trusted resellers. These are your go-to options to make sure your device is the real deal, no funny business. And if you’ve got any questions about your Trezor purchase, don’t hesitate to hit up Trezor Support. They’ve got your back!\"],\"neuZ21\":[\"Store Hero Navigation Image\"],\"ngmjKT\":[\"What’s yours, is yours. Keep and control your crypto offline with Trezor. Our hardware wallets protect your identity and coins.\"],\"nh/3ev\":[\"Failed to set currency, please try again.\"],\"nlB8OH\":[\"Why is a hardware wallet better?\"],\"npJ1QO\":[\"Wallet setup on iPad is only supported for Trezor Safe 7. For other Trezor models, please visit this page on your computer.\"],\"npZEWh\":[\"Sleep well knowing your crypto backup is fire, water \u0026 impact-resistant\"],\"nrBmRX\":[\"Enhance bitcoin safety, privacy \u0026 network efficiency.\"],\"nre+r/\":[\"\u003c0\u003eofficial resellers\u003c/0\u003e or our official \u003c1\u003eAmazon Store\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"nu723H\":[\"Why should I use Trezor Safe 3 Bitcoin-only wallet instead of holding bitcoin on an exchange?\"],\"nuThVK\":[\"Show \",[\"headline\"],\" card details\"],\"nwFOVY\":[\"Voucher (\",[\"name\"],\")\"],\"nwtY4N\":[\"Something went wrong\"],\"nxBYhL\":[\"Scroll to the Trezor keep metal section\"],\"nxbyAv\":[\"Select pick-up point\"],\"nyOdWj\":[\"Yes! The Trezor Expert Onboarding Session is designed for your privacy and security. No private data is shared during the session. Only the voice of the Trezor Expert is recorded for liability purposes.\"],\"nzXScE\":[\"A hardware wallet, like Trezor, provides top-notch security by keeping your sensitive data and crypto access completely offline. This protects your assets from hackers, malware, and other online threats. Unlike exchanges, which can be vulnerable to hacks or government restrictions, a hardware wallet gives you full control of your assets. Additionally, Trezor offers easy wallet backup, ensuring your funds are recoverable even if the device is lost or damaged.\"],\"o0qYVc\":[\"\u003c0\u003eBacked up \u0026 instantly\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003erestorable if lost\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"o5szx+\":[\"If you have an immediate issue you can contact \u003c0\u003eTrezor Support \u003c/0\u003e via our \u003c1\u003echatbot Hal.\u003c/1\u003e Additional changes are only possible as long as your order has not been dispatched.\"],\"o74XMR\":[\"Trezor Suite app natively supports many altcoins directly in the app.\"],\"o7J4JM\":[\"Filter\"],\"o9G/Iy\":[\"A hardware wallet, like Trezor, provides top-notch security by keeping your sensitive data and crypto access completely offline. This protects your assets from hackers, malware, and other online threats. Unlike exchanges, which can be vulnerable to hacks or government restrictions, a hardware wallet gives you full control of your assets. Additionally, Trezor offers easy \u003c0\u003ewallet backup\u003c/0\u003e, ensuring your funds are recoverable even if the device is lost or damaged.\"],\"oD8Obh\":[\"Scan to download\"],\"oDjQWp\":[\"Please select an issue\"],\"oDsSCZ\":[\"Built to Last. Just like your crypto\"],\"oE2PF/\":[\"Anodized aluminum unibody: A robust, lightweight, and corrosion-resistant frame milled from a single block of aluminum.\"],\"oEhKk2\":[\"It lets you store your crypto access offline, \u003c0\u003eprotected \u003c1/\u003e\u003c/0\u003e from online threats and accessible only by you.\"],\"oEmpTH\":[\"Blur \u0026 sort scam airdrop tokens into their own hidden section.\"],\"oEn7TT\":[\"Refer a friend campaign\"],\"oFR4uL\":[\"Trezor Keep Metal Backup\"],\"oG/Zsn\":[\"For a secure purchase of a new Trezor Safe 5 hardware wallet, head over to the official Trezor Shop. Going thought this channel is your top choice to guarantee that your device is genuine, unaltered, and absolutely legit. If you have any questions with your Trezor purchase, reach out to Trezor Support.\"],\"oGf1xD\":[\"Coin Control\"],\"oH9Ytw\":[\"Go to your cart to view unavailable items.\"],\"oNwiTd\":[\"What are the reviews of Trezor Model One?\"],\"oOhwjZ\":[\"for Linux\"],\"oPbw/8\":[\"Your personal info and crypto data is stored online\"],\"oQ/XK+\":[\"Currently, our system accepts payments received within 15 minutes of requesting the payment. If the transaction arrives after the 15 minute window, you should contact \u003c0\u003eTrezor support\u003c/0\u003e via our \u003c1\u003echatbot Hal\u003c/1\u003e. and request a refund.\"],\"oQh70g\":[\"BLACK FRIDAY %\"],\"oSGLuM\":[\"Loading more countries\"],\"oSoPnm\":[\"You can refer up to 50 friends per year, earning $20 per qualifying referral (max $1,000/year).\"],\"oTP/0S\":[\"Prevent unauthorized device access and keep your hardware wallet secure.\"],\"oTVzFB\":[\"I have been using Trezor for 10 years and it always \u003c0\u003edelivered the best in security, usability\u003c/0\u003e and customer experience! Thank you!\"],\"oV9mq0\":[\"Open Trezor Suite, select your asset (activate first if needed), go to “Receive,” show full address, verify it on your Trezor, paste address into your exchange’s “Send to” field. Voilà!\"],\"oW7gk6\":[\"Need help? We’ve got answers\"],\"oWQDuz\":[\"All payment details are required. Please complete the form.\"],\"oXonyd\":[\"Invite friends \u0026 earn USD 20\"],\"oYcOsw\":[\"You underpaid via Confirmo\"],\"oYg7WF\":[\"Functionality\"],\"oaYAkd\":[\"Does Trezor Keep Metal Multi-share Backup work with all Trezor hardware wallets?\"],\"ocsgWg\":[\"Transferring your cryptocurrency from your online exchange to your Trezor is a breeze. Start by connecting your Trezor Model One, launching Trezor Suite, and entering your PIN. Then, select your preferred receiving account and copy the wallet address. Switch to your online exchange, choose the cryptocurrency, paste the address, and confirm the transaction. That’s it!\"],\"od2Zm+\":[\"Say Hi, Trezor Safe 5\"],\"oe32Sg\":[\"Book your Trezor Expert Consultation session \u003c0\u003ewithin 180 days\u003c/0\u003e of completing your order.\"],\"ofzfCQ\":[\"You’ll receive a booking confirmation once everything is set. You can reschedule up to 72 hours before the start of your scheduled session.\"],\"oiCHIe\":[\"\u003c0\u003e10+\u003c/0\u003e Years in Bitcoin\"],\"oj9Jkm\":[\"Years in crypto\"],\"ojcQSf\":[\"Underpaid order\"],\"ojkfHz\":[\"Trezor Resellers | Trezor Hardware Wallets\"],\"okrAMh\":[\"Protecting your rights\"],\"olYvSD\":[\"Wallet setup isn’t currently available on iPad. Visit this page on your computer.\"],\"olZdEr\":[\"-20°C to +60°C / -4°F to +140°F\"],\"onDPb5\":[\"No resellers found for \",[\"searchQuery\"]],\"ooA+hm\":[\"At a glance\"],\"ooJ9h2\":[\"Simple Setup \u0026 Use\"],\"opRp3/\":[\"The next generation Trezor, fueled by innovative development, is released.\"],\"oqi+0W\":[\"What can you expect from a Trezor Expert Consultation?\"],\"orBchC\":[\"New standard for advanced, verifiable Bitcoin security\"],\"osUFPB\":[\"Trezor Expert Onboarding Sessions are available for all Trezor hardware wallets.\"],\"ouBfHV\":[\"Payment successful\"],\"our store\":[\"our store\"],\"owD6zC\":[\"Specs\"],\"p/uvJo\":[[\"coinName\"],\" icon\"],\"p0opSK\":[\"\u003c0\u003eKeep sensitive info\u003c/0\u003e such as your \u003c1\u003ePIN\u003c/1\u003e or \u003c2\u003ewallet backup\u003c/2\u003e safe. Trezor Expert will never ask for it.\"],\"p3mKE6\":[\"USB-C → USB-C\"],\"p3wQwY\":[\"\u003c0\u003eLeading the industry\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ewe created\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"p4DMbd\":[\"Trezor devices are built to last for years with proper care. There’s no built-in expiration—you only need to replace it if the hardware is damaged.\"],\"p5E3Nd\":[\"We’re a mixed bag of crypto enthusiasts, design gurus, security genies, and true-believers in the bitcoin movement. We also like cold beer, good food, and making the most out of each day.\"],\"pAEun3\":[\"Not at all. Trezor makes it simple to take control of your assets. As a non-custodial wallet, Trezor ensures only you hold the keys to your crypto. The setup process is straightforward, with an intuitive interface and clear step-by-step guidance. This makes self-custody easy, keeping your crypto securely in your hands without unnecessary complexity.\"],\"pBWbKc\":[\"Water and dust resistant crypto security\"],\"pEHc7l\":[\"Scroll to the Trezor Expert section\"],\"pFN5g5\":[\"Reward structure\"],\"pGSDxi\":[\"Adding voucher failed, please try again later.\"],\"pHgX5/\":[\"Information contained:\"],\"pK1Hp7\":[\"\u003c0\u003eEngineered for\u003c/0\u003e excellence.\u003c1/\u003eDesigned to inspire.\"],\"pNc55L\":[\"This is how it works\"],\"pNdb7J\":[\"Take your \u003c0\u003ewallet backup\u003c/0\u003e to the next level\"],\"pNp8Zi\":[\"Enter your email below to join our newsletter.\"],\"pNqjzN\":[\"The Trezor Keep Metal—Shamir Backup is an advanced solution for securely storing your wallet backup (recovery seed). It’s made from durable stainless stain and is your best bet when it comes to keeping your cryptocurrency access safe and sound. Trezor elevates your wallet backup with unmatched practicality, functionality, and security.\"],\"pO/a3k\":[\"When you store crypto on an exchange, they control access to your funds. If the exchange gets hacked, goes bankrupt, or freezes accounts, you could lose your assets.\"],\"pO6wpu\":[\"Screenshot of \",[\"name\"],\" wallet interface in Trezor Suite - showing full integration and support\"],\"pRrLei\":[\"Biometrics login\"],\"pSNByX\":[\"Model T\"],\"pTU+qV\":[\"By clicking \\\"Agree and continue\\\", you allow us to provide Trustpilot the name you've shared above and your email address. This name will be shown with your review. Your email address will be deleted by Trustpilot shortly after they receive it.\"],\"pWsDsd\":[\"Gorilla® Glass 5 display\"],\"pa93p+\":[\"A seed phrase, also known as a recovery seed or wallet backup, is like your wallet’s safety words, a sequence of readable words to back up and recover your wallet. Private key, on the other hand, is your super-secret code, typically a long jumble of characters. It’s what you use to sign transactions and access your crypto stored at a specific address.\"],\"pcYA5o\":[\"Manage, send, receive \u0026 trade crypto\"],\"pjkUFN\":[\"Rated \u003c0\u003e\",[\"score\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e / 5 based on \u003c1\u003e\",[\"count\"],\" reviews\u003c/1\u003e. Showing our 4 \u0026 5 star reviews.\"],\"pkHcoY\":[\"Trezor Expert session banner\"],\"pmoMJ8\":[\"Add hardware security to your favorite software wallets—MetaMask, Rabby, and more.\"],\"ppFixr\":[\"What wallets support this backup standard?\"],\"ppegSg\":[\"No need to stress. Quantum computers aren’t an immediate threat to your crypto. But planning ahead is smart. The Trezor Safe 7 is the only hardware wallet designed with quantum-secure protection, ensuring it can be safely updated well into the future. When networks transition to post-quantum security, you won’t need to replace your hardware wallet. Combined with your recovery key, you stay fully in control as quantum technology and threats evolve.\"],\"pqZJT2\":[\"Close chat\"],\"prelgx\":[\"As a security measure, Trezor devices have no serial numbers. What you see on the box of your Trezor is a serial number of the packaging, used to identify specific batches of packaging in case of packaging error.\"],\"psfb4T\":[\"Easily move your \",[\"name\"],\" from any wallet or exchange to your Trezor hardware wallet.\"],\"ptMd+i\":[[\"remainingCount\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[\"Show more coin (\",[\"remainingCount\"],\")\"],\"other\":[\"Show more coins (\",[\"remainingCount\"],\")\"]}]],\"pzLayV\":[\"With a hardware wallet, your crypto stays safe from online risks such as hacking, viruses, and account freezes. Hot wallets, such as online exchanges, are online and can be hacked, putting your assets at risk.\"],\"q+sX/P\":[\"Connect your Trezor hardware wallet to your computer or mobile device. If you don’t have one yet, you can buy it \u003c0\u003ehere\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"q0k36V\":[\"Instantly and securely buy your favourite cryptocurrencies directly into your Trezor wallet, using the best offers and multiple payment methods.\"],\"q1cOJj\":[\"115x30 mm / 475 g\u003c0/\u003e4.5x1.2 in / 16.8 oz\"],\"q4iXCe\":[\"Please enter billing country\"],\"q4xCjk\":[\"The Trezor Safe 7 isn't just another hardware wallet. It's built for transparency, usability, and long-term security. With dual Secure Elements, a full-color intuitive touchscreen, wireless and wired options, open-source firmware, and a quantum-ready foundation, you stay in charge of your assets and privacy without relying on hidden components or closed NDAs. Advanced backup options, including Multi-share Backup and Passphrase Protection, give you extra control and peace of mind, ensuring your funds are always protected.\"],\"q5pSdK\":[\"Take control of your \",[\"name\"],\" assets with complete confidence in the Trezor ecosystem.\"],\"q6uxkD\":[\"What about things like Tropic Secure Element, quantum-ready security, and other product features?\"],\"q8yluz\":[\"Your name\"],\"qD1goZ\":[\"Single NDA-free EAL6+ Secure Element\"],\"qFlJZV\":[\"Buy an authentic Trezor Keep Metal Multi-share Backup at the official Trezor Shop or connect with one of our reputable authorized sellers. These are the best ways to get genuine Trezor products, no gimmicks involved. If you have any questions regarding your Trezor purchase, feel free to contact Trezor Support.\"],\"qKFjxl\":[\"What Is a Hardware Wallet? A Simple Guide to Keeping Your Crypto Safe | Trezor\"],\"qKvuu4\":[\"What does Trezor Suite app do?\"],\"qMA8ON\":[\"Book\"],\"qMF20A\":[\"Error setting country. Please try again.\"],\"qNM9Cz\":[\"“I love their customer support (fast, courteous, responsive) that provides quick response, status, and frequent updates. I now recommend Trezor and will be a repeat customer.”\"],\"qNuQSp\":[\"Voucher isn't valid or it has been already used.\"],\"qS1rpM\":[\"Trezor Expert Consultation\"],\"qT4vQ3\":[\"All customer data is deleted or anonymized 90 days after purchase on the Trezor Shop.\"],\"qTFLgS\":[\"Sit back and relax—your assets are safe \u0026 secure. Your Trezor hardware wallet offers unparalleled protection for your crypto.\"],\"qW+Y89\":[\"Bluetooth connectivity\"],\"qXyy2w\":[\"In case you received the wrong item, please, do not open it and let us know, we will manage the\\nreturn and we will send you the correct one.\"],\"qYLniX\":[\"Search, find, and solve common issues with Trezor hardware wallets, Trezor Suite, using crypto, and more.\"],\"qZ+aIk\":[\"Sold out. Remove the item to continue to checkout.\"],\"qbJPPg\":[\"Whether you're new to crypto, unsure about tech, or already familiar with hardware wallets, this session simplifies the process of setting up your Trezor.\"],\"qbgW+C\":[\"Highlights\"],\"qetOpj\":[\"Get the right tools in Trezor Suite app to safely send, receive, trade, and manage your coins. Increase your transaction security and privacy with coin control, and the Tor network.\"],\"qiOIiY\":[\"Buy\"],\"qkHJdA\":[\"Flexible Share Allocation\"],\"qpACfy\":[\"Return defective product\"],\"qqsAJR\":[\"The first-ever hardware wallet ready for the quantum era of crypto security.\"],\"qrumiC\":[\"Send, receive, trade \u0026 stake your coins\"],\"qw/GOM\":[\"Set up in minutes\"],\"qxYAVf\":[\"Use the Trezor Safe 3 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet for an unparalleled Bitcoin experience. This wallet is designed solely for Bitcoin enthusiasts, ensuring a seamless experience with all operations and features dedicated exclusively to managing your Bitcoin accounts and balances.\"],\"r3O4aD\":[\"Screenshot of \",[\"name\"],\" wallet interface in Trezor Suite app - showing full integration and support\"],\"r4YKvw\":[\"Sync your Trezor with wallet apps\"],\"r5FOa9\":[\"Enter email address\"],\"r5JTQ+\":[\"Keeping your seed phrase safe and sound offline is super important when you’re dealing with stuff like bitcoin, Ethereum, and other cryptocurrencies.This way, you can chill without worrying about hackers, hardware issues, or tricky social tricks messing with your coins.It’s all about safeguarding your privacy and providing long-term resilience.\"],\"r5XYtY\":[\"Battery\"],\"r7q3xq\":[\"Enhance your favorite software wallet with hardware security. Trezor supports 30+ wallet apps like MetaMask, Rabby, Backpack, and more.\"],\"rD2uL2\":[\"Wireless connectivity\"],\"rDGQUh\":[\"240 x 240 pixels\"],\"rF3kwh\":[\"Thousands of coins.\"],\"rGxUwC\":[\"I want to change the delivery address\"],\"rI7mWy\":[\"Agree and continue\"],\"rJ0REZ\":[\"For a secure purchase of a new Trezor Safe 3 hardware wallet, head over to the official Trezor Shop. Going through this channel is your top choice to guarantee that your device is genuine, unaltered, and absolutely legit. If you have any questions with your Trezor purchase, reach out to Trezor Support.\"],\"rJSgQC\":[\"Order #\u003c0\u003e\",[\"number\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e details, including tracking links and invoice, will be emailed to \u003c1\u003e\",[\"email\"],\"\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"rKfDct\":[\"Company page hero - trezors\"],\"rLgPvm\":[\"Backup\"],\"rLj4py\":[\"Open-source encryption secures your Bluetooth connections on any device, while Qi2-compatible wireless charging keeps your wallet powered up.\"],\"rMrB6P\":[\"Where can I find more information and support?\"],\"rO1O2Y\":[\"What are the reviews of Trezor Safe 5?\"],\"rRg9uW\":[\"Hide \",[\"headline\"],\" hint\"],\"rUG7PZ\":[[\"deviceCount\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[\"1 Trezor model\"],\"other\":[[\"deviceCount\"],\" Trezor models\"]}]],\"rXAhbH\":[\"Qi2-compatible for effortless power-up\"],\"rXo4Px\":[\"1000s\"],\"rY/X4c\":[\"Buy, manage \u0026 stake your \",[\"name\"],\" with the Trezor Suite app\"],\"rZy+kz\":[\"Close message\"],\"radz2q\":[\"Protect card illustration\"],\"reQs2v\":[\"Only you can access your assets—no banks, no exchanges, no governments, not even Trezor company.\"],\"rfx9JJ\":[\"Confirmo overpaid\"],\"rgal4H\":[\"Start easy\"],\"rjGI/Q\":[\"Privacy\"],\"rjZpLn\":[\"Learn\"],\"rkMrMk\":[\"Feedback helps us prioritize. Together we make the Trezor ecosystem better.\"],\"rnlbQG\":[\"\u003c0\u003e2.5\\\"\u003c/0\u003e High-res color display\"],\"roWgcK\":[\"Trezor Safe 5 hardware wallet connected to a laptop via USB cable, placed on a wooden desk next to a recovery seed card with handwritten seed words.\"],\"rpCHxp\":[\"Behind-the-Scenes\"],\"rsJ3PQ\":[[\"name\"],\" color variant\"],\"rsS+vg\":[\"No. You need access to a computer with an internet connection to attend your Trezor Expert Onboarding Session. When it’s time, click the \\\"Join your session\\\" link in your email on your computer, with your Trezor device in hand.\"],\"rtFDeO\":[\"Durable PC-ABS plastic, tamper-evident casing, anodized aluminum backplates, and intricate laser engraving\"],\"rtliGT\":[\"Share your referral link—your friends save 10% on their first order over $49, and you'll earn $20 for each successful purchase.\"],\"rvZcrg\":[\"We currently ship to over 200 countries and territories, during checkout you can choose your country from a drop down list. However, if you do not find your country on the list, then we suggest you check out one of our authorized resellers as our delivery providers are unable to provide delivery options to your country. This helps our customers avoid high customs and or import fees. We recommend only purchasing your Trezor device from an authorized official reseller as we cannot guarantee your device is genuine if purchased from an unauthorized reseller.\"],\"rwr6np\":[\"Real people, \u003c0\u003ereal words\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"rwrYrv\":[\"\u003c0\u003eAvoid any fraud or harm\u003c/0\u003e during your research.\"],\"rxOdv7\":[\"In case you received the wrong item, please, do not open it and let us know, we will manage the return and we will send you the correct one.\"],\"ry4W75\":[\"Search state\"],\"rzHSGO\":[\"Security \u0026 privacy\"],\"s+sAiE\":[\"Compatible with third-party wallet apps\"],\"s/UThb\":[\"Customizable Redundancy\"],\"s/tED3\":[\"No results found for \\\"\",[\"term\"],\"“\"],\"s1NAiq\":[\"Sell \u0026 swap\"],\"s3ii89\":[\"\u003c0\u003eThird-party\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ewallet apps\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"s3jiPG\":[\"Manage your coins \u0026 tokens on your Trezor with \u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite app\u003c/0\u003e or your preferred wallet app.\"],\"s4lAQG\":[\"Trezor uses a durable casing made from a PC/ABS engineering thermoplastic blend, designed for long-lasting durability. The button construction is engineered to withstand over 200,000 clicks, while the OLED screen delivers stunning visuals with deep blacks, ensuring an effortless and legible user experience.\"],\"s6wTIa\":[\"Simply connect your Trezor to your device and you'll be able to start using the Trezor Suite app in minutes.\"],\"s7WMcc\":[\"59x32x7.4 mm / 14 g\u003c0/\u003e2.3x1.3x0.3 in / 0.5 oz\"],\"sDOD2d\":[\"Advanced Multi-share Backup\"],\"sDkVDU\":[\"Support | Trezor Knowledge Base\"],\"sE+XRR\":[\"Apt/suite (optional)\"],\"sFAUEn\":[\"Placed on\"],\"sGDyyf\":[\"Relevant topics\"],\"sGSZ9J\":[\"Close filter\"],\"sIE0mx\":[\"Bitcoin-only hardware wallet\"],\"sKW/+B\":[\"Manage your assets and private keys with ease, ensuring your cryptocurrency is secure after each trade.\"],\"sL+G1h\":[\"You can also check out the Trezor packaging timeline for your device \u003c0\u003eTrezor Model One\u003c/0\u003e or \u003c1\u003eTrezor Model T\u003c/1\u003e. There's a possibility that you might have received an older version of the package.\"],\"sQSA9P\":[\"From design to device, \u003c0/\u003eyou're protected \u003c1\u003eall the way\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"sQqk/C\":[\"Bluetooth convenience. Easy wireless charging.\"],\"sRgAn2\":[\"Show tooltip\"],\"sSQGGN\":[\"Collection of popular cryptocurrency coins supported by Trezor Suite app - top view\"],\"sT2PVj\":[\"A wallet backup, also known as a seed phrase or recovery seed, is like your wallet’s safety words, a sequence of readable words to backup up and recover your wallet. Private key, on the other hand, is your super-secret code, typically a long jumble of characters. It’s what you use to sign transactions and access your crypto stored at a specific address.\"],\"sTYfgm\":[\"toggle only products view\"],\"sVgSws\":[\"Essential\"],\"sXULwc\":[\"PIN\"],\"sY2pkH\":[\"Hardware-backed security for every adventure—DeFi, dApps, NFTs, marketplaces, wallet apps, and more.\"],\"sYaL07\":[\"Crypto management with the Trezor Suite app\"],\"sZAeaM\":[\"Will I have to pay customs fees?\"],\"sZL5Zv\":[\"\u003c0\u003eName or nickname\u003c/0\u003e (optional) – To be included on our list of past issues.\"],\"sa+6Ul\":[\"Partners, socials\"],\"sbqlDS\":[\"Trezor Safe 5 hardware wallet\"],\"sffizq\":[\"cable included\"],\"si+vZD\":[\"Delivery\"],\"skSo7X\":[\"Get a personal 1:1 wallet setup \u003c0/\u003esession with Trezor Expert\"],\"skvpGs\":[\"Yes. The Trezor Safe 7 is compatible with a wide range of third-party dApps such as Aave, Uniswap, and Polymarket, as well as popular software wallets including Rabby, MetaMask, Backpack, and more. Through WalletConnect, it creates a secure, encrypted connection between your wallet and apps, keeping your private keys safely on your device while letting you approve transactions directly.\"],\"smJHV4\":[\"Zip / Postal code cannot be shorter than 3 characters\"],\"snIvR4\":[\"Please enter phone number\"],\"sr56Jv\":[\"Back up your wallet in one easy step and restore access anytime if your wallet is lost, stolen, or damaged.\"],\"ssuh52\":[\"Found a bug?\"],\"sxcUOT\":[\"Protection against dust \u0026 water splashes\"],\"syWzbL\":[\"Passphrase\"],\"t17P0Z\":[\"No—as long as you keep the wallet backup you make during setup, your crypto is safe. You can restore your entire wallet onto a new Trezor device using that wallet backup, also called a recovery phrase. It’s like having a secure recovery key. Just make sure to keep your wallet backup stored safely offline, and never share it with anyone.\"],\"t3xu/s\":[\"\u003c0\u003eKeep sensitive info\u003c/0\u003e such as your PIN or wallet backup safe. Trezor Expert will never ask for it.\"],\"t54lHd\":[\"Simply enter your backup on another Trezor hardware wallet and instantly gain access to your funds.\"],\"t7n471\":[\"We couldn’t process your payment of \u003c0\u003e\",[\"price\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e with \u003c1\u003e\",[\"paymentType\"],\"\u003c/1\u003e for your order \u003c2\u003e#\",[\"orderNumber\"],\"\u003c/2\u003e.\"],\"t8nwtv\":[\"How to buy and sell Bitcoin in Trezor Suite app\"],\"t9GOV2\":[\"Read more about SLIP39 multi-share backups on Trezor\"],\"t9U8JC\":[\"Yes—even if you’re starting with a small amount, protecting it now can pay off later. Crypto is a long-term game, and what’s worth a few hundred dollars today could be worth significantly more in the future. A hardware wallet like Trezor ensures that no matter how your holdings grow, they’re safe from day one.\"],\"tA+gEd\":[\"Export your transactions into CSV, PDF, and other formats in Trezor Suite app.\"],\"tFb5nH\":[\"\u003c0\u003e0.96\\\"\u003c/0\u003e Monochromatic display\"],\"tH+PyE\":[\"Celebrate Love and Security This Valentine’s Day with discounted Trezor bundles—perfect for gifting and sharing with loved ones. Enjoy savings of 10-50% on a variety of bundles!\"],\"tInRaK\":[\"Check balances, buy, \u0026 receive crypto\\t\"],\"tLw2/1\":[\"Recover card illustration\"],\"tQX9of\":[\"Wallet app\"],\"tRkC3M\":[\"CPF validation service is unavailable. Try again later.\"],\"tRxyew\":[\"All articles\"],\"tUXs35\":[\"\u003c0\u003eSecure Element\u003c/0\u003e protected\"],\"tV+XgD\":[\"Scratch \u0026 impact resistant glass surface\"],\"tXv55Q\":[\"Hold up! Something’s jamming the signal!\"],\"tYsgd0\":[\"Remain confident about your funds even in the event of device loss, theft, or damage.\"],\"tZJalV\":[\"Set the level of security to recover your wallet\"],\"tdDsZS\":[\"Pure bitcoin signal with no distractions, no extra features, no extra code — nothing but bitcoin.\"],\"te+npi\":[\"View your portfolio history\"],\"teZ55F\":[\"The Company\"],\"teb675\":[\"Work with your finances exactly how you want. Take a true hands-on approach \u0026 literally carry access to your assets wherever you go.\"],\"tkpJGr\":[\"Trezor support\"],\"tplK9q\":[\"Phone number is invalid\"],\"tps9OC\":[\"Buy, sell, swap \u0026 stake\"],\"tqG0/W\":[\"All \u003c0\u003eTrezor\u003c/0\u003e models\"],\"tsn/RR\":[\"Payment failed. Let’s try again.\"],\"tsnNBI\":[\"How much and what kind of support can I expect from the program?\"],\"tx0Kjw\":[\"Learn from the Experts\"],\"txOMDz\":[\"Bigger than Trezor Safe 5\"],\"txvPHZ\":[\"Introducing\"],\"tzPzzU\":[\"Quantum ready architecture abstraction with Trezor logo\"],\"tzwBsb\":[\"Trusted by over 2 million users worldwide\"],\"u04JaP\":[\"Take your wallet backup to the next level\"],\"u1AeHS\":[\"Press \u0026 Media, Brand Manual \u0026 Trezor Academy | Trezor\"],\"u1fFuL\":[\"Revolutionary Secure Element chip\"],\"u3kNd7\":[\"Rated excellent 4.5 \u003c0\u003eout of 5\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"u4E09E\":[\"Make it more difficult to trace your internet activity with Tor, an open-source software that enables anonymous communication.\"],\"u5OYbT\":[\"Two smartphones displaying Trezor promotional emails. The left phone shows a message about free worldwide shipping on all purchases made until 15 December, with a green “Shop now” button. The right phone announces Trezor’s biggest sale of the year starting on 20 November, featuring deals on hardware wallets and accessories. Both screens have the Trezor logo at the top.\"],\"u6Mj1W\":[\"Send \u0026 receive your \",[\"name\"],\" \",[\"withText\"]],\"u7D6Qr\":[\"Building financial independence\"],\"u7w4kJ\":[\"Go to learn\"],\"u9aIYU\":[\"What's the difference between Trezor Safe 5 and Trezor Safe 3?\"],\"uEGEeN\":[\"Simplify your wallet backup\"],\"uHoLQm\":[\"Learn how your Trezor is designed to securely store and manage your digital assets.\"],\"uIZ2tg\":[\"Share link\"],\"uKuDDq\":[\"Compatible with \u003c0\u003ethird-party wallet apps\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"uLD0qU\":[\"Getting Started is Easy\"],\"uOChrg\":[\"\u003c0\u003e\",[\"state\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e \u003c1\u003e(Fix on GitHub)\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"uOKOX0\":[\"Logos of Web3 dApps including Uniswap, Jupiter, Balancer, Lido, Aave, Pump.fun, OpenSea, and 1inch.\"],\"uOnP2A\":[\"We are currently not running any long-term official promotional campaign. We always announce these on our socials or newsletter, which you can sign up \u003c0\u003ehere\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"uPPVGg\":[\"Move crypto to Trezor\"],\"uPo3PQ\":[\"See less\"],\"uTSpTI\":[\"Trezor Suite works with all Trezor models. Check them out if you don't have one.\"],\"uU7Z3d\":[\"Some models\"],\"uUIBGt\":[\"Delivery takes place within 3 to 5 business days after the order is processed and the package has been dispatched. Packages are fully trackable and can be traced \u003c0\u003ehere\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"uUh3nq\":[\"How to \u003c0\u003e\",[\"coinCode\"],\" on Trezor\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"uVUtmS\":[\"What are cookies, What cookies do you use, What choices do you have, The list of used cookies.\"],\"uVtDQA\":[\"Easily recover your wallet \u0026 assets\"],\"uWQGk6\":[\"Trezor user\"],\"uY5bvH\":[\"Dialog\"],\"uYUKaA\":[\"A symbol of freedom.\"],\"uZSPud\":[\"Security from day one\"],\"uauIAK\":[\"Friends get 10% off their first order over $49, and you’ll earn $20 for every successful referral. Everyone wins!\"],\"ubhuI+\":[\"Choose the Bitcoin-only Trezor Safe 7 for a hardware wallet that’s as devoted to Bitcoin as you are. Built for true Bitcoiners and OGs, it delivers a focused, distraction-free experience with firmware, interface, and performance designed entirely for Bitcoin, not altcoins. Every element reflects our commitment to Bitcoin’s mission of financial freedom and transparency—no compromises, just pure Bitcoin security.\"],\"uc+AhT\":[\"You don’t truly own your coins\"],\"ue1+cO\":[\"Robust protection against potential threats and vulnerabilities\"],\"uez40j\":[\"A Trezor Expert Onboarding Session is for individuals seeking hands-on hardware wallet setup, basic training, security insights, and a confidence boost with their Trezor device in a live, personalized session led by a certified Trezor guru.\"],\"uh9rPn\":[\"Payment is unavailable. Please try again later.\"],\"uhgyWh\":[\"Contact Trezor Support\"],\"uhzoNc\":[[\"remainingCount\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[\"Show more product (\",[\"remainingCount\"],\")\"],\"other\":[\"Show more products (\",[\"remainingCount\"],\")\"]}]],\"ukVU/Q\":[\"Transparent wallet design makes your Trezor better and safer\"],\"ulwKC8\":[\"If your order arrived damaged or incomplete, please let us know and we will be able to solve that for you as well.\"],\"umtRqc\":[\"Grab your Trezor device, plug it in, open Trezor Suite, and let your crypto journey begin! Forget about the tech jargon, we speak your language.\"],\"unegYI\":[\"Some contact information is missing. You haven’t been charged. Please return to the previous step to complete all required contact details.\"],\"uovPB9\":[\"Find out how a hardware wallet works \u0026 why every crypto owner should have one.\"],\"upHHl7\":[\"Don’t trust, verify\"],\"updfrI\":[\"Discount Use\"],\"uquWty\":[\"Dependable device protection\"],\"ur+kSY\":[\"To use a third-party wallet app with Trezor, start by connecting your Trezor hardware wallet to your computer and unlocking it with your PIN. Next, select a compatible third-party wallet app, such as MetaMask or Electrum. In the app, choose the option to connect a hardware wallet and follow the prompts to pair your Trezor device.\"],\"urBKH3\":[\"Your crypto is 100% under your control with Trezor. Only you hold the keys, so no one else can access, take, or spend it.\"],\"uuBxT1\":[\"\u003c0\u003eThe Everest of\u003c/0\u003ewallet \u003c1\u003ebackup security\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"uuCXD+\":[\"MicroSD card slot\"],\"uvxUny\":[\"What wallets does Trezor work with besides Trezor Suite?\"],\"uxVHXU\":[\"PIN protection\"],\"uyqgW6\":[\"Interested in learning more about SLIP-39?\"],\"v+6GRN\":[\"Transfer your coin\"],\"v+NGM1\":[\"Your Freedom Edition purchase contributes $10 to educate people in economically disadvantaged regions, supporting local teachers who show how Bitcoin can be used for real-world solutions. Together, we’re fixing broken financial systems and enabling freedom through education.\"],\"v1EDK1\":[\"Countries where Trezor Academy has been active include:\"],\"v7EYZE\":[\"Perfection in every pixel\"],\"v7UKXg\":[\"Our experts can help all levels of Trezor owners master their wallet security \u0026 coin management—from new users to seasoned HODLers.\"],\"v89hkp\":[\"Easily buy thousands of coins and tokens. Trezor Suite app automatically compares multiple providers to secure the best deal for you.\"],\"v9VBYq\":[\"How can I modify or cancel my order?\"],\"v9eNtX\":[\"\u003c0\u003eUse Trezor with\u003c/0\u003e30+ wallet apps\"],\"vA/dOv\":[\"Sync \u0026 Track on Your Phone\"],\"vA9nt4\":[\"Wallet apps\"],\"vCuCWE\":[\"Please check the payment data. Payment was invalid.\"],\"vCy3Vc\":[\"After completing your order on the Trezor Shop, you’ll get a purchase confirmation email with a link to schedule your session. Select a date and time from the available options, and you’ll soon be on your way.\"],\"vF1PS3\":[\"Rated excellent \",[\"TRUSTPILOT_TRUST_SCORE\"],\" \u003c0\u003eout of 5\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"vGWUbu\":[\"Watch guide\"],\"vH2C/2\":[\"Swap\"],\"vHJJAF\":[\"Trezor is built on open-source security, with code that’s fully transparent and reviewed by experts worldwide. Unlike custodial wallets or exchanges, Trezor gives you true cold storage with offline keys that never leave your device.\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1/\u003eFeatures such as an optional passphrase, phishing protection, community verification, and Tropic01—the world’s first transparent and auditable Secure Element—deliver next-gen protection that’s purpose-built for self-custody. And the new Trezor Safe 7, the first-ever hardware wallet with quantum-ready security, gives crypto owners the strongest foundation for safe and independent control of their assets for the future.\"],\"vIPFxA\":[\"Creating a secure ecosystem\"],\"vIf89Q\":[\"The world's first transparent and auditable Secure Element, TROPIC01, sets a completely new standard for crypto security through radical transparency.\"],\"vJ0hjc\":[\"Hand\"],\"vK7Xf+\":[\"Save with bundles\"],\"vKEATp\":[\"Crypto hardware wallets built on 12+ years of innovation\"],\"vKNbxO\":[\"\u003c0\u003ePlease contact \u003c1\u003eTrezor support\u003c/1\u003e via our \u003c2\u003echatbot Hal\u003c/2\u003e if you have received an incorrect, faulty or damaged item.\u003c/0\u003ePlease include your invoice along with some photos if the product is damaged. If the product is faulty, attaching a short video is also helpful in speeding up the RMA process.\"],\"vKVBbl\":[\"\u003c0\u003eAll Trezor devices are distributed without firmware installed\u003c/0\u003e - It will be installed during the initial setup. The setup process will check if firmware has already been installed on the device. If firmware is detected then the device should not be used.\"],\"vLSw0s\":[\"The TROPIC01 is the world’s first Secure Element open to anyone to audit and verify exactly how it protects your bitcoin, delivering the most advanced hardware security and radically transparent bitcoin protection ever created.\"],\"vNMynr\":[\"A tracking ID is assigned to your order once the order status is “shipped”.\"],\"vSCMsB\":[\"Currently, Trezor does not support \u003c0\u003e\",[\"name\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e. However, many other assets are supported. You can check the full list \u003c1\u003ehere\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"vSJd18\":[\"Video\"],\"vTA+DN\":[\"Reward\"],\"vTXmOd\":[\"E-mail validation failed\"],\"vULqcY\":[\"“Trezor Expert made it so easy. The one-on-one session with Daria was incredibly helpful, and I now understand self-custody and feel confident doing it.”\"],\"vUifWn\":[\"Sign up for rewards\"],\"vVerBh\":[\"Built into all models\"],\"vXIe7J\":[\"Language\"],\"vXzlKl\":[\"The Trezor Safe 7 is not just another hardware wallet. It is built for transparency, usability, and long-term security. With dual Secure Elements, a full-color intuitive touchscreen, wireless and wired options, open-source firmware, and a quantum-ready foundation, you stay in charge of your assets and privacy without relying on hidden components or closed NDAs. Advanced backup options, including multi-share Backup and Passphrase Protection, give you extra control and peace of mind, ensuring your funds are always protected.\"],\"vYNLFY\":[\"Refer a friend—\u003c0\u003eget $20\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"vZH6Hh\":[\"Trezor Expert\"],\"vZgycE\":[\"FREE\"],\"vb40kv\":[\"X logo\"],\"vbZMfo\":[\"All-in-one bitcoin app\"],\"vbtoWL\":[\"Get a backup built for life\"],\"vcQwyD\":[\"Edit contact info\"],\"vcdyGn\":[\"Sign up to get your unique referral link.\"],\"vdnZ+X\":[\"Trezor devices are compatible with popular third-party wallet apps like MetaMask, Rabby, Electrum, Exodus, and Wasabi. However, Trezor Suite is recommended for the most seamless and secure experience since it’s built specifically for Trezor hardware.\"],\"vdrrtD\":[\"Connect your Trezor hardware wallet to your computer or mobile device and follow the setup steps.\"],\"vgPmRQ\":[\"Set up within minutes.\"],\"vgR34E\":[\"Protect your crypto for life\"],\"vi1vnp\":[\"Bigger than Safe 5\"],\"vjJE8N\":[[\"count\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[\"More result (\",[\"count\"],\")\"],\"other\":[\"More results (\",[\"count\"],\")\"]}]],\"vmANlN\":[\"Your referral link\u003c0\u003e\",[\"referralLink\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"vmwuZm\":[\"All Trezor models\"],\"vnw7cx\":[\"Trezor Keep\"],\"vpWU9N\":[\"Learn \u0026 Support\"],\"vujQJ5\":[\"Localization\"],\"vxRQ9V\":[\"Decrease Quantity\"],\"vxkpL/\":[\"\u003c0\u003e1.54\\\"\u003c/0\u003e Color display\"],\"vyPRqp\":[\"More articles (\",[\"count\"],\")\"],\"w/uQCF\":[\"\u003c0\u003ethe package does not leave country of origin within ten days\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ethe package does not appear on the destination country's tracking service within 21 days\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eno update in status for 21 days\u003c/2\u003e\"],\"w0XE8s\":[[\"name\"],\" logo\"],\"w24fOo\":[\"Resellers\"],\"w31rg5\":[\"2020+ models\"],\"w3d0YK\":[\"Receive clear, accurate answers to your most important questions during a live, 1:1 session with a Trezor Expert.\"],\"w3nYsM\":[\"How to choose\"],\"w4Dtzm\":[\"Storing your bitcoin online? Risky move, my friend. Those online exchanges? Hacker magnets. Always trying to break in and cause chaos. But hey, behold the Trezor Safe 5 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet! It’s your bitcoin fortress—offline and super secure. Your bitcoin safe and sound.\"],\"w5h8Gz\":[\"Loading buy button\"],\"w5siCJ\":[\"Use voucher\"],\"w5zqUB\":[\"Please enter a valid e-mail address\"],\"w6ePGO\":[\"Lost your Trezor? Don’t worry—your funds are safe if you have your wallet backup. Just set up a new Trezor and enter the wallet backup words you wrote down during setup. Make sure your backup is stored safely—without it, you won’t be able to recover your assets.\"],\"w8TGQu\":[\"In 2013, SatoshiLabs created the BIP-39 standard, widely adopted by wallets today. As the next iteration in self-custody security, we are moving towards SLIP-39 as the default wallet backup standard in Trezor. We are offering a Bounty Program to onboard early adopters of SLIP-39 and the multi-share backup feature.\"],\"w8TgRX\":[\"Your coins aren’t tied to any company\"],\"wADKu8\":[\"115x25 mm / 330 g\u003c0/\u003e4.5x1.0 in / 11.6 oz\"],\"wAN8lj\":[\"Wallet setup isn’t currently available on iPhone. Visit this page on your computer.\"],\"wBdmV/\":[\"Visit Trezor Academy\"],\"wE/MLZ\":[\"A hardware wallet is a physical device that gives you security and complete ownership of your crypto.\"],\"wEPr6k\":[\"Learn more about what a hardware wallet is on a separate page\"],\"wEZDJm\":[\"I'd like to receive the Trezor newsletter.\"],\"wFMqSS\":[\"Trezor supports a wide range of cryptocurrencies, including bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, and many altcoins, offering flexibility for diverse portfolios.\"],\"wHmS+S\":[\"Spotify logo\"],\"wLw99w\":[\"You can utilize a passphrase which is required each time you access your Trezor wallet, adding an additional layer of protection.\"],\"wOKrb0\":[\"For inquiries about Trezor, including the latest news and products, please contact our spokesperson, Jiří Kroulík, at \u003c0\u003epress@trezor.io\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"wQOg6Y\":[\"Bitcoin is the most resilient cryptocurrency available. Our products are designed to make Bitcoin approachable \u0026 user-friendly.\"],\"wVMRoW\":[\"Save big with bundles\"],\"wWbtyr\":[\"You've got a 10% discount from a friend! Copy the code below and apply it at checkout on orders of $49 or more.\"],\"wXOUlN\":[\"Payment \u0026 Prices\"],\"wXn60l\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor's support team went way beyond\u003c/0\u003e my expectations. It's clear they understand what true customer obsession means. Unlike many companies that disappear after making a sale, Trezor does the exact opposite — they stay engaged, helpful, and genuinely committed to your experience. Their dedication to service is rare and refreshing. I highly recommend them!\"],\"wXnG2y\":[\"Ultimate\"],\"wYFhNY\":[\"Dual Secure Element protection\"],\"wZOY8W\":[\"Trezor logo\"],\"wZWUSQ\":[\"What assets does Trezor Suite app support?\"],\"wa5rER\":[\"However, the Freedom Edition is for those who:\"],\"waLOUb\":[\"Enter phone number\"],\"waaJlU\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 Dual Secure Element Protection \"],\"wblZJE\":[\"Increased privacy with coin control\"],\"wdb832\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 resting in a leather tray\"],\"weuhlN\":[\"Insufficient amount\"],\"wev+HG\":[\"\u003c0\u003eYes, most Trezor products can be refunded as long as they are returned in the same condition they were sold, i.e. they haven't been opened, damaged or used.\u003c/0\u003eFor detailed information about how to return an item and situations in which a return will not be possible, please check the terms of our refund policy, which you can read under section 7 of our Trezor \u003c1\u003eEshop Terms of Use\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"wewoPO\":[\"Buy, sell \u0026 manage your \",[\"name\"],\" with the Trezor Suite app\"],\"whOOpR\":[\"Keeping your wallet backup safe and sound offline is super important when you’re dealing with stuff like bitcoin, Ethereum, and other cryptocurrencies. This way, you can chill without worrying about hackers, hardware issues, or tricky social tricks messing with your coins. It’s all about safeguarding your privacy and providing long-term resilience.\"],\"wiEk0O\":[\"Storing your bitcoin online can be pretty risky, you know? Online exchanges are like magnets for hackers, and they're always trying to break in and mess things up. But check this out—the Trezor Safe 3 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet is like a fortress for your bitcoin. It's offline and super secure, so your bitcoin are safe and sound.\"],\"wiZj7D\":[\"Why choose a Bitcoin-only Trezor over the universal Trezor Safe 7?\"],\"wjgiTz\":[\"Designed for 20-word wallet backup for all crypto hardware wallets\"],\"wkW0Od\":[\"Passphrase- \u0026 PIN-entry protection\"],\"wmq9mv\":[\"Can I reschedule my session?\"],\"wo/BGs\":[\"Cold storage using a secure element that keeps your private keys isolated and offline at all times.\"],\"wp2GiT\":[\"The card number you entered is invalid. Please check the number and try again.\"],\"wp3awd\":[\"Discover the app\"],\"wqPByX\":[\"The magic happens at our Prague offices where ideas flourish, becoming practical concepts and prototypes. Through rigorous cycles of development, testing, and iteration, only the finest earn the Trezor name.\"],\"wudrDZ\":[\"City cannot be longer than \",[\"cityLength\"],\" characters\"],\"wxYPHW\":[\"  2.5\\\"\"],\"wyKXHb\":[\"Install Trezor Suite\"],\"x+r0be\":[\"Why should you read this document, Definitions, What is Trezor Expert, Services, Booking the session, During the session, Warranties and liability, Personal Data, Communication, Law and Jurisdiction.\"],\"x+sUBb\":[\"Send \u0026 receive\"],\"x1ej4v\":[\"Trezor Suite app links your Trezor hardware wallet to the crypto world — safely and seamlessly.\"],\"x4OBDv\":[\"Protect your device with a PIN up to 50 digits\"],\"x4YaTN\":[\"Your crypto offline and untouchable\"],\"x4a/qw\":[\"Compatible with third-party apps\"],\"x4cQar\":[\"Trezor Academy is a global initiative dedicated to providing free Bitcoin education, empowering individuals to take control of their financial futures. By focusing on regions where financial freedom and education are most needed, Trezor Academy helps spread Bitcoin adoption and knowledge, ensuring that everyone, regardless of their circumstances, has access to the tools for financial independence. It’s completely free to attend.\"],\"x4mxQa\":[\"Get your Trezor\"],\"x6DMGN\":[\"Make yourself comfy in a \u003c0\u003equiet, private space (free from onlookers)\u003c/0\u003e with a stable connection.\"],\"x6IJvs\":[\"Knowledge base\"],\"x7Kphh\":[\"Tracking number (optional)\"],\"x7cKdg\":[\"I’d like to join the Trezor Refer-A-Friend rewards program and agree to the \u003c0\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/0\u003e, the \u003c1\u003eRefer-A-Friend Program Terms \u0026 Conditions\u003c/1\u003e and the \u003c2\u003eGeneral Terms of Use\u003c/2\u003e.\"],\"x8n0ec\":[\"Go sleek with the Model T touchscreen or get physical with Model One for a budget solution. Trezor your way.\"],\"xARboq\":[\"Connect your hardware wallet with Trezor Suite.\"],\"xAj60C\":[\"Create Multiple Wallets\"],\"xE8Q+w\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Blog\u003c/0\u003e: important announcements, updates and news are published regularly on our blog.\"],\"xEEyFt\":[\"Our philosophy\"],\"xHvmOr\":[\"\u003c0\u003eManage your crypto\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ein Trezor Suite\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"xIBIp9\":[\"This is a temporary issue on our side. Try again later or contact Trezor Support by replying to our last email.\"],\"xJ/WcX\":[\"Start earning\"],\"xKbcbJ\":[\"Limited iOS compatibility\"],\"xMU7sZ\":[\"Quantum-ready protection\"],\"xNACCI\":[\"Secure Bluetooth for mobile and desktop, plus magnetic Qi charging. No cables, no compromises — your wallet is always ready, anywhere you go.\"],\"xNB0TS\":[\"Sell\"],\"xOUCt3\":[\"Other options\"],\"xQMwMx\":[\"trezor devices\"],\"xRGQrW\":[\"Yes! The Trezor Expert Consultation is designed for your privacy and security. No private data is shared during the session. Only the voice of the Trezor Expert is recorded for liability purposes.\"],\"xRbdX1\":[\"\u003c0\u003eStore your wallet backup in a secure location\u003c/0\u003e. Never save or put it anywhere digital.\"],\"xSnH1C\":[\"Quantum ready sticker\"],\"xUgUTh\":[\"Enter first name\"],\"xUwm/5\":[\"Set up a hidden wallet.\"],\"xXo9ax\":[\"We’re a mixed bag of crypto enthusiasts, design gurus, security genies, and true believers in the Bitcoin movement. We also like cold beer, good food, and making the most out of each day.\"],\"xaEGHD\":[\"My package is stuck/lost, what should I do?\"],\"xaw6D8\":[\"Like Trezor? \u003c0\u003eGet one here!\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"xccxhJ\":[\"To add your review of Trezor to Trustpilot, please share your name, read the terms below, and click through.\"],\"xfL3rO\":[\"Learn how we process your data in our \u003c0\u003eTerms of service\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"xh7FGs\":[\"Promotions\"],\"xiI1Hx\":[\"Come what may, you're\u003c0/\u003eprotected all the way\"],\"xnw6s3\":[[\"averageDeliveryDays\",\"plural\",{\"one\":[\"Get it within \",[\"averageDeliveryDays\"],\" business day\"],\"other\":[\"Get it within \",[\"averageDeliveryDays\"],\" business days\"]}]],\"xqQ0dv\":[\"The gold standard for wallet security is still @Trezor. Open source, hardened, trusted with billions...\"],\"xrLnkL\":[\"Get the best value for your trades with our advanced algorithms that compare offers across multiple exchanges.\"],\"xrRuxc\":[\"Please enter name\"],\"xs0epm\":[\"Questions about your order?\"],\"xtLQ4W\":[\"Set up your Trezor\"],\"xtQzag\":[\"Order details\"],\"xtuTdb\":[\"\u003c0\u003eYour feedback is\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003epriceless\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"xv630Z\":[\"Discover Trezor \u0026 Secure Your Crypto\"],\"xxdx8r\":[\"Secure wireless connectivity across mobile, desktop \u0026 tablet.\"],\"xzJicF\":[\"How do I prepare for the session?\"],\"y/lXFm\":[\"Go to Trezor forum\"],\"y02+zg\":[\"Go to coins list\"],\"y0Wfbx\":[\"Standard shipping usually takes 2 to 7 business days (up to 14 days for island addresses) after the order has shipped.\"],\"y0mia4\":[\"Order is being returned\"],\"y1eoq1\":[\"Copy link\"],\"y30k02\":[\"Stuck? We’ve got you covered.\"],\"y3U0H7\":[\"As stated in \u003c0\u003eTrezor Terms of Use\u003c/0\u003e - How to place your order, section 3.4, you are solely responsible for any information listed during the order placement procedure, including, but not limited to, the email address, shipping address, and the amount and specification of the ordered products.\"],\"y4OQvW\":[\"Why you need one\"],\"y4pCD8\":[\"Contains: \"],\"y5p2bQ\":[\"Did you know?\"],\"y6H67c\":[\"Trezor Safe 7 is the only hardware wallet using post-quantum cryptography \u003c0\u003eto secure firmware updates, device authentication, and the boot process, protecting your wallet against future quantum computing threats.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"y6jj1A\":[\"At Trezor, transparency and security are our top priorities. Our hardware wallets and software are open source and publicly available, having undergone audits by independent security researchers for many years. By embracing open source principles and actively collaborating with our community, we continually strengthen the safeguards protecting Trezor devices, software, and infrastructure.\"],\"y771gT\":[\"Buy, sell \u0026 manage your \",[\"name\"],\" \",[\"withText\"]],\"y7XCjv\":[\"If you are interested in more information in the meantime, please read our \u003c0\u003eterms of use\u003c/0\u003e or visit our \u003c1\u003esupport page\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"y8ZaVB\":[\"Right now, you should ideally buy a new Trezor hardware wallet and recover it there. Alternatively, you can recover access in another hardware wallet or use available software wallets like Rabby, Electrum, and BlueWallet for Bitcoin, but they possess the risks of every hot wallet. Later on, we are sure more alternatives will emerge in the market.\"],\"y9Qz+d\":[\"Works with Model One\"],\"yB1YpA\":[\"Dark mode\"],\"yCfE1o\":[\"Table of Contents\"],\"yCvmdD\":[\"\u003c0\u003e\u003c1\u003eTake control\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2/\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c3\u003e\u003c4/\u003e\u003c5\u003ewith trezor\u003c/5\u003e\u003c/3\u003e\"],\"yD1swL\":[\"This Trezor Safe 3 Bitcoin-only wallet is exclusively designed for the Bitcoin-only operations, guaranteeing a flawless experience with all functions and features geared towards the efficient management of Bitcoin accounts and transactions. The universal Trezor Safe 3 wallet supports Bitcoin transactions as well as 1000s of other coins and tokens.\"],\"yFIEj6\":[\"Democratic Republic of the Congo\"],\"yHRjuY\":[\"Unavailable in selected country. Remove item to continue to checkout.\"],\"yHTP2M\":[\"How the program works, Eligibility criteria, Referral process, Rewards and limits, Sharing referral links, Restrictions on use, Conditions for referred friends, Prohibited activities, Program violations and termination, Tax obligations, Legal information.\"],\"yJcImm\":[\"What is Trezor, Why should you read this document, Who collects your personal data, What personal data do we process, Why do we process your personal data, For how long will we process your personal data, Who will have access to your personal data, How are your personal data protected, Do we use cookies, What are your rights in relation to personal data protection.\"],\"yKyhuu\":[\"Learn about how a hardware wallet works (6:21)\"],\"yLa3bE\":[\"You're responsible for any taxes or reporting obligations related to your rewards.\"],\"yN4lEQ\":[\"10+ years of real decisions without compromise\"],\"yOBSVL\":[\"Crisp details, vivid colors, 700 nits of brightness\"],\"yOjr3P\":[\"Blurry rear view of a man holding a smartphone in his left hand and a Trezor Safe 7 hardware wallet in his right hand.\"],\"yPpTuS\":[\"When will my order arrive?\"],\"yQ2kGp\":[\"Load more\"],\"yQ6XYO\":[\"All-glass surface with increased shatter-protection\"],\"yQBq7+\":[\"Use with your favorite wallets and dApps\"],\"yQE2r9\":[\"Loading\"],\"ySloZj\":[\"MagSafe \u0026 Qi2 compatible for effortless power-up\"],\"yVdap4\":[\"As a security measure, Trezor devices have no serial numbers. What you see on the box of your Trezor is a serial number of the packaging, used to identify specific batches of packaging in case of packaging error.\u003c0\u003eNot sure If your device is genuine?\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eIf you are concerned that your Trezor is not a genuine product from our company, please refer to this \u003c2\u003eblog article\u003c/2\u003e, where you will find information about how to distinguish between an original and a fake Trezor.\u003c/1\u003eYou can also check out the Trezor packaging timeline for your device \u003c3\u003eTrezor Model One\u003c/3\u003e or \u003c4\u003eTrezor Model T\u003c/4\u003e. There's a possibility that you might have received an older version of the package.\"],\"yVnFt2\":[\"You've the maximum allowed amount in your cart, you can't add more.\"],\"yWH3P0\":[\"Knowledge Base\"],\"yWeC1A\":[\"Own\"],\"yXa0lu\":[\"Connectivity \u0026 power\"],\"yXc11Y\":[\"What is the best cold wallet for crypto?\"],\"yY6lep\":[\"Secure Element safeguards assets in your Trezor hardware wallet from online and offline threats. With a customizable PIN of up to 50 digits, your device remains inaccessible to unauthorized users.\"],\"yaH0Jr\":[\"75.4 mm / 2.97 in\"],\"ybYB+I\":[\"Kickstart with Trezor Expert\"],\"ycOx2j\":[\"Collection of popular cryptocurrency coins supported by Trezor Suite - top view\"],\"yhIA+e\":[\"Seed extraction or injection\"],\"yiI3ll\":[\"“Quantum-ready” wallets are designed to maintain operational reliability and security in the post-quantum future. With quantum-ready architecture and support for quantum-secure firmware updates, you can count on the integrity of your Trezor Safe 7 for years to come.\"],\"yjkIuk\":[\"Open Trezor Suite and go to the buy, sell, or swap section.\"],\"ykRZ/p\":[\"Join Trezor newsletter\"],\"ykzOlu\":[\"FIDO2 for secure \u003c0\u003eauthentication\u003c/0\u003e \"],\"ymfHZE\":[\"160MHz embedded ARM processor (Cortex M33)\"],\"yt+xvA\":[\"What is the Trezor Metal Keep—Shamir Backup?\"],\"ytKWi7\":[\"Plan ahead for wallet recovery\"],\"yw3/Dk\":[\"I’d like to join the Trezor Refer-A-Friend rewards program and agree to the \u003c0\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/0\u003e , the \u003c1\u003eRefer-A-Friend Program Terms \u0026 Conditions\u003c/1\u003e and the \u003c2\u003eGeneral Terms of Use\u003c/2\u003e.\"],\"yx/fMc\":[\"High\"],\"yz7wBu\":[\"Close\"],\"z+gNtq\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Suite app\u003c/0\u003e is a desktop and mobile app that connects to your Trezor, making it easy to securely send, receive, buy, sell, swap, and stake your coins \u0026 tokens—all in one place.\"],\"z+lfze\":[\"Storing anything online is risky. Exchanges, which serve as platforms for trading and storing digital assets, are often attractive targets for hackers, susceptible to security breaches, and a high risk of exposing your personal data, including sensitive info. Trezor Model T is keeps the access to your crypto offline, safe and secure.\"],\"z/3dKO\":[\"Physical and supply chain attacks\"],\"z/AxlF\":[\"How long do crypto hardware wallets last?\"],\"z1tM/L\":[\"Security \u0026 Privacy\"],\"z29OOd\":[\"Go for the Trezor Safe 5 Bitcoin-only hardware wallet for the ultimate Bitcoin experience! Specifically designed for Bitcoin OGs, whales, and enthusiasts, this hardware wallet ensures a seamless journey with specialized operations and features to manage all your Bitcoin accounts and balances.\"],\"z2SlL3\":[\"support page\"],\"z36rKv\":[\"How can I track my package?\"],\"z37oCY\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrezor Forum\u003c/0\u003e: find support agent answers to other users' issues or post a question of your own.\"],\"z4rm8z\":[\"You will need to generate a recovery seed during Trezor setup. This seed is unique, ensuring only you have access to your private keys.\"],\"z81NU4\":[\"Exercise your freedom to buy, sell, trade \u0026 pay with absolute confidence using Trezor hardware wallets \u0026 the Trezor Suite app.\"],\"z8F4/3\":[\"Your email\"],\"zFqzRQ\":[\"Shop Trezor Black Friday crypto deals! Save up to 40% on hardware wallets, bundles, and backups. Secure your coins today. Limited-time offer.\"],\"zFrCGn\":[\"520 x 380 px\"],\"zG0Xyh\":[\"Is there any subscription / monthly fee to use Trez